export const canastaCardGameTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Canasta":"ካናስታ","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta ኦንላይን — ነፃ የ Canasta ካርድ ጨዋታ ከኮምፒውተር ጋር","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"ሁለት-ተጫዋች Canasta በመስመር ላይ ከአገር ውስጥ ኮምፒውተር ጋር ይጫወቱ። ይሳሉ፣ ይቀልጡ፣ ያቀዘቅዙ እና የተጣለበትን ክምር ይውሰዱ፣ ንጹህ ወይም የተደባለቁ ጣሳዎችን ይገንቡ እና የክብ ውጤቱን ይከታተሉ። ፍርይ፤ ካርዶችዎ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ይቆያሉ.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"ሁለት-ተጫዋች ካንስታን በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ያጫውቱ። የማዛመጃ ደረጃዎችን መልሰው ይፍጠሩ፣ ሁለት እና ቀልዶችን እንደ የዱር ካርዶች ይጠቀሙ እና ከመውጣትዎ በፊት የሰባት ካርዶችን ካንስታ ይስሩ።","A quick example":"ፈጣን ምሳሌ","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"ሦስት የተፈጥሮ ነገሥታት ቅልጥፍናን ሊከፍቱ ይችላሉ። በኋለኞቹ ተራዎች ላይ የዚያ ደረጃ ካርዶችን ያክሉ; ሰባት የተፈጥሮ ካርዶች የ 500-ነጥብ ጉርሻ ዋጋ ያለው ንጹህ ካንስታ ያደርጉታል, ከዱር ካርዶች ጋር መቀላቀል ደግሞ የ 300 የጉርሻ ነጥቦች ዋጋ ያለው ድብልቅ ካንስታ ነው.","How to play":"እንዴት መጫወት እንደሚቻል","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"ይህ እትም ሁለት መደበኛ ደርብ እና አራት ቀልዶች (108 ካርዶች)፣ በአንድ ተጫዋች 15 ካርዶች እና ከእያንዳንዱ መዞር የተወሰዱ ሁለት ካርዶችን ይጠቀማል። ቢያንስ ሦስት ካርዶች የአንድ ደረጃ ቀልጠው; ሁለት እና ቀልዶች የዱር ናቸው, ከተፈጥሮ ካርዶች የበለጠ ዱር የሌላቸው. የመጀመሪያው መቀላጠፊያ ለአሁኑ ነጥብዎ የነጥብ ገደብ ማሟላት አለበት። የተጣለ ክምር ሊወሰድ የሚችለው ከከፍተኛ ካርዱ ጋር በሚዛመዱ ሁለት የተፈጥሮ ካርዶች ብቻ ነው። የዱር ካርድ ወይም ጥቁር ሶስት ክምርን ያቀዘቅዘዋል. ለመውጣት ቢያንስ አንድ የሰባት ካርድ ካንስታ ያስፈልግዎታል።","Frequently asked questions":"በተደጋጋሚ የሚጠየቁ ጥያቄዎች","What is a canasta?":"ካንስታ ምንድን ነው?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"ካንስታ የሰባት ወይም ከዚያ በላይ ካርዶች ተመሳሳይ ደረጃ ያለው ድብልቅ ነው። ሰባት የተፈጥሮ ካርዶች ንጹህ ካንስታ (500 ጉርሻ ነጥቦች) ይሠራሉ; የዱር ካርድ የያዘው ድብልቅ (300 ጉርሻ ነጥቦች) ተቀላቅሏል.","How do I take the discard pile?":"የተጣለ ክምርን እንዴት እወስዳለሁ?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"ከላይ ከተጣለው ጋር የሚዛመዱ ሁለት የተፈጥሮ ካርዶችን ይያዙ። የላይኛው ካርዱ የዱር ካርድ ወይም ጥቁር ሶስት ሲሆን ክምርው በረዶ ይሆናል. እንዲሁም በመክፈቻ መስፈርትዎ መሰረት ከላይኛው ካርድ ጋር ህጋዊ መቀላቀል መቻል አለብዎት።","When can I go out?":"መቼ ነው መውጣት የምችለው?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"እጅዎን ባዶ ማድረግ የሚችሉት ከጎንዎ ባለ ሰባት ካርድ ካንስታ ካለው በኋላ ነው። የመጨረሻው ካርድ ተጥሏል; ይህ ስሪት የተደበቀ-እጅ ወይም የአጋር-ፍቃድ ልዩነቶችን አይጠቀምም።","How is the opening meld calculated?":"የመክፈቻው ድብልቅ እንዴት ይሰላል?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"ዝቅተኛው 50 ነጥቦች ከ 1,500 ድምር ነጥቦች በታች, 90 ከ 1,500, 120 ከ 3,000 እና 150 ከ 5,000. ነባር የቀልድ ነጥቦች ወደ አዲስ መክፈቻ አይቆጠሩም።","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"የእኔ ጨዋታ ተሰቅሏል ወይም ተቀምጧል?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"ምንም ጨዋታ አልተሰቀለም። ማስቀመጥ አማራጭ ነው እና በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ የአካባቢ ማከማቻ ይጠቀማል።","Rules and limitations":"ደንቦች እና ገደቦች","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"ይህ ተራ የሁለት-ተጫዋች ልዩነት ከቀላል የአካባቢ ኮምፒውተር ተቃዋሚ እንጂ የመስመር ላይ ባለብዙ ተጫዋች ወይም ቁማር አይደለም። የተለመደው የ 5,000-ነጥብ ዒላማ, የ 15-ካርድ ስምምነት, ባለ ሁለት ካርድ መሳል እና ነጥብ ላይ የተመሰረተ የመክፈቻ ገደቦችን ይጠቀማል. የሰንጠረዥ ደንቦች ይለያያሉ፡ ይህ እትም ለመውጣት የአጋርነት ፍቃድን፣ ልዩ የተደበቁ የእጅ ጉርሻዎችን፣ የቀይ-ሶስት መተኪያ ምርጫዎችን ወይም የብጁ ቤት ህጎችን አይተገበርም። ክምችቱ ሁለት ካርዶችን ማቅረብ ካልቻለ, ዙሩ ተቆጥሯል.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"ለመጫወት ነፃ። በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ የእርስዎ እጅ እና ነጥብ ይቆዩ; ምንም የጨዋታ ውሂብ አይሰቀልም።","Play Canasta":"Canasta ይጫወቱ","Related tools":"ተዛማጅ መሳሪያዎች","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ነጻ · በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይሰራል","Language":"ቋንቋ","UsefulVerse":"ጠቃሚ ቁጥር","All tools":"ሁሉም መሳሪያዎች","New round":"አዲስ ዙር","Play next round":"ቀጣዩን ዙር ይጫወቱ","Resume saved round":"የተቀመጠውን ዙር ከቆመበት ቀጥል","Delete saved round":"የተቀመጠውን ዙር ሰርዝ","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"ዙር ይጀምሩ ወይም የተቀመጠን ከቆመበት ይቀጥሉ።","You":"እርስዎ","Computer":"ኮምፒውተር","Your hand":"የእርስዎ እጅ","Computer cards":"የኮምፒውተር ካርዶች","Stock":"አክሲዮን።","Discard pile":"ክምርን አስወግድ","Your melds":"የእርስዎ መልዶች","Draw two cards":"ሁለት ካርዶችን ይሳሉ","Take discard pile":"የተጣለ ክምር ይውሰዱ","Discard selected card":"የተመረጠውን ካርድ ያስወግዱ","Selected cards":"የተመረጡ ካርዶች","Clear selection":"ምርጫ አጽዳ","Meld rank":"የቀለጠ ደረጃ","Lay down meld":"ቀልጦ ያስቀምጡ","Total score":"ጠቅላላ ነጥብ","Round points":"ክብ ነጥቦች","Opening meld needs":"የመከፈቻ መልድ ፍላጎቶች","Turn":"አዙር","Choose New round to begin.":"ለመጀመር አዲስ ዙር ይምረጡ።","Round started. Draw two cards.":"ዙሩ ተጀመረ። ሁለት ካርዶችን ይሳሉ.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"የእርስዎ ተራ፡ ከስቶክ ሁለት ካርዶችን ይሳሉ ወይም የተጣለ ክምር ይውሰዱ።","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"ከፈለጋችሁ ህጋዊ መልኮችን አስቀምጡ እና አንድ ካርድ ያስወግዱ።","Computer is taking its turn…":"ኮምፒዩተር ተራውን እየወሰደ ነው…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"ሁለት ካርዶች ተሳሉ። ሻጋታዎችን ያድርጉ ወይም ያስወግዱ.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"የተሰራውን ክምር ያስወግዱ። ሻጋታዎችን ያድርጉ ወይም ያስወግዱ.","Meld placed.":"ሜልድ ተቀምጧል።","Card discarded.":"ካርድ ተጥሏል።","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"ያ ድርጊት ህጋዊ አይደለም። ደንቦቹን እና የተመረጡ ካርዶችን ያረጋግጡ.","You went out and won the round.":"እርስዎ ወጥተው ዙሩን አሸንፈዋል።","The computer went out. Round scored.":"ኮምፒዩተሩ ወጣ። ዙር አስቆጥሯል።","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"አክሲዮኑ ሁለት ካርዶችን ማቅረብ አይችልም። ዙር አስቆጥሯል።","You reached the target and won the game!":"ዒላማው ላይ ደርሰህ ጨዋታውን አሸንፈሃል!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"ኮምፒዩተሩ ግቡ ላይ ደርሶ ጨዋታውን አሸንፏል።","The match is tied.":"ጨዋታው እኩል ነው።","Clean canasta":"ንጹሕ canasta","Mixed canasta":"የተደባለቀ ካንስታ","You need a canasta before going out.":"ከመውጣትዎ በፊት ካንስታ ያስፈልግዎታል።","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"አካባቢያዊ ቁጠባ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ የለም። ይህ ገጽ ክፍት ሆኖ ሳለ መጫወቱን መቀጠል ይችላሉ።","Round saved on this device.":"ዙር በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ ተቀምጧል።","Saved round resumed.":"የተቀመጠው ዙር ቀጥሏል።","Saved round deleted.":"የተቀመጠ ዙር ተሰርዟል።","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"የተቀመጠ ዙር ሊነበብ አልቻለም። አዲስ ዙር ይጀምሩ ወይም የተበላሸውን ቆጣቢ ይሰርዙ።","Card":"ካርድ","Wild":"ዱር","Frozen":"የቀዘቀዘ","Open":"ክፍት","points":"ነጥብ","Twos":"Twos","Threes":"ሶስት","Fours":"አራት","Fives":"አምስት","Sixes":"ስድስት","Sevens":"ሰባት","Eights":"ስምንት","Nines":"ዘጠኝ","Tens":"አስር","Jacks":"ጃክሶች","Queens":"ንግሥቶች","Kings":"ነገሥታት","Aces":"Aces","Hearts":"ልቦች","Diamonds":"አልማዞች","Clubs":"ክለቦች","Spades":"ስፋቶች","Joker":"ጆከር","Rules overview":"የደንቦች አጠቃላይ እይታ","Canasta rules":"Canasta ደንቦች"},"ar":{"Canasta":"كاناستا","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — لعبة بطاقة Canasta المجانية مقابل الكمبيوتر","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"العب Canasta بلاعبين عبر الإنترنت ضد جهاز كمبيوتر محلي. قم برسم الكومة المرتجعة ودمجها وتجميدها وأخذها، وقم ببناء كاناستا نظيفة أو مختلطة وتتبع نتيجة الجولة. حر؛ تبقى بطاقاتك على هذا الجهاز.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"العب جولة Canasta كاملة للاعبين في متصفحك. قم بتكوين مجموعات من الرتب المتطابقة، واستخدم الثنائيات والمهرجين كبطاقات جامحة، وقم بعمل مجموعة من سبع بطاقات قبل الخروج.","A quick example":"مثال سريع","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"ثلاثة ملوك طبيعيين يمكنهم فتح مزيج. أضف بطاقات من هذا التصنيف خلال الدورات اللاحقة؛ سبع بطاقات طبيعية تصنع كاناستا نظيفة بقيمة 500 نقطة إضافية، في حين أن المزيج مع البطاقات البرية عبارة عن كاناستا مختلطة بقيمة 300 نقاط إضافية.","How to play":"كيفية اللعب","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"يستخدم هذا الإصدار مجموعتين قياسيتين بالإضافة إلى أربع بطاقات جوكر (بطاقات 108)، وبطاقات 15 لكل لاعب وبطاقتين يتم سحبهما من المخزون في كل دور. قم بدمج ثلاث بطاقات على الأقل من رتبة واحدة؛ الثنائيات والمهرجون متوحشون، وليس لديهم بطاقات جامحة أكثر من البطاقات الطبيعية. يجب أن يستوفي المزيج الأول حد النقاط لدرجاتك الحالية. لا يمكن أخذ الكومة المهملة إلا ببطاقتين طبيعيتين متطابقتين مع بطاقتها العلوية. تعمل البطاقة البرية أو الثلاثة السوداء على تجميد الكومة. أنت بحاجة إلى كاناستا واحدة على الأقل مكونة من سبع بطاقات للخروج.","Frequently asked questions":"الأسئلة المتداولة","What is a canasta?":"ما هي الكاناستا؟","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"الكاناستا عبارة عن مزيج من سبع بطاقات أو أكثر من نفس الرتبة. سبع بطاقات طبيعية تصنع كاناستا نظيفة (نقاط إضافية 500)؛ يتم خلط مزيج يحتوي على بطاقة بدل (نقاط 300 الإضافية).","How do I take the discard pile?":"كيف يمكنني أخذ الكومة المهملة؟","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"احمل بطاقتين طبيعيتين مطابقتين للجزء العلوي المرتجع. يتم تجميد الكومة عندما تكون البطاقة العلوية الخاصة بها عبارة عن بطاقة جامحة أو بطاقة ثلاثية سوداء. يجب أيضًا أن تكون قادرًا على إجراء دمج قانوني مع البطاقة العلوية وفقًا لمتطلبات الفتح الخاصة بك.","When can I go out?":"متى يمكنني الخروج؟","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"لا يجوز لك إفراغ يدك إلا بعد أن يكون لدى جانبك كاناستا من سبع بطاقات. يتم التخلص من البطاقة النهائية. لا يستخدم هذا الإصدار اختلافات اليد المخفية أو إذن الشريك.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"كيف يتم حساب الخلط الافتتاحي؟","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"الحد الأدنى هو 50 نقطة أقل من 1,500 من النقاط التراكمية، و90 من 1,500، و120 من 3,000، و150 من 5,000. لا يتم احتساب نقاط الاندماج الحالية ضمن الافتتاح الجديد.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"هل تم تحميل لعبتي أو حفظها؟","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"لم يتم تحميل أي لعبة. يعد الحفظ أمرًا اختياريًا ويستخدم التخزين المحلي في هذا المتصفح على هذا الجهاز.","Rules and limitations":"القواعد والقيود","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"هذا إصدار غير رسمي للاعبين ضد خصم كمبيوتر محلي بسيط، وليس لعبة متعددة اللاعبين عبر الإنترنت أو مقامرة. يستخدم الهدف المشترك 5,000 ذو النقاط، وصفقة بطاقة 15، وسحب بطاقتين، وعتبات الفتح القائمة على النتيجة. تختلف قواعد الجدول: لا يطبق هذا الإصدار إذن الشراكة للخروج، أو مكافآت اليد المخفية الخاصة، أو خيارات الاستبدال الثلاثة الحمراء، أو قواعد المنزل المخصصة. إذا لم يتمكن السهم من توفير ورقتين، يتم تسجيل الجولة.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"لعب مجاني. تبقى يدك ونقاطك في هذا المتصفح على هذا الجهاز؛ لم يتم تحميل أي بيانات اللعبة.","Play Canasta":"تشغيل كاناستا","Related tools":"أدوات ذات صلة","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مجاني · يعمل في متصفحك","Language":"اللغة","UsefulVerse":"آية مفيدة","All tools":"جميع الأدوات","New round":"جولة جديدة","Play next round":"العب الجولة التالية","Resume saved round":"استئناف محفوظ بشكل دائري","Delete saved round":"حذف الجولة المحفوظة","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"ابدأ جولة أو استأنف جولة محفوظة.","You":"أنت","Computer":"الكمبيوتر","Your hand":"يدك","Computer cards":"بطاقات الكمبيوتر","Stock":"المخزون","Discard pile":"تخلص من الكومة","Your melds":"خلطاتك","Draw two cards":"ارسم ورقتين","Take discard pile":"خذ الكومة المهملة","Discard selected card":"تجاهل البطاقة المحددة","Selected cards":"البطاقات المحددة","Clear selection":"مسح التحديد","Meld rank":"رتبة الخلط","Lay down meld":"وضع الخليط","Total score":"النتيجة الإجمالية","Round points":"نقاط مستديرة","Opening meld needs":"فتح الاحتياجات المختلطة","Turn":"دوران","Choose New round to begin.":"اختر جولة جديدة للبدء.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"بدأت الجولة. ارسم ورقتين.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"دورك: اسحب ورقتين من المخزون أو خذ الكومة المرفوضة.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"ضع الخلطات القانونية إذا كنت ترغب في ذلك، ثم تخلص من بطاقة واحدة.","Computer is taking its turn…":"الكمبيوتر يأخذ دوره...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"تم سحب بطاقتين. اصنع خلطات أو تخلص منها.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"تخلص من الكومة المأخوذة. اصنع خلطات أو تخلص منها.","Meld placed.":"تم وضع الخليط.","Card discarded.":"تم تجاهل البطاقة.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"هذا الإجراء غير قانوني. تحقق من القواعد والبطاقات المختارة.","You went out and won the round.":"لقد خرجت وفزت بالجولة.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"انطفأ جهاز الكمبيوتر. سجلت الجولة.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"لا يمكن للمخزون توفير بطاقتين. سجلت الجولة.","You reached the target and won the game!":"لقد وصلت إلى الهدف وفزت بالمباراة!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"وصل الكمبيوتر إلى الهدف وفاز باللعبة.","The match is tied.":"المباراة متعادلة.","Clean canasta":"علبة نظيفة","Mixed canasta":"كاناستا مختلطة","You need a canasta before going out.":"أنت بحاجة إلى كاناستا قبل الخروج.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"الحفظ المحلي غير متاح في هذا المتصفح. يمكنك الاستمرار في اللعب بينما تظل هذه الصفحة مفتوحة.","Round saved on this device.":"تم حفظ الجولة على هذا الجهاز.","Saved round resumed.":"تم استئناف الجولة المحفوظة.","Saved round deleted.":"تم حذف الجولة المحفوظة.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"تعذرت قراءة الجولة المحفوظة. ابدأ جولة جديدة أو احذف الحفظ التالف.","Card":"البطاقة","Wild":"وايلد","Frozen":"مجمد","Open":"مفتوح","points":"النقاط","Twos":"اثنين","Threes":"الثلاثات","Fours":"أربع","Fives":"الخمسات","Sixes":"ستات","Sevens":"السبعات","Eights":"الثمانيات","Nines":"تسعة","Tens":"العشرات","Jacks":"الرافعات","Queens":"كوينز","Kings":"ملوك","Aces":"ارسالا ساحقا","Hearts":"قلوب","Diamonds":"الماس","Clubs":"النوادي","Spades":"البستوني","Joker":"الجوكر","Rules overview":"نظرة عامة على القواعد","Canasta rules":"قواعد كاناستا"},"bg":{"Canasta":"Канаста","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Канаста онлайн — Безплатна игра на карти Канаста срещу компютър","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Играйте Canasta за двама играчи онлайн срещу локален компютър. Начертайте, смесете, замразете и вземете купчината за изхвърляне, изградете чисти или смесени канасти и проследете резултата от кръга. безплатно; вашите карти остават на това устройство.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Играйте пълен кръг Canasta за двама играчи във вашия браузър. Формирайте смеси от съвпадащи рангове, използвайте двойки и джокери като уайлд карти и направете канаста от седем карти, преди да излезете.","A quick example":"Бърз пример","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Трима естествени крале могат да отворят обединение. Добавете карти от този ранг в следващите ходове; седем естествени карти правят чиста канаста на стойност 500 бонус точки, докато комбинацията с уайлд карти е смесена канаста на стойност 300 бонус точки.","How to play":"Как се играе","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Тази версия използва две стандартни тестета плюс четири джокера (108 карти), 15 карти на играч и две карти, изтеглени от запасите на всеки ход. Слейте поне три карти от един ранг; двойки и джокери са уайлд, с не повече уайлд отколкото естествени карти. Първото обединение трябва да отговаря на прага на точките за текущия ви резултат. Купчина за изхвърляне може да бъде взета само с две естествени карти, съответстващи на горната й карта. Уайлд кард или черна тройка замразява купчината. Имате нужда от поне една канаста със седем карти, за да излезете.","Frequently asked questions":"Често задавани въпроси","What is a canasta?":"Какво е канаста?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Канаста е комбинация от седем или повече карти от същия ранг. Седем естествени карти правят чиста канаста (500 бонус точки); комбинация, съдържаща уайлд кард, е смесена (300 бонус точки).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Как да взема купчината за изхвърляне?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Дръжте две естествени карти, съответстващи на най-горния дискорд. Купчината е замразена, когато горната й карта е уайлд кард или черна тройка. Трябва също така да сте в състояние да направите законно обединяване с горната карта според вашето начално изискване.","When can I go out?":"Кога мога да изляза?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Можете да изпразните ръката си само след като вашата страна има канаста от седем карти. Последната карта се изхвърля; тази версия не използва варианти на скрита ръка или разрешение на партньор.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Как се изчислява началната смес?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Минимумът е 50 точки под 1,500 кумулативни точки, 90 от 1,500, 120 от 3,000 и 150 от 5,000. Съществуващите точки на сливане не се броят за ново отваряне.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Моята игра качена ли е или запазена?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Няма качена игра. Запазването не е задължително и използва локално хранилище в този браузър на това устройство.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Това е ежедневен вариант за двама играчи срещу обикновен локален компютърен противник, а не онлайн мултиплейър или хазарт. Той използва общата 5,000 цел за точки, 15 раздаване на карти, теглене на две карти и начални прагове, базирани на резултат. Правилата на масата се различават: тази версия не прилага разрешение за партньорство за излизане, специални бонуси за скрити ръце, избор за замяна на червено-три или персонализирани домашни правила. Ако складът не може да достави две карти, рундът се оценява.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Безплатна игра. Вашата ръка и резултат остават в този браузър на това устройство; не се качват данни за играта.","Play Canasta":"Играйте Canasta","Related tools":"Свързани инструменти","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗПЛАТНО · ПУСКА ВЪВ ВАШИЯ БРАУЗЪР","Language":"Език","UsefulVerse":"Полезен стих","All tools":"Всички инструменти","New round":"Нов кръг","Play next round":"Играйте следващия кръг","Resume saved round":"Възобновяване на запазен кръг","Delete saved round":"Изтриване на запазен кръг","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Започнете рунд или възобновете записан.","You":"Вие","Computer":"Компютър","Your hand":"Вашата ръка","Computer cards":"Компютърни карти","Stock":"Наличност","Discard pile":"Изхвърлете купчина","Your melds":"Вашите обединения","Draw two cards":"Изтеглете две карти","Take discard pile":"Вземете купчина изхвърляне","Discard selected card":"Изхвърлете избраната карта","Selected cards":"Избрани карти","Clear selection":"Изчистване на селекцията","Meld rank":"Мелд ранг","Lay down meld":"Легни мелд","Total score":"Общ резултат","Round points":"Кръгли точки","Opening meld needs":"Нужби за начално обединяване","Turn":"Завъртете","Choose New round to begin.":"Изберете нов кръг, за да започнете.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Рундът започна. Изтеглете две карти.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Ваш ред: изтеглете две карти от склад или вземете купчината за изхвърляне.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Поставете легални комбинации, ако желаете, след което изхвърлете една карта.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Компютърът идва на своя ред...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Две изтеглени карти. Направете смеси или изхвърлете.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Изхвърлете купчина. Направете смеси или изхвърлете.","Meld placed.":"Поставено претопяване.","Card discarded.":"Картата е изхвърлена.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Това действие не е законно. Проверете правилата и избраните карти.","You went out and won the round.":"Излязохте и спечелихте рунда.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Компютърът изгасна. Рунд отбеляза.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Запасът не може да достави две карти. Рунд отбеляза.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Вие достигнахте целта и спечелихте играта!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Компютърът достигна целта и спечели играта.","The match is tied.":"Мачът е равен.","Clean canasta":"Чиста канаста","Mixed canasta":"Смесена канаста","You need a canasta before going out.":"Имате нужда от канаста, преди да излезете.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Локалното запазване не е налично в този браузър. Можете да продължите да играете, докато тази страница остава отворена.","Round saved on this device.":"Кръгът е запазен на това устройство.","Saved round resumed.":"Запазеният кръг е възобновен.","Saved round deleted.":"Запазеният кръг е изтрит.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Запазеният кръг не може да бъде прочетен. Започнете нов кръг или изтрийте повреденото запазване.","Card":"Карта","Wild":"Див","Frozen":"Замразен","Open":"Отворено","points":"точки","Twos":"Две","Threes":"Тройки","Fours":"Четири","Fives":"Петици","Sixes":"Шестици","Sevens":"Седмици","Eights":"Осмици","Nines":"Деветки","Tens":"Десетки","Jacks":"Кукове","Queens":"Кралици","Kings":"Крале","Aces":"Аса","Hearts":"Сърца","Diamonds":"Диаманти","Clubs":"Буха","Spades":"Пика","Joker":"Жокер","Rules overview":"Преглед на правилата","Canasta rules":"Правила на Канаста"},"bn":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta অনলাইন — ফ্রি ক্যানাস্তা কার্ড গেম বনাম কম্পিউটার","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"একটি স্থানীয় কম্পিউটারের বিরুদ্ধে অনলাইনে টু-প্লেয়ার ক্যানাস্তা খেলুন। আঁকুন, মিশ্রিত করুন, নিথর করুন এবং বাতিলের গাদা নিন, পরিষ্কার বা মিশ্র ক্যানাস্তা তৈরি করুন এবং রাউন্ড স্কোর ট্র্যাক করুন। বিনামূল্যে; আপনার কার্ড এই ডিভাইসে থাকে।","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"আপনার ব্রাউজারে একটি সম্পূর্ণ দুই-প্লেয়ার ক্যানাস্তা রাউন্ড খেলুন। ম্যাচিং র‌্যাঙ্কের মেলড তৈরি করুন, ওয়াইল্ড কার্ড হিসাবে দুই এবং জোকার ব্যবহার করুন এবং বাইরে যাওয়ার আগে সাতটি কার্ডের একটি ক্যানাস্তা তৈরি করুন।","A quick example":"একটি দ্রুত উদাহরণ","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"তিনটি প্রাকৃতিক রাজা একটি মেল খুলতে পারে। পরবর্তী বাঁকগুলিতে সেই পদের কার্ড যোগ করুন; সাতটি প্রাকৃতিক কার্ড একটি 500-পয়েন্ট বোনাসের মূল্যের একটি পরিষ্কার ক্যানাস্তা তৈরি করে, যখন ওয়াইল্ড কার্ডের সাথে একটি মিশ্রিত ক্যানাস্তা মূল্যের 300 বোনাস পয়েন্ট।","How to play":"কিভাবে খেলতে হয়","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"এই সংস্করণে দুটি স্ট্যান্ডার্ড ডেক প্লাস চারটি জোকার (108 কার্ড), খেলোয়াড় প্রতি 15 কার্ড এবং প্রতিটি পালা স্টক থেকে দুটি কার্ড ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে। এক র্যাঙ্কের কমপক্ষে তিনটি কার্ড মেলুন; Twos এবং jokers বন্য, প্রাকৃতিক কার্ডের চেয়ে বেশি বন্য নয়। প্রথম মেল্ডকে অবশ্যই আপনার বর্তমান স্কোরের জন্য পয়েন্ট থ্রেশহোল্ড পূরণ করতে হবে। একটি বাতিল গাদা শুধুমাত্র তার উপরের কার্ডের সাথে মিলে যাওয়া দুটি প্রাকৃতিক কার্ডের সাথে নেওয়া যেতে পারে। একটি ওয়াইল্ড কার্ড বা কালো তিন গাদা জমে. আপনার বাইরে যেতে অন্তত একটি সাত-কার্ড ক্যানস্তা দরকার।","Frequently asked questions":"প্রায়শই জিজ্ঞাসিত প্রশ্ন","What is a canasta?":"কানাস্তা কি?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"একটি ক্যানাস্তা হল একই র্যাঙ্কের সাত বা তার বেশি কার্ডের একটি মেলড। সাতটি প্রাকৃতিক কার্ড একটি পরিষ্কার ক্যানাস্তা তৈরি করে (500 বোনাস পয়েন্ট); একটি ওয়াইল্ড কার্ড সম্বলিত একটি মেল্ড মিশ্রিত হয় (300 বোনাস পয়েন্ট)।","How do I take the discard pile?":"আমি কিভাবে বাতিল গাদা নিতে পারি?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"শীর্ষ বাতিলের সাথে মিলে যাওয়া দুটি প্রাকৃতিক কার্ড ধরুন। গাদা হিমায়িত হয় যখন এর উপরের কার্ডটি একটি ওয়াইল্ড কার্ড বা কালো তিনটি। আপনাকে অবশ্যই আপনার খোলার প্রয়োজনীয়তার অধীনে শীর্ষ কার্ডের সাথে একটি আইনি মেলাতে সক্ষম হতে হবে।","When can I go out?":"আমি কখন বাইরে যেতে পারি?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"আপনার পাশে সাত-কার্ড ক্যানাস্তা থাকলেই আপনি আপনার হাত খালি করতে পারেন। চূড়ান্ত কার্ড বাতিল করা হয়; এই সংস্করণটি গোপন-হস্ত বা অংশীদার-অনুমতি বৈচিত্র ব্যবহার করে না।","How is the opening meld calculated?":"ওপেনিং মেল্ড কিভাবে গণনা করা হয়?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"1,500 মোট পয়েন্টের নিচে ন্যূনতম স্কোর 50; 1,500 থেকে 90, 3,000 থেকে 120 এবং 5,000 থেকে 150। নতুন করে খোলার ন্যূনতম স্কোরে আগের মেল্ডের পয়েন্ট যোগ হয় না।","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"আমার গেম আপলোড বা সংরক্ষিত?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"কোন খেলা আপলোড করা হয় না. সংরক্ষণ ঐচ্ছিক এবং এই ডিভাইসে এই ব্রাউজারে স্থানীয় স্টোরেজ ব্যবহার করে।","Rules and limitations":"নিয়ম এবং সীমাবদ্ধতা","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"এটি একটি সাধারণ স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার প্রতিপক্ষের বিরুদ্ধে একটি নৈমিত্তিক দুই-খেলোয়াড়ের বৈকল্পিক, অনলাইন মাল্টিপ্লেয়ার বা জুয়া নয়। এটি সাধারণ 5,000-পয়েন্ট লক্ষ্য, 15-কার্ড চুক্তি, দুই-কার্ড ড্র এবং স্কোর-ভিত্তিক খোলার থ্রেশহোল্ড ব্যবহার করে। টেবিলের নিয়মগুলি আলাদা: এই সংস্করণটি বাইরে যাওয়ার অংশীদারিত্বের অনুমতি, বিশেষ গোপন-হ্যান্ড বোনাস, লাল-তিনটি প্রতিস্থাপন পছন্দ, বা কাস্টম হাউস নিয়মগুলি প্রয়োগ করে না। যদি স্টক দুটি কার্ড সরবরাহ করতে না পারে, রাউন্ড স্কোর করা হয়।","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"খেলা বিনামূল্যে. আপনার হাত এবং স্কোর এই ডিভাইসে এই ব্রাউজারে থাকবে; কোন খেলা তথ্য আপলোড করা হয় না.","Play Canasta":"ক্যানাস্তা খেলো","Related tools":"সম্পর্কিত সরঞ্জাম","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ফ্রি · আপনার ব্রাউজারে চলে","Language":"ভাষা","UsefulVerse":"উপযোগী পদ্য","All tools":"সমস্ত টুলস","New round":"নতুন রাউন্ড","Play next round":"পরবর্তী রাউন্ডে খেলুন","Resume saved round":"সংরক্ষিত রাউন্ড পুনরায় শুরু করুন","Delete saved round":"সংরক্ষিত রাউন্ড মুছুন","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"একটি রাউন্ড শুরু করুন বা সংরক্ষিত একটি পুনরায় শুরু করুন।","You":"তুমি","Computer":"কম্পিউটার","Your hand":"আপনার হাত","Computer cards":"কম্পিউটার কার্ড","Stock":"স্টক","Discard pile":"গাদা বাদ দিন","Your melds":"আপনার মিল","Draw two cards":"দুটি কার্ড আঁকুন","Take discard pile":"বাতিল গাদা নিন","Discard selected card":"নির্বাচিত কার্ড বাতিল করুন","Selected cards":"নির্বাচিত কার্ড","Clear selection":"নির্বাচন পরিষ্কার করুন","Meld rank":"মেল্ড র‍্যাঙ্ক","Lay down meld":"লে ডাউন মেল্ড","Total score":"মোট স্কোর","Round points":"বৃত্তাকার পয়েন্ট","Opening meld needs":"ওপেনিং মেল্ড প্রয়োজন","Turn":"বাঁক","Choose New round to begin.":"শুরু করতে নতুন রাউন্ড বেছে নিন।","Round started. Draw two cards.":"রাউন্ড শুরু হয়েছে। দুটি কার্ড আঁকুন।","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"আপনার পালা: স্টক থেকে দুটি কার্ড আঁকুন বা বাতিল গাদা নিন।","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"যদি আপনি চান তাহলে আইনগত মেলড রাখুন, তারপর একটি কার্ড বাতিল করুন৷","Computer is taking its turn…":"কম্পিউটার তার মোড় নিচ্ছে...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"দুটি কার্ড আঁকা হয়েছে। মেলড তৈরি করুন বা বাতিল করুন।","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"নেওয়া গাদা বাতিল করুন। মেলড তৈরি করুন বা বাতিল করুন।","Meld placed.":"মেল্ড স্থাপন করা হয়েছে।","Card discarded.":"কার্ড বাতিল করা হয়েছে।","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"এই পদক্ষেপটি আইনি নয়। নিয়ম এবং নির্বাচিত কার্ড চেক করুন.","You went out and won the round.":"আপনি বাইরে গিয়ে রাউন্ড জিতেছেন।","The computer went out. Round scored.":"কম্পিউটার চলে গেছে। রাউন্ড স্কোর করেছে।","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"স্টক দুটি কার্ড সরবরাহ করতে পারে না। রাউন্ড স্কোর করেছে।","You reached the target and won the game!":"আপনি লক্ষ্যে পৌঁছেছেন এবং গেমটি জিতেছেন!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"কম্পিউটার লক্ষ্যে পৌঁছেছে এবং গেমটি জিতেছে।","The match is tied.":"ম্যাচটি টাই হয়েছে।","Clean canasta":"ক্লিন ক্যানাস্তা","Mixed canasta":"মিশ্র ক্যানাস্তা","You need a canasta before going out.":"বাইরে যাওয়ার আগে আপনার একটি কানাস্তা দরকার।","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"স্থানীয় সংরক্ষণ এই ব্রাউজারে অনুপলব্ধ৷ এই পৃষ্ঠাটি খোলা থাকাকালীন আপনি খেলা চালিয়ে যেতে পারেন।","Round saved on this device.":"এই ডিভাইসে রাউন্ড সংরক্ষিত।","Saved round resumed.":"সংরক্ষিত রাউন্ড পুনরায় শুরু হয়েছে৷","Saved round deleted.":"সংরক্ষিত রাউন্ড মুছে ফেলা হয়েছে।","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"সংরক্ষিত রাউন্ড পড়া যাবে না। একটি নতুন রাউন্ড শুরু করুন বা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত সেভ মুছে দিন।","Card":"কার্ড","Wild":"ওয়াইল্ড","Frozen":"হিমায়িত","Open":"খোলা","points":"পয়েন্ট","Twos":"দুই","Threes":"তিনটি","Fours":"চার","Fives":"ফাইভস","Sixes":"ছক্কা","Sevens":"সেভেনস","Eights":"আট","Nines":"নাইনস","Tens":"দশ","Jacks":"জ্যাকস","Queens":"কুইন্স","Kings":"কিংস","Aces":"এসেস","Hearts":"হার্টস","Diamonds":"হীরা","Clubs":"ক্লাব","Spades":"স্পেডস","Joker":"জোকার","Rules overview":"নিয়ম ওভারভিউ","Canasta rules":"Canasta নিয়ম"},"ca":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Joc de cartes Canasta gratuït contra ordinador","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Juga a Canasta per a dos jugadors en línia contra un ordinador local. Dibuixa, fusiona, congela i pren la pila de descart, construeix canastes netes o barrejades i fes un seguiment de la puntuació de la ronda. Gratuït; les teves targetes romanen en aquest dispositiu.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Juga una ronda completa de Canasta per a dos jugadors al teu navegador. Formeu fusions de rangs coincidents, utilitzeu dos i bromes com a comodins i feu una canasta de set cartes abans de sortir.","A quick example":"Un exemple ràpid","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Tres reis naturals poden obrir una fusió. Afegiu cartes d'aquest rang en torns posteriors; set cartes naturals fan que una canasta neta val una bonificació de punts 500, mentre que una fusió amb comodins és una canasta mixta que val una bonificació de 300.","How to play":"Com jugar","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Aquesta versió utilitza dues baralles estàndard més quatre bromes (targetes 108), cartes 15 per jugador i dues cartes extretes de l'estoc cada torn. Combina almenys tres cartes d'un rang; els dos i els comodins són salvatges, sense més comodins que les cartes naturals. La primera fusió ha d'assolir el llindar de punts de la vostra puntuació actual. Una pila de descart només es pot agafar amb dues cartes naturals que coincideixin amb la seva carta superior. Un comodí o tres negres congela la pila. Necessites almenys una canasta de set cartes per sortir.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntes més freqüents","What is a canasta?":"Què és una canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Una canasta és una combinació de set o més cartes del mateix rang. Set cartes naturals fan una canasta neta (punts de bonificació 500); es barreja una combinació que conté un comodí (punts de bonificació 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Com puc agafar la pila de rebuts?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Agafeu dues cartes naturals que coincideixin amb el descart superior. La pila es congela quan la seva carta superior és un comodí o tres negres. També heu de poder fer una fusió legal amb la targeta superior sota el vostre requisit d'obertura.","When can I go out?":"Quan puc sortir?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Podeu buidar la mà només quan el vostre costat tingui una canasta de set cartes. La carta final es descarta; aquesta versió no utilitza variacions de mà oculta o de permís de soci.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Com es calcula la fusió inicial?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"El mínim és de 50 punts per sota de 1,500 punts acumulats, 90 de 1,500, 120 de 3,000 i 150 de 5,000. Els punts de fusió existents no es compten per a una nova obertura.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"El meu joc està penjat o desat?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"No s'ha carregat cap joc. Desar és opcional i utilitza emmagatzematge local en aquest navegador en aquest dispositiu.","Rules and limitations":"Normes i limitacions","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Es tracta d'una variant casual de dos jugadors contra un simple oponent d'ordinador local, no multijugador en línia o jocs d'atzar. Utilitza l'objectiu comú de punts 5,000, l'oferta de targetes 15, el sorteig de dues cartes i els llindars d'obertura basats en la puntuació. Les regles de la taula són diferents: aquesta versió no implementa el permís d'associació per sortir, les bonificacions especials de mà oculta, les opcions de reemplaçament de tres vermells o les regles personalitzades. Si l'estoc no pot subministrar dues cartes, la ronda es puntua.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Lliure per jugar. La teva mà i la teva puntuació romanen en aquest navegador en aquest dispositiu; no es pengen dades del joc.","Play Canasta":"Juga a Canasta","Related tools":"Eines relacionades","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUÏT · EXECUCIÓ AL TEU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Vers útil","All tools":"Totes les eines","New round":"Nova ronda","Play next round":"Juga a la ronda següent","Resume saved round":"Reprèn la ronda desada","Delete saved round":"Suprimeix la ronda desada","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Comença una ronda o reprèn una desada.","You":"Vostè","Computer":"Ordinador","Your hand":"La teva mà","Computer cards":"Targetes d'ordinador","Stock":"Estoc","Discard pile":"Descartar la pila","Your melds":"Les teves fusions","Draw two cards":"Dibuixa dues cartes","Take discard pile":"Agafeu la pila de rebuts","Discard selected card":"Descarta la targeta seleccionada","Selected cards":"Targetes seleccionades","Clear selection":"Esborra la selecció","Meld rank":"Rang de fusió","Lay down meld":"Deixa la fusió","Total score":"Puntuació total","Round points":"Punts rodons","Opening meld needs":"Necessitats de fusió d'obertura","Turn":"Gira","Choose New round to begin.":"Trieu Nova ronda per començar.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Ronda començada. Dibuixa dues cartes.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"El teu torn: agafa dues cartes de l'estoc o agafa la pila de descarts.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Si ho desitja, estableix combinacions legals i, a continuació, descarta una targeta.","Computer is taking its turn…":"L'ordinador està fent el seu torn...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Dues cartes dibuixades. Fer fusions o descartar.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Descarta la pila presa. Fer fusions o descartar.","Meld placed.":"Meld col·locat.","Card discarded.":"Targeta descartada.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Aquesta acció no és legal. Consulta les regles i les cartes seleccionades.","You went out and won the round.":"Has sortit i has guanyat la ronda.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"L'ordinador s'ha apagat. Ronda marcada.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"L'estoc no pot subministrar dues targetes. Ronda marcada.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Has arribat a l'objectiu i has guanyat la partida!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"L'ordinador va arribar a l'objectiu i va guanyar el joc.","The match is tied.":"El partit està empatat.","Clean canasta":"Neteja la canasta","Mixed canasta":"Canasta mixta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Necessites una canasta abans de sortir.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"L'emmagatzematge local no està disponible en aquest navegador. Pots seguir jugant mentre aquesta pàgina roman oberta.","Round saved on this device.":"Ronda desada en aquest dispositiu.","Saved round resumed.":"S'ha reprès la ronda desada.","Saved round deleted.":"S'ha suprimit la ronda desada.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"No s'ha pogut llegir la ronda desada. Inicieu una nova ronda o suprimiu el desat danyat.","Card":"Targeta","Wild":"Selvatge","Frozen":"Congelat","Open":"Obert","points":"punts","Twos":"Dos","Threes":"Tres","Fours":"Quatre","Fives":"Cincs","Sixes":"Sixes","Sevens":"Sets","Eights":"Vuits","Nines":"Nins","Tens":"Denes","Jacks":"Jacks","Queens":"Queens","Kings":"Reis","Aces":"Asos","Hearts":"Cors","Diamonds":"Diamants","Clubs":"Clubs","Spades":"Piques","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Visió general de les regles","Canasta rules":"Normes Canasta"},"de":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online – Kostenloses Canasta-Kartenspiel gegen Computer","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Spielen Sie Canasta für zwei Spieler online gegen einen lokalen Computer. Zeichnen, melden, einfrieren und den Ablagestapel nehmen, saubere oder gemischte Canastas bauen und den Rundenstand verfolgen. Frei; Ihre Karten bleiben auf diesem Gerät.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Spielen Sie eine komplette Canasta-Runde für zwei Spieler in Ihrem Browser. Bilden Sie Meldungen gleicher Wertigkeit, verwenden Sie Zweien und Joker als Platzhalter und bilden Sie vor dem Ausspielen ein Canasta aus sieben Karten.","A quick example":"Ein kurzes Beispiel","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Drei natürliche Könige können eine Meldung eröffnen. Füge in späteren Zügen Karten dieses Ranges hinzu; Sieben natürliche Karten ergeben ein sauberes Canasta, das einen Bonus von 500 Punkten wert ist, während eine Meldung mit Wildkarten ein gemischtes Canasta im Wert von 300 Bonuspunkten darstellt.","How to play":"Wie man spielt","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Diese Version verwendet zwei Standarddecks plus vier Joker (108-Karten), 15-Karten pro Spieler und zwei Karten, die in jeder Runde aus dem Vorrat gezogen werden. Melden Sie mindestens drei Karten desselben Ranges; Zweier und Joker sind Wild-Karten, es gibt nicht mehr Wild-Karten als natürliche Karten. Die erste Meldung muss die Punkteschwelle für Ihren aktuellen Punktestand erreichen. Ein Ablagestapel kann nur genommen werden, wenn zwei natürliche Karten zur obersten Karte passen. Ein Platzhalter oder eine schwarze Drei friert den Stapel ein. Zum Ausgehen benötigen Sie mindestens ein Canasta mit sieben Karten.","Frequently asked questions":"Häufig gestellte Fragen","What is a canasta?":"Was ist ein Canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Ein Canasta ist eine Mischung aus sieben oder mehr Karten desselben Wertes. Sieben natürliche Karten ergeben ein sauberes Canasta (500 Bonuspunkte); Eine Meldung mit einer Wildcard ist gemischt (300 Bonuspunkte).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Wie nehme ich den Ablagestapel?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Halten Sie zwei natürliche Karten, die zum obersten Ablagestapel passen. Der Stapel wird eingefroren, wenn seine oberste Karte ein Platzhalter oder eine schwarze Drei ist. Sie müssen außerdem in der Lage sein, mit der obersten Karte gemäß Ihrer Eröffnungsanforderung eine legale Meldung zu machen.","When can I go out?":"Wann kann ich ausgehen?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Sie dürfen Ihre Hand erst leeren, wenn Ihre Seite ein Canasta mit sieben Karten hat. Die letzte Karte wird abgeworfen; Diese Version verwendet keine Varianten mit verdeckter Hand oder Partnererlaubnis.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Wie wird die Eröffnungsmeldung berechnet?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Das Minimum liegt bei 50 Punkten unter den kumulativen Punkten 1,500, 90 von 1,500, 120 von 3,000 und 150 von 5,000. Vorhandene Meldepunkte werden nicht auf eine neue Eröffnung angerechnet.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Ist mein Spiel hochgeladen oder gespeichert?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Es wurde kein Spiel hochgeladen. Das Speichern ist optional und nutzt den lokalen Speicher in diesem Browser auf diesem Gerät.","Rules and limitations":"Regeln und Einschränkungen","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Dies ist eine Gelegenheitsvariante für zwei Spieler gegen einen einfachen lokalen Computergegner, kein Online-Mehrspielermodus oder Glücksspiel. Es verwendet das übliche 5,000-Punkteziel, das Austeilen von 15-Karten, das Ziehen von zwei Karten und punktebasierte Eröffnungsschwellenwerte. Die Tischregeln sind unterschiedlich: Diese Version implementiert keine Partnerschaftserlaubnis zum Ausgehen, spezielle Boni für verdeckte Hände, Ersatzmöglichkeiten für rote Drei oder benutzerdefinierte Hausregeln. Wenn der Vorrat nicht zwei Karten liefern kann, wird die Runde gewertet.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Kostenlos spielbar. Ihre Hand und Ihr Punktestand bleiben in diesem Browser auf diesem Gerät; Es werden keine Spieldaten hochgeladen.","Play Canasta":"Kanasta abspielen","Related tools":"Verwandte Tools","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KOSTENLOS · LÄUFT IN IHREM BROWSER","Language":"Sprache","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"Alle Werkzeuge","New round":"Neue Runde","Play next round":"Nächste Runde spielen","Resume saved round":"Gespeicherte Runde fortsetzen","Delete saved round":"Gespeicherte Runde löschen","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Starten Sie eine Runde oder setzen Sie eine gespeicherte fort.","You":"Sie","Computer":"Computer","Your hand":"Deine Hand","Computer cards":"Computerkarten","Stock":"Lager","Discard pile":"Stapel abwerfen","Your melds":"Ihre Meldungen","Draw two cards":"Zwei Karten ziehen","Take discard pile":"Ablagestapel nehmen","Discard selected card":"Ausgewählte Karte verwerfen","Selected cards":"Ausgewählte Karten","Clear selection":"Auswahl löschen","Meld rank":"Melderang","Lay down meld":"Meldung ablegen","Total score":"Gesamtpunktzahl","Round points":"Runde Spitzen","Opening meld needs":"Meldungsanforderungen werden geöffnet","Turn":"Drehen","Choose New round to begin.":"Wählen Sie „Neue Runde“, um zu beginnen.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Runde gestartet. Ziehe zwei Karten.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Dein Zug: Ziehe zwei Karten vom Vorrat oder nimm den Ablagestapel.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Legen Sie bei Bedarf legale Meldungen ab und werfen Sie dann eine Karte ab.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Der Computer ist an der Reihe …","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Zwei Karten gezogen. Machen Sie Meldungen oder verwerfen Sie sie.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Ablagestapel genommen. Machen Sie Meldungen oder verwerfen Sie sie.","Meld placed.":"Meldung platziert.","Card discarded.":"Karte verworfen.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Diese Aktion ist nicht legal. Überprüfen Sie die Regeln und ausgewählten Karten.","You went out and won the round.":"Sie sind rausgegangen und haben die Runde gewonnen.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Der Computer ist ausgefallen. Runde gewertet.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Der Bestand kann nicht zwei Karten liefern. Runde gewertet.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Sie haben das Ziel erreicht und das Spiel gewonnen!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Der Computer hat das Ziel erreicht und das Spiel gewonnen.","The match is tied.":"Das Spiel ist unentschieden.","Clean canasta":"Kanasta reinigen","Mixed canasta":"Gemischtes Canasta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Sie brauchen ein Canasta, bevor Sie ausgehen.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Lokales Speichern ist in diesem Browser nicht verfügbar. Sie können weiterspielen, solange diese Seite geöffnet bleibt.","Round saved on this device.":"Runde auf diesem Gerät gespeichert.","Saved round resumed.":"Gespeicherte Runde fortgesetzt.","Saved round deleted.":"Gespeicherte Runde gelöscht.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Gespeicherte Runde konnte nicht gelesen werden. Starten Sie eine neue Runde oder löschen Sie den beschädigten Speicherstand.","Card":"Karte","Wild":"Wild","Frozen":"Eingefroren","Open":"Offen","points":"Punkte","Twos":"Zweier","Threes":"Dreier","Fours":"Vierer","Fives":"Fünfer","Sixes":"Sechser","Sevens":"Siebener","Eights":"Achter","Nines":"Neunen","Tens":"Zehner","Jacks":"Buchsen","Queens":"Königinnen","Kings":"Könige","Aces":"Asse","Hearts":"Herzen","Diamonds":"Diamanten","Clubs":"Schläger","Spades":"Spaten","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Regelübersicht","Canasta rules":"Canasta-Regeln"},"el":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Δωρεάν παιχνίδι καρτών Canasta εναντίον υπολογιστή","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Παίξτε το Canasta δύο παικτών online ενάντια σε έναν τοπικό υπολογιστή. Σχεδιάστε, συγχωνεύστε, παγώστε και πάρτε το σωρό απόρριψης, φτιάξτε καθαρές ή μικτές καναστά και παρακολουθήστε τη στρογγυλή βαθμολογία. Δωρεάν; οι κάρτες σας παραμένουν σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Παίξτε έναν πλήρη γύρο Canasta για δύο παίκτες στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας. Σχηματίστε συγχωνεύσεις ταιριασμένων βαθμών, χρησιμοποιήστε δύο και τζόκερ ως μπαλαντέρ και φτιάξτε μια κανάστα επτά φύλλων πριν βγείτε.","A quick example":"Ένα γρήγορο παράδειγμα","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Τρεις φυσικοί βασιλιάδες μπορούν να ανοίξουν ένα μείγμα. Προσθέστε κάρτες αυτής της κατάταξης σε μεταγενέστερες στροφές. επτά φυσικά φύλλα κάνουν μια καθαρή κανάστα αξίας 500 πόντους, ενώ μια συγχώνευση με μπαλαντέρ είναι μια μικτή κανάστα αξίας 300 πόντους μπόνους.","How to play":"Πώς να παίξετε","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Αυτή η έκδοση χρησιμοποιεί δύο τυπικές τράπουλες συν τέσσερα τζόκερ (κάρτες 108), κάρτες 15 ανά παίκτη και δύο χαρτιά που τραβήχτηκαν από το απόθεμα σε κάθε γύρο. Συγχωνεύστε τουλάχιστον τρία φύλλα μιας κατάταξης. Τα δίδυμα και τα τζόκερ είναι μπαλαντέρ, με όχι περισσότερο μπαλαντέρ από τα φυσικά. Η πρώτη συγχώνευση πρέπει να πληροί το όριο πόντων για την τρέχουσα βαθμολογία σας. Μια στοίβα απόρριψης μπορεί να γίνει μόνο με δύο φυσικά φύλλα που ταιριάζουν στο επάνω φύλλο του. Ένα μπαλαντέρ ή ένα μαύρο τρία παγώνει το σωρό. Χρειάζεστε τουλάχιστον ένα κανάστα επτά φύλλων για να βγείτε έξω.","Frequently asked questions":"Συχνές ερωτήσεις","What is a canasta?":"Τι είναι η κανάστα;","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Ένα κανάστα είναι ένα μείγμα επτά ή περισσότερων φύλλων της ίδιας κατάταξης. Επτά φυσικές κάρτες κάνουν μια καθαρή κανάστα (500 πόντους μπόνους). αναμειγνύεται ένα meld που περιέχει μια μπαλαντέρ (300 πόντους μπόνους).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Πώς μπορώ να πάρω το σωρό απόρριψης;","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Κρατήστε δύο φυσικά φύλλα που ταιριάζουν με το πάνω απόρριψη. Το σωρό παγώνει όταν το πάνω φύλλο του είναι μπαλαντέρ ή μαύρο τρίποντο. Πρέπει επίσης να μπορείτε να κάνετε μια νόμιμη συγχώνευση με την κορυφαία κάρτα σύμφωνα με την απαίτηση ανοίγματος.","When can I go out?":"Πότε μπορώ να βγω έξω;","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Μπορείτε να αδειάσετε το χέρι σας μόνο αφού η πλευρά σας έχει μια κανάστα επτά φύλλων. Το τελικό φύλλο απορρίπτεται. Αυτή η έκδοση δεν χρησιμοποιεί παραλλαγές κρυφών χεριών ή αδειών συνεργάτη.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Πώς υπολογίζεται η τήξη ανοίγματος;","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Το ελάχιστο είναι 50 πόντους κάτω από 1,500 αθροιστικούς πόντους, 90 από 1,500, 120 από 3,000 και 150 από 5,000. Τα υπάρχοντα σημεία τήξης δεν υπολογίζονται για ένα νέο άνοιγμα.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Το παιχνίδι μου ανέβηκε ή αποθηκεύτηκε;","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Δεν έχει ανέβει παιχνίδι. Η αποθήκευση είναι προαιρετική και χρησιμοποιεί τοπικό χώρο αποθήκευσης σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Rules and limitations":"Κανόνες και περιορισμοί","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Αυτή είναι μια περιστασιακή παραλλαγή δύο παικτών εναντίον ενός απλού τοπικού αντιπάλου υπολογιστή, όχι διαδικτυακού παιχνιδιού για πολλούς παίκτες ή τζόγου. Χρησιμοποιεί τον κοινό στόχο 5,000 πόντων, το μοίρασμα φύλλων 15, το τραβήξιμο δύο φύλλων και τα όρια ανοίγματος βάσει σκορ. Οι κανόνες του πίνακα διαφέρουν: αυτή η έκδοση δεν εφαρμόζει άδεια συνεργασίας για έξοδο, ειδικά μπόνους κρυφών χεριών, επιλογές αντικατάστασης κόκκινου-τρεις ή προσαρμοσμένους κανόνες. Εάν το απόθεμα δεν μπορεί να δώσει δύο φύλλα, ο γύρος βαθμολογείται.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Δωρεάν για παιχνίδι. Το χέρι και το σκορ σας παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. δεν μεταφορτώνονται δεδομένα παιχνιδιού.","Play Canasta":"Παίξτε Canasta","Related tools":"Σχετικά εργαλεία","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ΔΩΡΕΑΝ · ΕΚΤΕΛΕΙΤΑΙ ΣΤΟ BROWSER ΣΑΣ","Language":"Γλώσσα","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"Όλα τα εργαλεία","New round":"Νέος γύρος","Play next round":"Παίξτε τον επόμενο γύρο","Resume saved round":"Η συνέχιση αποθηκεύτηκε","Delete saved round":"Διαγραφή αποθηκευμένου γύρου","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Ξεκινήστε έναν γύρο ή συνεχίστε έναν αποθηκευμένο.","You":"Εσείς","Computer":"Υπολογιστής","Your hand":"Το χέρι σου","Computer cards":"Κάρτες υπολογιστή","Stock":"Απόθεμα","Discard pile":"Απορρίψτε το σωρό","Your melds":"Οι συγχωνεύσεις σας","Draw two cards":"Τραβήξτε δύο φύλλα","Take discard pile":"Πάρτε το σωρό απόρριψης","Discard selected card":"Απορρίψτε την επιλεγμένη κάρτα","Selected cards":"Επιλεγμένες κάρτες","Clear selection":"Διαγραφή επιλογής","Meld rank":"Συντήρηση κατάταξης","Lay down meld":"Αποθέστε το κράμα","Total score":"Συνολική βαθμολογία","Round points":"Στρογγυλά σημεία","Opening meld needs":"Απαιτείται τήξη ανοίγματος","Turn":"Στροφή","Choose New round to begin.":"Επιλέξτε Νέος γύρος για να ξεκινήσει.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Ο γύρος ξεκίνησε. Τραβήξτε δύο κάρτες.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Σειρά σας: τραβήξτε δύο φύλλα από το απόθεμα ή πάρτε το σωρό απόρριψης.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Αφήστε τις νόμιμες συνθέσεις αν θέλετε και, στη συνέχεια, απορρίψτε ένα φύλλο.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Ο υπολογιστής παίρνει τη σειρά του…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Τραβηγμένα δύο φύλλα. Κάντε τήξη ή απορρίψτε.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Απορρίψτε το σωρό. Κάντε τήξη ή απορρίψτε.","Meld placed.":"Συνδεθεί.","Card discarded.":"Η κάρτα απορρίφθηκε.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Αυτή η ενέργεια δεν είναι νόμιμη. Ελέγξτε τους κανόνες και τις επιλεγμένες κάρτες.","You went out and won the round.":"Βγήκες και κέρδισες τον γύρο.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Ο υπολογιστής έσβησε. Σκόραρε ο γύρος.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Το απόθεμα δεν μπορεί να παρέχει δύο κάρτες. Σκόραρε ο γύρος.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Φτάσατε τον στόχο και κερδίσατε το παιχνίδι!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Ο υπολογιστής έφτασε στο στόχο και κέρδισε το παιχνίδι.","The match is tied.":"Ο αγώνας είναι ισόπαλος.","Clean canasta":"Καθαρή κανάστα","Mixed canasta":"Μικτή κανάστα","You need a canasta before going out.":"Χρειάζεστε μια κανάστα πριν βγείτε έξω.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Η τοπική αποθήκευση δεν είναι διαθέσιμη σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. Μπορείτε να συνεχίσετε να παίζετε όσο αυτή η σελίδα παραμένει ανοιχτή.","Round saved on this device.":"Ο γύρος αποθηκεύτηκε σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Saved round resumed.":"Ο αποθηκευμένος γύρος συνεχίστηκε.","Saved round deleted.":"Ο αποθηκευμένος γύρος διαγράφηκε.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η ανάγνωση του αποθηκευμένου γύρου. Ξεκινήστε έναν νέο γύρο ή διαγράψτε την κατεστραμμένη αποθήκευση.","Card":"Κάρτα","Wild":"Άγρια","Frozen":"Κατεψυγμένο","Open":"Ανοιχτό","points":"βαθμοί","Twos":"Δύο","Threes":"Τρία","Fours":"Τέσσερα","Fives":"Πέντε","Sixes":"Εξι","Sevens":"Επτά","Eights":"Οχτάρια","Nines":"Εννιά","Tens":"Δεκάδες","Jacks":"Βύσματα","Queens":"Βασίλισσες","Kings":"Βασιλιάδες","Aces":"Άσσοι","Hearts":"Καρδιές","Diamonds":"Διαμάντια","Clubs":"Σύλλογοι","Spades":"Μπαστούνια","Joker":"Τζόκερ","Rules overview":"Επισκόπηση κανόνων","Canasta rules":"Κανόνες Canasta"},"es":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online: juego de cartas Canasta gratuito frente a computadora","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Juega Canasta para dos jugadores en línea contra una computadora local. Dibuja, fusiona, congela y toma la pila de descarte, construye canastas limpias o mixtas y realiza un seguimiento de la puntuación de la ronda. Gratis; Tus tarjetas permanecen en este dispositivo.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Juega una ronda completa de Canasta para dos jugadores en tu navegador. Forma combinaciones de filas iguales, usa dos y comodines como comodines y haz una canasta de siete cartas antes de salir.","A quick example":"Un ejemplo rápido","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Tres reyes naturales pueden abrir una combinación. Agrega cartas de ese rango en turnos posteriores; siete cartas naturales forman una canasta limpia que vale una bonificación de puntos 500, mientras que una combinación con comodines es una canasta mixta que vale puntos de bonificación 300.","How to play":"Cómo jugar","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Esta versión utiliza dos mazos estándar más cuatro comodines (cartas 108), cartas 15 por jugador y dos cartas extraídas del mazo en cada turno. Fusiona al menos tres cartas del mismo rango; los dos y los comodines son comodines, sin más comodines que las cartas naturales. La primera combinación debe alcanzar el umbral de puntos para su puntuación actual. Sólo se puede tomar una pila de descarte con dos cartas naturales que coincidan con su carta superior. Un comodín o un tres negro congela la pila. Necesitas al menos una canasta de siete cartas para salir.","Frequently asked questions":"Preguntas frecuentes","What is a canasta?":"¿Qué es una canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Una canasta es una combinación de siete o más cartas del mismo valor. Siete cartas naturales forman una canasta limpia (puntos de bonificación 500); una combinación que contiene un comodín se mezcla (puntos de bonificación 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"¿Cómo tomo la pila de descarte?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Mantén dos cartas naturales que coincidan con el descarte superior. La pila se congela cuando su carta superior es un comodín o un tres negro. También debes poder hacer una combinación legal con la carta superior según tu requisito de apertura.","When can I go out?":"¿Cuándo puedo salir?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Puedes vaciar tu mano sólo después de que tu lado tenga una canasta de siete cartas. La última carta se descarta; Esta versión no utiliza variaciones de permiso de mano oculta o de pareja.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"¿Cómo se calcula la combinación de apertura?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"El mínimo es 50 puntos por debajo de los puntos acumulados de 1,500, 90 de 1,500, 120 de 3,000 y 150 de 5,000. Los puntos de fusión existentes no cuentan para una nueva apertura.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"¿Mi juego está subido o guardado?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"No se ha subido ningún juego. Guardar es opcional y utiliza el almacenamiento local en este navegador en este dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Reglas y limitaciones","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Esta es una variante casual para dos jugadores contra un simple oponente de computadora local, no es multijugador en línea ni juegos de azar. Utiliza el objetivo común de puntos 5,000, el reparto de cartas 15, el sorteo de dos cartas y los umbrales de apertura basados ​​en la puntuación. Las reglas de la mesa difieren: esta versión no implementa el permiso de asociación para salir, bonificaciones especiales de mano oculta, opciones de reemplazo de tres rojos ni reglas personalizadas. Si el mazo no puede suministrar dos cartas, se puntúa la ronda.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis para jugar. Tu mano y tu puntuación permanecen en este navegador en este dispositivo; no se cargan datos del juego.","Play Canasta":"Jugar Canasta","Related tools":"Herramientas relacionadas","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · SE EJECUTA EN TU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"Verso útil","All tools":"Todas las herramientas","New round":"Nueva ronda","Play next round":"Jugar la siguiente ronda","Resume saved round":"Reanudar ronda guardada","Delete saved round":"Eliminar ronda guardada","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Iniciar una ronda o reanudar una guardada.","You":"Tú","Computer":"Computadora","Your hand":"Tu mano","Computer cards":"Tarjetas de ordenador","Stock":"Valores","Discard pile":"Pila de descarte","Your melds":"Tus fusiones","Draw two cards":"Roba dos cartas","Take discard pile":"Tomar pila de descarte","Discard selected card":"Descartar tarjeta seleccionada","Selected cards":"Tarjetas seleccionadas","Clear selection":"Borrar selección","Meld rank":"Rango de fusión","Lay down meld":"Establecer fusión","Total score":"Puntuación total","Round points":"Puntas redondas","Opening meld needs":"Necesidades de fusión de apertura","Turn":"Girar","Choose New round to begin.":"Elija Nueva ronda para comenzar.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Ronda iniciada. Roba dos cartas.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Tu turno: roba dos cartas del mazo o toma la pila de descarte.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Establece combinaciones legales si lo deseas y luego descarta una carta.","Computer is taking its turn…":"La computadora está tomando su turno…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Dos cartas robadas. Haga fusiones o deséchelas.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Se ha tomado la pila de descarte. Haga fusiones o deséchelas.","Meld placed.":"Fusión colocada.","Card discarded.":"Tarjeta descartada.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Esa acción no es legal. Consulta las reglas y las cartas seleccionadas.","You went out and won the round.":"Saliste y ganaste la ronda.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"La computadora se apagó. Ronda anotada.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"El stock no puede suministrar dos tarjetas. Ronda anotada.","You reached the target and won the game!":"¡Alcanzaste el objetivo y ganaste el juego!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"La computadora alcanzó el objetivo y ganó el juego.","The match is tied.":"El partido está empatado.","Clean canasta":"Canasta limpia","Mixed canasta":"Canasta mixta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Necesitas una canasta antes de salir.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"El guardado local no está disponible en este navegador. Puedes seguir jugando mientras esta página permanezca abierta.","Round saved on this device.":"Ronda guardada en este dispositivo.","Saved round resumed.":"Se reanudó la ronda guardada.","Saved round deleted.":"Ronda guardada eliminada.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"No se pudo leer la ronda guardada. Comienza una nueva ronda o elimina el guardado dañado.","Card":"Tarjeta","Wild":"Salvaje","Frozen":"Congelado","Open":"Abierto","points":"puntos","Twos":"Dos","Threes":"Tres","Fours":"Cuatro","Fives":"Cincos","Sixes":"Seises","Sevens":"Siete","Eights":"Ochos","Nines":"Nueve","Tens":"Decenas","Jacks":"Conectores","Queens":"Reinas","Kings":"Reyes","Aces":"Ases","Hearts":"Corazones","Diamonds":"Diamantes","Clubs":"Palos","Spades":"Espadas","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Resumen de reglas","Canasta rules":"Reglas de Canasta"},"fa":{"Canasta":"کاناستا","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta آنلاین — بازی کارتی رایگان Canasta در مقابل رایانه","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Canasta دو نفره را به صورت آنلاین در برابر رایانه محلی بازی کنید. شمع دور ریختنی را بکشید، مخلوط کنید، فریز کنید و بردارید، کاناستاهای تمیز یا مخلوط بسازید و امتیاز گرد را دنبال کنید. رایگان؛ کارت های شما روی این دستگاه می ماند.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"یک دور کامل Canasta دو نفره را در مرورگر خود بازی کنید. ترکیبی از رتبه های منطبق ایجاد کنید، از دو و جوکر به عنوان کارت های وحشی استفاده کنید و قبل از بیرون رفتن یک کاناستا از هفت کارت درست کنید.","A quick example":"یک مثال سریع","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"سه پادشاه طبیعی می توانند یک ترکیب را باز کنند. کارت هایی از آن رتبه را در نوبت های بعدی اضافه کنید. هفت کارت طبیعی، یک کاناستای تمیز را به ارزش یک امتیاز 500 می‌سازد، در حالی که یک ترکیب با کارت‌های وحشی، یک کاناستا ترکیبی به ارزش 300 امتیاز پاداش است.","How to play":"نحوه بازی","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"این نسخه از دو عرشه استاندارد به‌علاوه چهار جوکر (کارت‌های 108)، کارت‌های 15 برای هر بازیکن و دو کارتی که از سهام در هر نوبت کشیده می‌شود، استفاده می‌کند. حداقل سه کارت از یک رتبه را مخلوط کنید. دو و جوکرها وحشی هستند، وحشی تر از کارت های طبیعی نیستند. اولین ترکیب باید آستانه امتیاز امتیاز فعلی شما را برآورده کند. یک شمع دور انداختن را می توان تنها با دو کارت طبیعی که با کارت بالایی آن مطابقت دارند، برداشت. کارت وحشی یا سه سیاه رنگ توده را منجمد می کند. برای بیرون رفتن به حداقل یک کاناستای هفت کارتی نیاز دارید.","Frequently asked questions":"سوالات متداول","What is a canasta?":"کاناستا چیست؟","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"یک کاناستا ترکیبی از هفت کارت یا بیشتر از همان رتبه است. هفت کارت طبیعی یک کاناستای تمیز ایجاد می کنند (امتیاز جایزه 500)؛ ترکیبی حاوی کارت وحشی مخلوط شده است (امتیاز جایزه 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"چگونه شمع دور ریختنی را بگیرم؟","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"دو کارت طبیعی مطابق با کارت بالا نگه دارید. وقتی کارت بالای آن یک کارت وحشی یا سه سیاه باشد، شمع منجمد می شود. شما همچنین باید بتوانید با کارت برتر تحت شرایط افتتاحیه خود یک ترکیب قانونی ایجاد کنید.","When can I go out?":"چه زمانی می توانم بیرون بروم؟","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"فقط زمانی که طرفتان یک کاناستای هفت کارتی داشت، می توانید دست خود را خالی کنید. کارت نهایی دور انداخته می شود. این نسخه از تغییرات دست پنهان یا مجوز شریک استفاده نمی کند.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"مخلوط بازشو چگونه محاسبه می شود؟","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"حداقل امتیاز 50 کمتر از امتیاز تجمعی 1,500، 90 از 1,500، 120 از 3,000 و 150 از 5,000 است. نقاط ذوب موجود برای باز شدن جدید به حساب نمی آیند.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"آیا بازی من آپلود شده یا ذخیره شده است؟","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"هیچ بازی آپلود نشده است ذخیره اختیاری است و از حافظه محلی در این مرورگر در این دستگاه استفاده می کند.","Rules and limitations":"قوانین و محدودیت ها","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"این یک نوع معمولی دو نفره در برابر یک حریف ساده رایانه محلی است، نه چند نفره آنلاین یا قمار. از هدف مشترک امتیاز 5,000، معامله کارت 15، قرعه کشی دو کارت و آستانه های باز مبتنی بر امتیاز استفاده می کند. قوانین جدول متفاوت است: این نسخه مجوز شراکت برای بیرون رفتن، پاداش های ویژه پنهان، انتخاب های قرمز-سه جایگزین، یا قوانین خانه سفارشی را اجرا نمی کند. اگر سهام نتواند دو کارت را ارائه کند، دور امتیاز می گیرد.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"رایگان برای بازی. دست و امتیاز شما در این مرورگر در این دستگاه باقی می ماند. هیچ داده بازی آپلود نمی شود.","Play Canasta":"بازی Canasta","Related tools":"ابزارهای مرتبط","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"رایگان · در مرورگر شما اجرا می شود","Language":"زبان","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"کلیه ابزار","New round":"دور جدید","Play next round":"بازی دور بعدی","Resume saved round":"رزومه ذخیره شد","Delete saved round":"حذف دور ذخیره شده","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"یک دور را شروع کنید یا یک راند ذخیره شده را از سر بگیرید.","You":"شما","Computer":"کامپیوتر","Your hand":"دست تو","Computer cards":"کارت های کامپیوتر","Stock":"موجودی","Discard pile":"توده را دور بیندازید","Your melds":"ترکیبات شما","Draw two cards":"دو کارت بکشید","Take discard pile":"شمع را دور بیندازید","Discard selected card":"کارت انتخابی را دور بریزید","Selected cards":"کارت های منتخب","Clear selection":"انتخاب را پاک کنید","Meld rank":"رتبه ادغام","Lay down meld":"ملد را دراز کنید","Total score":"امتیاز کل","Round points":"نقاط گرد","Opening meld needs":"نیازهای ذوب باز","Turn":"پیچ","Choose New round to begin.":"برای شروع دور جدید را انتخاب کنید.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"دور شروع شد. دو کارت بکشید.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"نوبت شماست: دو کارت از انبار بکشید یا انباشته را بردارید.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"در صورت تمایل، ترکیبات قانونی را بگذارید، سپس یک کارت را دور بریزید.","Computer is taking its turn…":"کامپیوتر نوبت خود را می گیرد…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"دو کارت کشیده شده. مخلوط کنید یا دور بریزید.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"توده برداشته شده را دور بیندازید. مخلوط کنید یا دور بریزید.","Meld placed.":"ذوب شده.","Card discarded.":"کارت دور انداخته شد.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"این اقدام قانونی نیست. قوانین و کارت های انتخابی را بررسی کنید.","You went out and won the round.":"تو بیرون رفتی و راند را بردی.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"کامپیوتر خاموش شد. راند به ثمر رسید.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"سهام نمی تواند دو کارت را تامین کند. راند به ثمر رسید.","You reached the target and won the game!":"تو به هدف رسیدی و بازی را بردی!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"کامپیوتر به هدف رسید و بازی را برد.","The match is tied.":"بازی مساوی است.","Clean canasta":"کاناستا تمیز","Mixed canasta":"کاناستا مخلوط","You need a canasta before going out.":"قبل از بیرون رفتن به کاناستا نیاز دارید.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"ذخیره محلی در این مرورگر در دسترس نیست. تا زمانی که این صفحه باز است، می‌توانید به بازی ادامه دهید.","Round saved on this device.":"Round در این دستگاه ذخیره شده است.","Saved round resumed.":"دور ذخیره شده از سر گرفته شد.","Saved round deleted.":"دور ذخیره شده حذف شد.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"دور ذخیره شده خوانده نشد. یک دور جدید شروع کنید یا ذخیره آسیب دیده را حذف کنید.","Card":"کارت","Wild":"وحشی","Frozen":"یخ زده","Open":"باز","points":"امتیاز","Twos":"دو","Threes":"سه","Fours":"چهار","Fives":"پنج","Sixes":"شش","Sevens":"هفت","Eights":"هشت","Nines":"نه","Tens":"ده","Jacks":"جک","Queens":"کوئینز","Kings":"پادشاهان","Aces":"Aces","Hearts":"قلب","Diamonds":"الماس","Clubs":"باشگاه","Spades":"بیل","Joker":"جوکر","Rules overview":"مروری بر قوانین","Canasta rules":"قوانین کاناستا"},"fr":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Jeu de cartes Canasta gratuit contre ordinateur","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Jouez à Canasta à deux joueurs en ligne contre un ordinateur local. Dessinez, fusionnez, congelez et prenez la pile de défausse, construisez des canastas propres ou mélangées et suivez le score du tour. Gratuit; vos cartes restent sur cet appareil.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Jouez une partie Canasta complète à deux joueurs dans votre navigateur. Formez des combinaisons de rangs correspondants, utilisez des deux et des jokers comme jokers et faites une canasta de sept cartes avant de sortir.","A quick example":"Un exemple rapide","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Trois rois naturels peuvent ouvrir une fusion. Ajoutez des cartes de ce rang au cours des tours ultérieurs ; sept cartes naturelles donnent une canasta propre valant un bonus de points 500, tandis qu'une combinaison avec des jokers donne une canasta mixte valant des points bonus 300.","How to play":"Comment jouer","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Cette version utilise deux jeux standards plus quatre jokers (cartes 108), des cartes 15 par joueur et deux cartes tirées du stock à chaque tour. Fusionnez au moins trois cartes d’un même rang ; les deux et les jokers sont des jokers, avec pas plus de jokers que les cartes naturelles. La première combinaison doit atteindre le seuil de points pour votre score actuel. Une pile de défausse ne peut être prise qu'avec deux cartes naturelles correspondant à sa carte du dessus. Un joker ou un trois noir gèle la pile. Il faut au moins une canasta à sept cartes pour sortir.","Frequently asked questions":"Questions fréquemment posées","What is a canasta?":"Qu'est-ce qu'une canasta ?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Une canasta est une combinaison de sept cartes ou plus du même rang. Sept cartes naturelles forment une canasta propre (points bonus 500) ; une fusion contenant un joker est mélangée (points bonus 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Comment puis-je récupérer la pile de défausse ?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Maintenez deux cartes naturelles correspondant à la défausse du haut. La pile est gelée lorsque sa première carte est un joker ou un trois noir. Vous devez également être capable de faire une fusion légale avec la carte du dessus selon vos conditions d'ouverture.","When can I go out?":"Quand puis-je sortir ?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Vous ne pouvez vider votre main qu'après que votre camp ait une canasta de sept cartes. La dernière carte est défaussée ; cette version n'utilise pas de variantes d'autorisation cachée ou de partenaire.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Comment la fusion d'ouverture est-elle calculée ?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Le minimum est de points 50 en dessous des points cumulés 1,500, 90 de 1,500, 120 de 3,000 et 150 de 5,000. Les points de fusion existants ne sont pas pris en compte pour une nouvelle ouverture.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Mon jeu est-il téléchargé ou enregistré ?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Aucun jeu n'est téléchargé. L'enregistrement est facultatif et utilise le stockage local dans ce navigateur sur cet appareil.","Rules and limitations":"Règles et limitations","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Il s'agit d'une variante décontractée à deux joueurs contre un simple adversaire informatique local, et non en mode multijoueur ou en ligne. Il utilise l'objectif commun de points 5,000, la distribution de cartes 15, le tirage à deux cartes et les seuils d'ouverture basés sur le score. Les règles de la table diffèrent : cette version n'implémente pas l'autorisation de sortie du partenariat, les bonus spéciaux de main cachée, les choix de remplacement à trois rouges ou les règles de la maison personnalisées. Si le stock ne peut pas fournir deux cartes, le tour est marqué.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Jeu gratuit. Votre main et votre score restent dans ce navigateur sur cet appareil ; aucune donnée de jeu n'est téléchargée.","Play Canasta":"Jouer à Canasta","Related tools":"Outils associés","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUIT · FONCTIONNE DANS VOTRE NAVIGATEUR","Language":"Langue","UsefulVerse":"Verse utile","All tools":"Tous les outils","New round":"Nouveau rond","Play next round":"Jouer le tour suivant","Resume saved round":"Reprendre le tour enregistré","Delete saved round":"Supprimer le tour enregistré","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Démarrez une ronde ou reprenez une ronde enregistrée.","You":"Vous","Computer":"Ordinateur","Your hand":"Votre main","Computer cards":"Cartes informatiques","Stock":"Stock","Discard pile":"Pile de défausse","Your melds":"Vos fusions","Draw two cards":"Piochez deux cartes","Take discard pile":"Prendre la pile de défausse","Discard selected card":"Rejeter la carte sélectionnée","Selected cards":"Cartes sélectionnées","Clear selection":"Effacer la sélection","Meld rank":"Rang de fusion","Lay down meld":"Mélange à poser","Total score":"Note totale","Round points":"Points ronds","Opening meld needs":"Besoins de fusion d'ouverture","Turn":"Tourner","Choose New round to begin.":"Choisissez Nouveau cycle pour commencer.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Tour démarré. Piochez deux cartes.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"À votre tour : piochez deux cartes du stock ou prenez la pile de défausse.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Établissez des combinaisons légales si vous le souhaitez, puis défaussez une carte.","Computer is taking its turn…":"L'ordinateur prend son tour…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Deux cartes tirées. Faites des mélanges ou jetez-les.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Défaussez la pile prise. Faites des mélanges ou jetez-les.","Meld placed.":"Fusion placée.","Card discarded.":"Carte rejetée.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Cette action n'est pas légale. Vérifiez les règles et les cartes sélectionnées.","You went out and won the round.":"Vous êtes sorti et avez remporté la manche.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"L'ordinateur s'est éteint. Tour marqué.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Le stock ne peut pas fournir deux cartes. Tour marqué.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Vous avez atteint l'objectif et gagné la partie !","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"L'ordinateur a atteint la cible et a gagné la partie.","The match is tied.":"Le match est à égalité.","Clean canasta":"Canasta propre","Mixed canasta":"Canasta mixte","You need a canasta before going out.":"Vous avez besoin d'une canasta avant de sortir.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"L'enregistrement local n'est pas disponible dans ce navigateur. Vous pouvez continuer à jouer pendant que cette page reste ouverte.","Round saved on this device.":"Tour enregistré sur cet appareil.","Saved round resumed.":"Reprise du tour enregistré.","Saved round deleted.":"Tour enregistré supprimé.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Le tour enregistré n'a pas pu être lu. Commencez un nouveau tour ou supprimez la sauvegarde endommagée.","Card":"Carte","Wild":"Sauvage","Frozen":"Congelé","Open":"Ouvrir","points":"points","Twos":"Deux","Threes":"Trois","Fours":"Quatre","Fives":"Cinq","Sixes":"Six","Sevens":"Sept","Eights":"Huit","Nines":"Neuf","Tens":"Dizaines","Jacks":"Vérins","Queens":"Reines","Kings":"Rois","Aces":"As","Hearts":"Cœurs","Diamonds":"Diamants","Clubs":"Clubs","Spades":"Pique","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Présentation des règles","Canasta rules":"Règles Canasta"},"gu":{"Canasta":"કેનાસ્ટા","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"કેનાસ્ટા ઓનલાઇન — ફ્રી કેનાસ્ટા કાર્ડ ગેમ વિ કમ્પ્યુટર","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર સામે બે-પ્લેયર કેનાસ્ટા ઑનલાઇન રમો. દોરો, મેલ્ડ કરો, ફ્રીઝ કરો અને કાઢી નાખો ખૂંટો લો, સ્વચ્છ અથવા મિશ્રિત કેનાસ્ટા બનાવો અને રાઉન્ડ સ્કોર ટ્રૅક કરો. મફત; તમારા કાર્ડ આ ઉપકરણ પર રહે છે.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં સંપૂર્ણ બે-પ્લેયર કેનાસ્ટા રાઉન્ડ રમો. મેચિંગ રેન્કના મેલ્ડ્સ બનાવો, વાઇલ્ડ કાર્ડ તરીકે ટુ અને જોકરનો ઉપયોગ કરો અને બહાર જતા પહેલા સાત કાર્ડનો કેનાસ્ટા બનાવો.","A quick example":"એક ઝડપી ઉદાહરણ","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"ત્રણ કુદરતી રાજાઓ મેલ્ડ ખોલી શકે છે. પછીના વળાંક પર તે રેન્કના કાર્ડ્સ ઉમેરો; સાત નેચરલ કાર્ડ 500-પોઇન્ટ બોનસના મૂલ્યનો સ્વચ્છ કેનાસ્ટા બનાવે છે, જ્યારે વાઇલ્ડ કાર્ડ્સ સાથેનું મિશ્રણ 300 બોનસ પોઈન્ટનું મિશ્રિત કેનાસ્ટા છે.","How to play":"કેવી રીતે રમવું","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"આ સંસ્કરણ બે સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ ડેક વત્તા ચાર જોકર્સ (108 કાર્ડ્સ), ખેલાડી દીઠ 15 કાર્ડ્સ અને દરેક વળાંક પર સ્ટોકમાંથી દોરેલા બે કાર્ડનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. એક રેન્કના ઓછામાં ઓછા ત્રણ કાર્ડ મેળવો; twos અને jokers જંગલી છે, જેમાં કુદરતી કાર્ડ્સ કરતાં વધુ જંગલી નથી. પ્રથમ મેલ્ડ તમારા વર્તમાન સ્કોર માટે પોઈન્ટ થ્રેશોલ્ડને મળવું આવશ્યક છે. કાઢી નાખવાનો ખૂંટો તેના ટોચના કાર્ડ સાથે મેળ ખાતા બે કુદરતી કાર્ડ સાથે જ લઈ શકાય છે. વાઇલ્ડ કાર્ડ અથવા બ્લેક થ્રી થાંભલાને સ્થિર કરે છે. બહાર જવા માટે તમારે ઓછામાં ઓછા એક સાત કાર્ડ કેનાસ્ટાની જરૂર છે.","Frequently asked questions":"વારંવાર પૂછાતા પ્રશ્નો","What is a canasta?":"કેનાસ્ટા શું છે?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"એ કેનાસ્ટા એ સમાન રેન્કના સાત કે તેથી વધુ કાર્ડ્સનું મિશ્રણ છે. સાત કુદરતી કાર્ડ સ્વચ્છ કેનાસ્ટા બનાવે છે (500 બોનસ પોઈન્ટ્સ); વાઇલ્ડ કાર્ડ ધરાવતા મેલ્ડને મિશ્રિત કરવામાં આવે છે (300 બોનસ પોઇન્ટ).","How do I take the discard pile?":"હું કાઢી નાખવાનો ખૂંટો કેવી રીતે લઈ શકું?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"ટોચના કાઢી નાખવા સાથે મેળ ખાતા બે કુદરતી કાર્ડ પકડો. જ્યારે તેનું ટોચનું કાર્ડ વાઇલ્ડ કાર્ડ અથવા બ્લેક થ્રી હોય ત્યારે ખૂંટો જામી જાય છે. તમે તમારી શરૂઆતની જરૂરિયાત હેઠળ ટોચના કાર્ડ સાથે કાનૂની મેળાપ કરવા માટે પણ સક્ષમ હોવા જોઈએ.","When can I go out?":"હું ક્યારે બહાર જઈ શકું?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"તમારી બાજુમાં સાત કાર્ડ કેનાસ્ટા હોય તે પછી જ તમે તમારો હાથ ખાલી કરી શકો છો. અંતિમ કાર્ડ કાઢી નાખવામાં આવે છે; આ સંસ્કરણ છુપાયેલા હાથ અથવા ભાગીદાર-પરવાનગીની વિવિધતાઓનો ઉપયોગ કરતું નથી.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"ઓપનિંગ મેલ્ડની ગણતરી કેવી રીતે કરવામાં આવે છે?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"1,500 કુલ પોઇન્ટથી ઓછા સ્કોર માટે લઘુત્તમ 50 પોઇન્ટ છે; 1,500થી 90, 3,000થી 120 અને 5,000થી 150. નવા મેલ્ડની શરૂઆત માટે અગાઉના મેલ્ડના પોઇન્ટ ગણાતા નથી.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"શું મારી રમત અપલોડ કરવામાં આવી છે અથવા સાચવવામાં આવી છે?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"કોઈ રમત અપલોડ કરવામાં આવી નથી. બચત વૈકલ્પિક છે અને આ ઉપકરણ પર આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં સ્થાનિક સ્ટોરેજનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે.","Rules and limitations":"નિયમો અને મર્યાદાઓ","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"આ એક સામાન્ય સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર પ્રતિસ્પર્ધી સામે બે-ખેલાડીઓનું કેઝ્યુઅલ વેરિઅન્ટ છે, ઓનલાઈન મલ્ટિપ્લેયર અથવા જુગાર નહીં. તે સામાન્ય 5,000-પોઇન્ટ લક્ષ્ય, 15-કાર્ડ ડીલ, બે-કાર્ડ ડ્રો અને સ્કોર-આધારિત ઓપનિંગ થ્રેશોલ્ડનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. કોષ્ટકના નિયમો અલગ-અલગ છે: આ સંસ્કરણ બહાર જવાની ભાગીદારી પરવાનગી, ખાસ છુપાવેલા-હાથ બોનસ, લાલ-ત્રણ રિપ્લેસમેન્ટ પસંદગીઓ અથવા કસ્ટમ હાઉસ નિયમોનો અમલ કરતું નથી. જો સ્ટોક બે કાર્ડ સપ્લાય કરી શકતો નથી, તો રાઉન્ડ સ્કોર કરવામાં આવે છે.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"રમવા માટે મફત. તમારા હાથ અને સ્કોર આ ઉપકરણ પર આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે; કોઈ રમત ડેટા અપલોડ કરવામાં આવ્યો નથી.","Play Canasta":"Canasta રમો","Related tools":"સંબંધિત સાધનો","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"મફત · તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે","Language":"ભાષા","UsefulVerse":"ઉપયોગી પદ્ય","All tools":"તમામ સાધનો","New round":"નવો રાઉન્ડ","Play next round":"આગલો રાઉન્ડ રમો","Resume saved round":"સેવ કરેલ રાઉન્ડ ફરી શરૂ કરો","Delete saved round":"સેવ કરેલ રાઉન્ડ કાઢી નાખો","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"એક રાઉન્ડ શરૂ કરો અથવા સાચવેલ એક ફરી શરૂ કરો.","You":"તમે","Computer":"કોમ્પ્યુટર","Your hand":"તમારો હાથ","Computer cards":"કોમ્પ્યુટર કાર્ડ્સ","Stock":"સ્ટોક","Discard pile":"પાઈલ કાઢી નાખો","Your melds":"તમારા મેલ્ડ્સ","Draw two cards":"બે કાર્ડ દોરો","Take discard pile":"કાઢી નાખો","Discard selected card":"પસંદ કરેલ કાર્ડ કાઢી નાખો","Selected cards":"પસંદ કરેલ કાર્ડ્સ","Clear selection":"પસંદગી સાફ કરો","Meld rank":"મેલ્ડ રેન્ક","Lay down meld":"લે ડાઉન મેલ્ડ","Total score":"કુલ સ્કોર","Round points":"ગોળ પોઈન્ટ","Opening meld needs":"ઓપનિંગ મેલ્ડ જરૂરિયાતો","Turn":"ટર્ન","Choose New round to begin.":"શરૂ કરવા માટે નવો રાઉન્ડ પસંદ કરો.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"રાઉન્ડ શરૂ થયો. બે કાર્ડ દોરો.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"તમારો વારો: સ્ટોકમાંથી બે કાર્ડ દોરો અથવા કાઢી નાખો.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"જો તમે ઈચ્છો તો કાનૂની મેળાપ મૂકો, પછી એક કાર્ડ કાઢી નાખો.","Computer is taking its turn…":"કોમ્પ્યુટર તેનો વળાંક લઈ રહ્યું છે…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"બે કાર્ડ દોર્યા. મેલ્ડ બનાવો અથવા કાઢી નાખો.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"લીધેલ પાઇલ કાઢી નાખો. મેલ્ડ બનાવો અથવા કાઢી નાખો.","Meld placed.":"મેલ્ડ મૂકવામાં આવ્યું.","Card discarded.":"કાર્ડ કાઢી નાખ્યું.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"તે ક્રિયા કાયદેસર નથી. નિયમો અને પસંદ કરેલા કાર્ડ્સ તપાસો.","You went out and won the round.":"તમે બહાર ગયા અને રાઉન્ડ જીત્યા.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"કોમ્પ્યુટર નીકળી ગયું. રાઉન્ડ સ્કોર કર્યો.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"સ્ટૉક બે કાર્ડ સપ્લાય કરી શકતું નથી. રાઉન્ડ સ્કોર કર્યો.","You reached the target and won the game!":"તમે લક્ષ્ય સુધી પહોંચી ગયા અને રમત જીતી લીધી!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"કોમ્પ્યુટર લક્ષ્ય સુધી પહોંચ્યું અને રમત જીતી લીધી.","The match is tied.":"મેચ ટાઈ થઈ.","Clean canasta":"ક્લીન કેનાસ્ટા","Mixed canasta":"મિશ્રિત કેનાસ્ટા","You need a canasta before going out.":"બહાર જતા પહેલા તમારે કેનાસ્ટાની જરૂર છે.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"સ્થાનિક બચત આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં અનુપલબ્ધ છે. આ પૃષ્ઠ ખુલ્લું રહે ત્યાં સુધી તમે રમવાનું ચાલુ રાખી શકો છો.","Round saved on this device.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર રાઉન્ડ સાચવેલ.","Saved round resumed.":"સાચવેલ રાઉન્ડ ફરી શરૂ થયો.","Saved round deleted.":"સાચવેલ રાઉન્ડ કાઢી નાખ્યો.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"સાચવેલ રાઉન્ડ વાંચી શકાયો નથી. નવો રાઉન્ડ શરૂ કરો અથવા ક્ષતિગ્રસ્ત સેવ કાઢી નાખો.","Card":"કાર્ડ","Wild":"વાઇલ્ડ","Frozen":"ફ્રોઝન","Open":"ઓપન","points":"પોઇન્ટ્સ","Twos":"બે","Threes":"ત્રણ","Fours":"ફોર્સ","Fives":"ફાઇવ્સ","Sixes":"છગ્ગા","Sevens":"સેવન્સ","Eights":"આઠ","Nines":"નાઈન્સ","Tens":"ટેન્સ","Jacks":"જેક્સ","Queens":"ક્વીન્સ","Kings":"કિંગ્સ","Aces":"એસેસ","Hearts":"હાર્ટ્સ","Diamonds":"હીરા","Clubs":"ક્લબ્સ","Spades":"Spades","Joker":"જોકર","Rules overview":"નિયમોની ઝાંખી","Canasta rules":"Canasta નિયમો"},"ha":{"Canasta":"Kanasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Kan layi - Wasan Katin Canasta Kyauta vs Kwamfuta","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Kwana Canasta mai wasa biyu akan layi akan kwamfutar gida. Zana, niƙa, daskare kuma ɗauki tari da aka jefar, gina tsaftataccen magudanar ruwa ko gauraye da bibiyar makin zagaye. Kyauta; katunanku suna tsayawa akan wannan na'urar.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Kwasa cikakken ɗan wasa biyu Canasta a cikin burauzar ku. Ƙirƙiri nau'i-nau'i na ma'auni, yi amfani da biyu da masu barkwanci azaman katunan daji, da yin katunan katunan bakwai kafin fita.","A quick example":"Misali mai sauri","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Sarakuna na halitta guda uku na iya buɗewa. Ƙara katunan wannan matsayi akan juyi na gaba; Katunan halitta guda bakwai suna yin tsaftataccen canasta mai daraja 500-point bonus, yayin da meld tare da katunan daji shine cakudewar canasta mai daraja 300 maki bonus.","How to play":"Yadda ake wasa","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Wannan sigar tana amfani da daidaitattun bene guda biyu da masu jokers huɗu (katunan 108), katunan 15 kowane ɗan wasa da katunan biyu da aka zana daga hannun jari kowane juzu'i. Meld aƙalla katunan uku na matsayi ɗaya; 'yan biyu da masu barkwanci suna daji, ba tare da wani daji fiye da katunan halitta ba. Dole ne meld ɗin farko ya haɗu da maƙasudin maƙiyan don maki na yanzu. Za a iya ɗaukar tari da aka jefar kawai tare da katunan halitta guda biyu waɗanda suka dace da babban katin sa. Katin daji ko baki uku yana daskare tarin. Kuna buƙatar aƙalla kansta mai katin bakwai don fita.","Frequently asked questions":"Tambayoyin da ake yawan yi","What is a canasta?":"Menene canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Canasta shine meld na katunan bakwai ko fiye na matsayi ɗaya. Katunan halitta bakwai suna yin canasta mai tsabta (500 bonus points); an gauraye meld mai ɗauke da katin daji (300 bonus points).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Ta yaya zan ɗauki takin jefar?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Riƙe katunan halitta guda biyu waɗanda suka dace da babban jefar. Tulin yana daskarewa lokacin da babban katin sa ya zama katin daji ko baki uku. Dole ne kuma ku sami damar yin meld ɗin doka tare da babban katin ƙarƙashin buƙatun ku na buɗewa.","When can I go out?":"Yaushe zan iya fita?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Kuna iya wanke hannun ku kawai bayan gefen ku yana da canasta mai katin bakwai. An jefar da katin ƙarshe; wannan sigar baya amfani da ɓoyayyiyar hannu ko izinin haɗin gwiwa.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Yaya ake ƙididdige meld ɗin buɗewa?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Mafi ƙanƙanci shine maki 50 da ke ƙasa 1,500 maki tarawa, 90 daga 1,500, 120 daga 3,000 da 150 daga 5,000. Ba a ƙidaya abubuwan da suka wanzu zuwa sabon buɗewa.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"An loda wasana ko ajiyewa?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Babu wasa da aka loda. Ajiye abu ne na zaɓi kuma yana amfani da ma'ajiyar gida a cikin wannan mai binciken akan wannan na'urar.","Rules and limitations":"Dokoki da iyakancewa","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Wannan bambance-bambancen ƴan wasa biyu ne na yau da kullun akan abokin hamayyar kwamfuta na gida mai sauƙi, ba masu wasa da yawa akan layi ko caca ba. Yana amfani da maƙasudin maƙasudin 5,000 na kowa, yarjejeniyar katin 15, zane-zane biyu da madaidaicin buɗaɗɗen maki. Sharuɗɗan tebur sun bambanta: wannan sigar baya aiwatar da izinin haɗin gwiwa don fita, kari na ɓoye na musamman, zaɓin maye-ja-uku, ko dokokin gida na al'ada. Idan hannun jari ba zai iya samar da katunan biyu ba, ana yin zagaye.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Kyauta don yin wasa. Hannun ku da maki ku tsaya a cikin wannan burauzar akan wannan na'urar; ba a ɗora bayanan wasan ba.","Play Canasta":"Play Canasta","Related tools":"Kayan aiki masu alaƙa","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KYAUTA · Yana Gudu A CIKIN browsing","Language":"Harshe","UsefulVerse":"Verse Mai Amfani","All tools":"Duk kayan aikin","New round":"Sabon zagaye","Play next round":"Wansa zagaye na gaba","Resume saved round":"A ci gaba da zagaye da aka ajiye","Delete saved round":"Share dawafin da aka ajiye","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Fara zagaye ko ci gaba da ajiyewa.","You":"Kai","Computer":"Kwamfuta","Your hand":"Hannunku","Computer cards":"Katunan kwamfuta","Stock":"Hannun jari","Discard pile":"Yi watsi da tari","Your melds":"Matsalolin ku","Draw two cards":"Zana katunan biyu","Take discard pile":"Ɗauki tulin jefar","Discard selected card":"Yi watsi da katin da aka zaɓa","Selected cards":"Katunan da aka zaɓa","Clear selection":"Share zaɓi","Meld rank":"Babban daraja","Lay down meld":"Kwance meld","Total score":"Jimlar ci","Round points":"Maki","Opening meld needs":"Buƙatun buƙatun buɗewa","Turn":"Juya","Choose New round to begin.":"Zaɓi Sabon zagaye don farawa.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"An fara zagaye. Zana katunan biyu.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Juyin ku: zana katunan biyu daga hannun jari ko ɗauki tarin jefar.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Ajiye melds na doka idan kuna so, sannan ku jefar da kati ɗaya.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Kwamfuta yana ɗaukar lokacinsa…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Katuna biyu da aka zana. Yi melds ko jefar.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Ku jefar da tari da aka ɗauka. Yi melds ko jefar.","Meld placed.":"Mold sanya.","Card discarded.":"Katin da aka jefar.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Wannan matakin bai halatta ba. Bincika dokoki da katunan da aka zaɓa.","You went out and won the round.":"Kun fita kun ci zagayen.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Kwamfutar ta fita. Zagaye ya ci.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Haja ba zai iya samar da katunan biyu ba. Zagaye ya ci.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Kun kai ga manufa kuma kun ci wasan!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Kwamfutar ta kai ga burin kuma ta ci wasan.","The match is tied.":"An daura wasan.","Clean canasta":"Tsaftace canasta","Mixed canasta":"Canasta gauraye","You need a canasta before going out.":"Kuna buƙatar canasta kafin fita.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Babu ajiyar gida a cikin wannan mazugi. Kuna iya ci gaba da wasa yayin da wannan shafin ke buɗewa.","Round saved on this device.":"An ajiye zagaye akan wannan na'urar.","Saved round resumed.":"An ci gaba da zagayen da aka ajiye.","Saved round deleted.":"An share zagaye da aka ajiye.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Abin da aka ajiye ba a iya karantawa ba. Fara sabon zagaye ko share ajiyar da aka lalace.","Card":"Katin","Wild":"Daji","Frozen":"Daskararre","Open":"Buɗe","points":"maki","Twos":"Biyu","Threes":"Uku","Fours":"Hudu","Fives":"Biyar","Sixes":"Shida","Sevens":"Bakwai","Eights":"Takwas","Nines":"Nine","Tens":"Dubun","Jacks":"Jacks","Queens":"Sarauniya","Kings":"Sarakuna","Aces":"Aces","Hearts":"Zukatai","Diamonds":"Diamonds","Clubs":"Kungiyoyi","Spades":"Spades","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Bayanin dokoki","Canasta rules":"Canasta dokokin"},"hi":{"Canasta":"कैनास्टा","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"कैनास्टा ऑनलाइन — निःशुल्क कैनास्टा कार्ड गेम बनाम कंप्यूटर","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"स्थानीय कंप्यूटर के विरुद्ध दो-खिलाड़ियों वाला कैनास्टा ऑनलाइन खेलें। ड्रा करें, पिघलाएँ, फ़्रीज़ करें और हटाए गए ढेर को लें, साफ़ या मिश्रित कैनास्टा बनाएं और गोल स्कोर को ट्रैक करें। मुक्त; आपके कार्ड इस डिवाइस पर रहते हैं.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"अपने ब्राउज़र में संपूर्ण दो-खिलाड़ियों वाला कैनास्टा राउंड खेलें। मेल खाते रैंकों के मेल्ड बनाएं, वाइल्ड कार्ड के रूप में दो और जोकर का उपयोग करें, और बाहर जाने से पहले सात कार्डों का एक कैनास्टा बनाएं।","A quick example":"एक त्वरित उदाहरण","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"तीन प्राकृतिक राजा एक मेल्ड खोल सकते हैं। बाद के चरणों में उस रैंक के कार्ड जोड़ें; सात प्राकृतिक कार्ड 500-पॉइंट बोनस के लायक एक स्वच्छ कैनास्टा बनाते हैं, जबकि वाइल्ड कार्ड के साथ एक मेल्ड 300 बोनस पॉइंट के लायक एक मिश्रित कैनास्टा बनाता है।","How to play":"कैसे खेलें","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"यह संस्करण दो मानक डेक और चार जोकर (108 कार्ड), प्रति खिलाड़ी 15 कार्ड और प्रत्येक मोड़ पर स्टॉक से निकाले गए दो कार्ड का उपयोग करता है। एक रैंक के कम से कम तीन कार्ड मिलाएं; दो और जोकर जंगली हैं, प्राकृतिक कार्डों से अधिक जंगली नहीं हैं। पहला मेल्ड आपके वर्तमान स्कोर के लिए बिंदु सीमा को पूरा करना चाहिए। एक त्यागे गए ढेर को उसके शीर्ष पत्ते से मेल खाने वाले दो प्राकृतिक पत्तों के साथ ही लिया जा सकता है। एक वाइल्ड कार्ड या ब्लैक थ्री ढेर को जमा देता है। बाहर जाने के लिए आपको कम से कम एक सात-कार्ड कैनास्टा की आवश्यकता है।","Frequently asked questions":"अक्सर पूछे जाने वाले प्रश्न","What is a canasta?":"कैनस्टा क्या है?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"कैनास्टा एक ही रैंक के सात या अधिक कार्डों का एक मिश्रण है। सात प्राकृतिक कार्ड एक साफ़ कनास्टा बनाते हैं (500 बोनस अंक); वाइल्ड कार्ड वाला एक मेल्ड मिलाया जाता है (300 बोनस अंक)।","How do I take the discard pile?":"मैं त्यागे गए ढेर को कैसे ले सकता हूँ?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"शीर्ष त्यागें से मेल खाते हुए दो प्राकृतिक कार्ड पकड़ें। ढेर तब जम जाता है जब उसका शीर्ष कार्ड वाइल्ड कार्ड या ब्लैक थ्री हो। आपको अपनी प्रारंभिक आवश्यकता के तहत शीर्ष कार्ड के साथ कानूनी मेल बनाने में भी सक्षम होना चाहिए।","When can I go out?":"मैं कब बाहर जा सकता हूँ?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"आप अपना हाथ तभी खाली कर सकते हैं जब आपके पक्ष में सात-कार्ड का कैनास्टा हो। अंतिम कार्ड खारिज कर दिया गया है; यह संस्करण गुप्त-हाथ या भागीदार-अनुमति विविधताओं का उपयोग नहीं करता है।","How is the opening meld calculated?":"ओपनिंग मेल्ड की गणना कैसे की जाती है?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"न्यूनतम संचयी अंक 1,500 से नीचे 50 अंक है, 1,500 से 90, 3,000 से 120 और 5,000 से 150 है। मौजूदा मेल्ड पॉइंट को नए उद्घाटन में नहीं गिना जाता है।","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"क्या मेरा गेम अपलोड या सहेजा गया है?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"कोई गेम अपलोड नहीं किया गया है। सहेजना वैकल्पिक है और इस डिवाइस पर इस ब्राउज़र में स्थानीय संग्रहण का उपयोग करता है।","Rules and limitations":"नियम और सीमाएँ","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"यह एक साधारण स्थानीय कंप्यूटर प्रतिद्वंद्वी के खिलाफ एक आकस्मिक दो-खिलाड़ी संस्करण है, न कि ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेयर या जुआ। यह सामान्य 5,000-प्वाइंट लक्ष्य, 15-कार्ड डील, दो-कार्ड ड्रा और स्कोर-आधारित शुरुआती सीमा का उपयोग करता है। तालिका के नियम अलग-अलग हैं: यह संस्करण बाहर जाने के लिए साझेदारी की अनुमति, विशेष गुप्त-हस्त बोनस, लाल-तीन प्रतिस्थापन विकल्प या कस्टम हाउस नियमों को लागू नहीं करता है। यदि स्टॉक दो कार्डों की आपूर्ति नहीं कर सकता है, तो राउंड स्कोर किया जाता है।","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"खेलने के लिए निःशुल्क। आपका हाथ और स्कोर इस डिवाइस पर इस ब्राउज़र में रहता है; कोई गेम डेटा अपलोड नहीं किया गया है.","Play Canasta":"कैनास्टा चलायें","Related tools":"संबंधित उपकरण","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"मुफ़्त · आपके ब्राउज़र में चलता है","Language":"भाषा","UsefulVerse":"उपयोगी श्लोक","All tools":"सभी उपकरण","New round":"नया दौर","Play next round":"अगला राउंड खेलें","Resume saved round":"सहेजे गए दौर को फिर से शुरू करें","Delete saved round":"सहेजे गए राउंड को हटाएं","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"एक राउंड प्रारंभ करें या सहेजे गए राउंड को फिर से शुरू करें।","You":"आप","Computer":"कंप्यूटर","Your hand":"आपका हाथ","Computer cards":"कंप्यूटर कार्ड","Stock":"स्टॉक","Discard pile":"ढेर त्यागें","Your melds":"आपका मेल","Draw two cards":"दो कार्ड बनाएं","Take discard pile":"डिस्कार्ड पाइल लें","Discard selected card":"चयनित कार्ड को त्यागें","Selected cards":"चयनित कार्ड","Clear selection":"चयन साफ़ करें","Meld rank":"मेल्ड रैंक","Lay down meld":"लेट मेल्ड","Total score":"कुल स्कोर","Round points":"गोल बिंदु","Opening meld needs":"ओपनिंग मेल्ड आवश्यकताएँ","Turn":"बारी","Choose New round to begin.":"शुरू करने के लिए नया दौर चुनें।","Round started. Draw two cards.":"राउंड शुरू हुआ। दो कार्ड बनाएं.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"आपकी बारी: स्टॉक से दो कार्ड निकालें या त्यागें गए ढेर को ले लें।","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"यदि आप चाहें तो कानूनी शर्तें छोड़ें, फिर एक कार्ड हटा दें।","Computer is taking its turn…":"कंप्यूटर अपनी बारी ले रहा है...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"दो कार्ड निकाले गए। मेल्ड बनाओ या त्याग दो।","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"लिया गया ढेर त्यागें। मेल्ड बनाओ या त्याग दो।","Meld placed.":"मेल्ड रखा गया।","Card discarded.":"कार्ड खारिज कर दिया गया।","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"वह कार्रवाई कानूनी नहीं है। नियमों और चयनित कार्डों की जाँच करें।","You went out and won the round.":"आप बाहर गए और राउंड जीत लिया।","The computer went out. Round scored.":"कंप्यूटर खराब हो गया। राउंड स्कोर किया.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"स्टॉक दो कार्ड की आपूर्ति नहीं कर सकता। राउंड स्कोर किया.","You reached the target and won the game!":"आप लक्ष्य तक पहुंच गए और गेम जीत गए!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"कंप्यूटर लक्ष्य तक पहुंच गया और गेम जीत गया।","The match is tied.":"मैच टाई हो गया है।","Clean canasta":"स्वच्छ कैनास्टा","Mixed canasta":"मिश्रित कैनास्टा","You need a canasta before going out.":"बाहर जाने से पहले आपको एक कैनास्टा की आवश्यकता है।","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"इस ब्राउज़र में स्थानीय बचत अनुपलब्ध है। जब तक यह पृष्ठ खुला रहेगा आप खेलना जारी रख सकते हैं।","Round saved on this device.":"इस डिवाइस पर राउंड सहेजा गया।","Saved round resumed.":"सहेजा गया दौर फिर से शुरू हुआ।","Saved round deleted.":"सहेजा गया राउंड हटा दिया गया।","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"सहेजा गया राउंड पढ़ा नहीं जा सका। एक नया दौर शुरू करें या क्षतिग्रस्त सेव को हटा दें।","Card":"कार्ड","Wild":"जंगली","Frozen":"जमे हुए","Open":"खुला","points":"अंक","Twos":"दो","Threes":"तीन","Fours":"चार","Fives":"फाइव्स","Sixes":"छक्के","Sevens":"सेवेंस","Eights":"आठ","Nines":"नाइन्स","Tens":"दस","Jacks":"जैक","Queens":"क्वींस","Kings":"किंग्स","Aces":"इक्के","Hearts":"दिल","Diamonds":"हीरे","Clubs":"क्लब","Spades":"हुकुम","Joker":"जोकर","Rules overview":"नियम अवलोकन","Canasta rules":"कैनास्टा नियम"},"id":{"Canasta":"Kanasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Permainan Kartu Canasta vs Komputer Gratis","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Mainkan Canasta dua pemain online melawan komputer lokal. Gambar, gabungkan, bekukan, dan ambil tumpukan sampah, buat canasta bersih atau campuran, dan lacak skor putarannya. Bebas; kartu Anda tetap ada di perangkat ini.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Mainkan putaran Canasta dua pemain lengkap di browser Anda. Bentuk gabungan peringkat yang cocok, gunakan dua dan pelawak sebagai kartu liar, dan buat canasta tujuh kartu sebelum keluar.","A quick example":"Contoh singkat","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Tiga Raja alami dapat membuka perpaduan. Tambahkan kartu dengan peringkat itu pada giliran berikutnya; tujuh kartu alami menghasilkan canasta bersih yang bernilai bonus poin 500, sedangkan gabungan dengan kartu liar adalah canasta campuran yang bernilai poin bonus 300.","How to play":"Cara bermain","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Versi ini menggunakan dua deck standar ditambah empat joker (kartu 108), kartu 15 per pemain dan dua kartu yang diambil dari stok setiap giliran. Gabungkan setidaknya tiga kartu dengan peringkat yang sama; berpasangan dan pelawak itu liar, tidak lebih liar dari kartu alami. Perpaduan pertama harus memenuhi ambang batas poin untuk skor Anda saat ini. Tumpukan kartu buangan hanya dapat diambil dengan dua kartu alami yang cocok dengan kartu teratasnya. Kartu liar atau tiga hitam membekukan tumpukan. Anda memerlukan setidaknya satu canasta tujuh kartu untuk keluar.","Frequently asked questions":"Pertanyaan yang sering diajukan","What is a canasta?":"Apa itu canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Canasta adalah gabungan dari tujuh kartu atau lebih dengan nilai yang sama. Tujuh kartu alami menghasilkan canasta bersih (poin bonus 500); perpaduan yang berisi kartu liar dicampur (poin bonus 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Bagaimana cara mengambil tumpukan sampah?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Pegang dua kartu alami yang cocok dengan kartu buangan teratas. Tumpukan dibekukan ketika kartu teratasnya adalah kartu liar atau tiga hitam. Anda juga harus dapat membuat perpaduan yang sah dengan kartu teratas sesuai persyaratan pembukaan Anda.","When can I go out?":"Kapan saya boleh keluar?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Anda dapat mengosongkan tangan Anda hanya setelah pihak Anda memiliki canasta tujuh kartu. Kartu terakhir dibuang; versi ini tidak menggunakan variasi tangan tersembunyi atau izin mitra.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Bagaimana cara menghitung penggabungan pembukaan?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Minimumnya adalah 50 poin di bawah poin kumulatif 1,500, 90 dari 1,500, 120 dari 3,000 dan 150 dari 5,000. Poin gabungan yang ada tidak dihitung dalam pembukaan baru.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Apakah game saya diunggah atau disimpan?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Tidak ada permainan yang diunggah. Menyimpan bersifat opsional dan menggunakan penyimpanan lokal di browser pada perangkat ini.","Rules and limitations":"Aturan dan batasan","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Ini adalah varian dua pemain biasa melawan lawan komputer lokal sederhana, bukan multipemain daring atau perjudian. Ini menggunakan target poin 5,000 yang umum, kesepakatan kartu 15, penarikan dua kartu, dan ambang pembukaan berbasis skor. Aturan tabel berbeda: versi ini tidak menerapkan izin kemitraan untuk keluar, bonus tangan tersembunyi khusus, pilihan penggantian tiga merah, atau aturan rumah adat. Jika stok tidak dapat menyediakan dua kartu, putaran tersebut dinilai.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis dimainkan. Tangan dan skor Anda tetap berada di browser ini pada perangkat ini; tidak ada data game yang diunggah.","Play Canasta":"Mainkan Canasta","Related tools":"Alat terkait","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · BERJALAN DI BROWSER ANDA","Language":"Bahasa","UsefulVerse":"Ayat Berguna","All tools":"Semua alat","New round":"Babak baru","Play next round":"Mainkan babak berikutnya","Resume saved round":"Lanjutkan putaran yang disimpan","Delete saved round":"Hapus putaran yang disimpan","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Memulai putaran atau melanjutkan putaran yang disimpan.","You":"Kamu","Computer":"Komputer","Your hand":"Tanganmu","Computer cards":"Kartu komputer","Stock":"Stok","Discard pile":"Buang tumpukan","Your melds":"Perpaduan Anda","Draw two cards":"Gambarlah dua kartu","Take discard pile":"Ambil tumpukan sampah","Discard selected card":"Buang kartu yang dipilih","Selected cards":"Kartu yang dipilih","Clear selection":"Hapus pilihan","Meld rank":"Peringkat gabungan","Lay down meld":"Letakkan berbaur","Total score":"Skor total","Round points":"Titik bulat","Opening meld needs":"Membuka kebutuhan berbaur","Turn":"Putar","Choose New round to begin.":"Pilih Babak baru untuk memulai.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Putaran dimulai. Gambarlah dua kartu.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Giliran Anda: ambil dua kartu dari stok atau ambil tumpukan kartu buangan.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Letakkan gabungan legal jika Anda mau, lalu buang satu kartu.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Komputer mulai berputar…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Dua kartu diambil. Buat perpaduan atau buang.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Buang tumpukan yang diambil. Buat perpaduan atau buang.","Meld placed.":"Meld ditempatkan.","Card discarded.":"Kartu dibuang.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Tindakan itu tidak sah. Periksa aturan dan kartu yang dipilih.","You went out and won the round.":"Anda keluar dan memenangkan ronde tersebut.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Komputer mati. Putaran dicetak.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Stok tidak dapat menyediakan dua kartu. Putaran dicetak.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Anda mencapai target dan memenangkan permainan!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Komputer mencapai target dan memenangkan permainan.","The match is tied.":"Pertandingannya seri.","Clean canasta":"Bersihkan canasta","Mixed canasta":"Canasta campur","You need a canasta before going out.":"Anda membutuhkan canasta sebelum keluar.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Penyimpanan lokal tidak tersedia di browser ini. Anda dapat terus bermain selagi halaman ini tetap terbuka.","Round saved on this device.":"Putaran disimpan di perangkat ini.","Saved round resumed.":"Putaran yang disimpan dilanjutkan.","Saved round deleted.":"Putaran yang disimpan dihapus.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Putaran yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Mulai babak baru atau hapus simpanan yang rusak.","Card":"Kartu","Wild":"Liar","Frozen":"Beku","Open":"Buka","points":"poin","Twos":"Dua","Threes":"Bertiga","Fours":"Empat","Fives":"Lima","Sixes":"Enam","Sevens":"Tujuh","Eights":"Delapan","Nines":"Sembilan","Tens":"Puluhan","Jacks":"Jack","Queens":"Ratu","Kings":"Raja","Aces":"Ace","Hearts":"Hati","Diamonds":"Berlian","Clubs":"Klub","Spades":"Sekop","Joker":"pelawak","Rules overview":"Ikhtisar aturan","Canasta rules":"Aturan Canasta"},"it":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Gioco di carte gratuito di Canasta contro computer","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Gioca a Canasta online per due giocatori contro un computer locale. Pesca, combina, congela e prendi la pila degli scarti, costruisci canasta pulite o miste e tieni traccia del punteggio del round. Gratuito; le tue carte rimangono su questo dispositivo.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Gioca un round completo di Canasta a due giocatori nel tuo browser. Forma combinazioni di valori corrispondenti, usa due e jolly come jolly e crea una canasta di sette carte prima di uscire.","A quick example":"Un rapido esempio","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Tre Re naturali possono aprire una combinazione. Aggiungi carte di quel valore nei turni successivi; sette carte naturali fanno sì che una canasta pulita valga un bonus di 500 punti, mentre una combinazione con carte jolly è una canasta mista che vale 300 punti bonus.","How to play":"Come si gioca","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Questa versione utilizza due mazzi standard più quattro jolly (carte 108), carte 15 per giocatore e due carte pescate dal mazzo ogni turno. Combina almeno tre carte dello stesso valore; i due e i jolly sono selvaggi, senza più carte selvagge che naturali. La prima combinazione deve raggiungere la soglia di punti per il tuo punteggio attuale. Una pila degli scarti può essere presa solo con due carte naturali corrispondenti alla sua carta in cima. Una carta jolly o un tre nero congelano la pila. Per uscire è necessaria almeno una canasta da sette carte.","Frequently asked questions":"Domande frequenti","What is a canasta?":"Cos'è una canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Una canasta è una combinazione di sette o più carte dello stesso valore. Sette carte naturali fanno una canasta pulita (punti bonus 500); una combinazione contenente un jolly è mista (punti bonus 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Come prendo la pila degli scarti?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Tieni due carte naturali corrispondenti allo scarto in cima. La pila viene congelata quando la sua prima carta è un jolly o un tre nero. Devi anche essere in grado di effettuare una combinazione legale con la carta in cima ai tuoi requisiti di apertura.","When can I go out?":"Quando posso uscire?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Puoi svuotare la tua mano solo dopo che la tua parte ha una canasta da sette carte. L'ultima carta viene scartata; questa versione non utilizza variazioni a mano nascosta o con il permesso del partner.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Come viene calcolata la combinazione di apertura?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Il minimo è 50 punti sotto 1,500 punti cumulativi, 90 da 1,500, 120 da 3,000 e 150 da 5,000. I punti di fusione esistenti non vengono conteggiati per una nuova apertura.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Il mio gioco è stato caricato o salvato?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Nessun gioco caricato. Il salvataggio è facoltativo e utilizza la memoria locale in questo browser su questo dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Regole e limitazioni","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Questa è una variante casuale per due giocatori contro un semplice avversario computerizzato locale, non multiplayer online o giochi d'azzardo. Utilizza il target comune di punti 5,000, la distribuzione delle carte 15, l'estrazione di due carte e le soglie di apertura basate sul punteggio. Le regole del tavolo differiscono: questa versione non implementa il permesso di coppia di uscire, bonus speciali per la mano nascosta, scelte di sostituzione del tre rosso o regole della casa personalizzate. Se il mazzo non può fornire due carte, il giro viene conteggiato.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Giocare gratuitamente. La tua mano e il tuo punteggio rimangono in questo browser su questo dispositivo; non vengono caricati dati di gioco.","Play Canasta":"Gioca a Canasta","Related tools":"Strumenti correlati","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUITO · FUNZIONA NEL TUO BROWSER","Language":"Lingua","UsefulVerse":"Versetto utile","All tools":"Tutti gli strumenti","New round":"Nuovo giro","Play next round":"Gioca al turno successivo","Resume saved round":"Riprendi il round salvato","Delete saved round":"Elimina il round salvato","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Inizia un round o riprendine uno salvato.","You":"Tu","Computer":"Computer","Your hand":"La tua mano","Computer cards":"Schede per computer","Stock":"Magazzino","Discard pile":"Mucchio degli scarti","Your melds":"Le tue combinazioni","Draw two cards":"Pesca due carte","Take discard pile":"Prendi la pila degli scarti","Discard selected card":"Scarta la carta selezionata","Selected cards":"Carte selezionate","Clear selection":"Cancella selezione","Meld rank":"Rango fusione","Lay down meld":"Appoggia la fusione","Total score":"Punteggio totale","Round points":"Punti rotondi","Opening meld needs":"Necessità di fusione di apertura","Turn":"Gira","Choose New round to begin.":"Scegli Nuovo round per iniziare.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Round iniziato. Pesca due carte.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Il tuo turno: pesca due carte dal mazzo o prendi la pila degli scarti.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Disponi combinazioni legali se lo desideri, quindi scarta una carta.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Il computer sta facendo il suo turno...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Due carte pescate. Crea combinazioni o scarta.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Pila degli scarti presa. Crea combinazioni o scarta.","Meld placed.":"Fusione posizionata.","Card discarded.":"Carta scartata.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Questa azione non è legale. Controlla le regole e le carte selezionate.","You went out and won the round.":"Sei uscito e hai vinto il round.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Il computer si è spento. Giro segnato.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Lo stock non può fornire due carte. Giro segnato.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Hai raggiunto l'obiettivo e vinto la partita!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Il computer ha raggiunto l'obiettivo e ha vinto la partita.","The match is tied.":"La partita è in parità.","Clean canasta":"Canasta pulita","Mixed canasta":"Canasta mista","You need a canasta before going out.":"Hai bisogno di una canasta prima di uscire.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Il salvataggio locale non è disponibile in questo browser. Puoi continuare a giocare mentre questa pagina rimane aperta.","Round saved on this device.":"Round salvato su questo dispositivo.","Saved round resumed.":"Giorno salvato ripreso.","Saved round deleted.":"Gioco salvato eliminato.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Il round salvato non può essere letto. Inizia un nuovo round o elimina il salvataggio danneggiato.","Card":"Scheda","Wild":"Selvaggio","Frozen":"Congelato","Open":"Apri","points":"punti","Twos":"Due","Threes":"Tre","Fours":"Quattro","Fives":"Cinque","Sixes":"Sei","Sevens":"Sette","Eights":"Otto","Nines":"Nove","Tens":"Decine","Jacks":"Jack","Queens":"Regine","Kings":"Re","Aces":"Assi","Hearts":"Cuori","Diamonds":"Diamanti","Clubs":"Club","Spades":"Picche","Joker":"Jolly","Rules overview":"Panoramica delle regole","Canasta rules":"Regole della canasta"},"ja":{"Canasta":"カナスタ","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — 無料の Canasta カード ゲーム vs コンピューター","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"ローカル コンピューターとオンラインで 2 プレイヤー Canasta をプレイします。ドロー、融合、フリーズして捨て札を取り、クリーンまたはミックスのカナスタを構築し、ラウンドのスコアを追跡します。無料;カードはこのデバイスに保存されます。","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"ブラウザで完全な 2 プレイヤー Canasta ラウンドをプレイします。一致するランクのメルドを形成し、ワイルド カードとして 2 とジョーカーを使用し、出かける前に 7 枚のカードのカナスタを作成します。","A quick example":"簡単な例","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"3 人の自然の王が融合を開くことができます。後のターンでそのランクのカードを追加します。 7 枚のナチュラル カードで 500 ポイント ボーナスの価値のあるクリーン カナスタが作成され、ワイルド カードとの融合で 300 ボーナス ポイントの価値のあるミックス カナスタになります。","How to play":"遊び方","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"このバージョンでは、2 つの標準デッキに加えて 4 枚のジョーカー (108 カード)、プレイヤーごとに 15 カード、および毎ターンストックから引き出される 2 枚のカードを使用します。 1 つのランクのカードを少なくとも 3 枚融合します。ツーとジョーカーはワイルドであり、ナチュラル カードほどワイルドなものはありません。最初のメルドは現在のスコアのポイントしきい値を満たしている必要があります。捨て札は、その一番上のカードと一致する 2 枚の自然カードでのみ取ることができます。ワイルドカードまたは黒の 3 は山を凍結します。出かけるには少なくとも 1 枚の 7 カードのカナスタが必要です。","Frequently asked questions":"よくある質問","What is a canasta?":"カナスタとは何ですか?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"カナスタは、同じランクの 7 枚以上のカードの融合です。 7 枚のナチュラル カードでクリーン カナスタ (500 ボーナス ポイント)。ワイルド カードを含むメルドが混合されます (300 ボーナス ポイント)。","How do I take the discard pile?":"捨て札はどうやって取るのですか?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"一番上の捨て札と一致するナチュラル カードを 2 枚保持します。一番上のカードがワイルド カードまたはブラック スリーの場合、山は凍結されます。また、開始要件に基づいて一番上のカードと合法的な融合を行うことができなければなりません。","When can I go out?":"いつ外出できますか?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"自分の側に 7 枚のカードのカナスタがある場合にのみ、手を空にすることができます。最後のカードは捨てられます。このバージョンでは、隠し手やパートナー許可のバリエーションは使用されません。","How is the opening meld calculated?":"オープニングメルドはどのように計算されますか?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"最小値は、1,500 累積ポイントより 50 ポイント、1,500 から 90、3,000 から 120、および 5,000 から 150 です。既存のメルド ポイントは、新しい開口部にはカウントされません。","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"私のゲームはアップロードまたは保存されていますか?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"ゲームはアップロードされていません。保存はオプションであり、このデバイス上のこのブラウザのローカル ストレージを使用します。","Rules and limitations":"ルールと制限事項","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"これは、オンライン マルチプレイヤーやギャンブルではなく、単純なローカル コンピューターの対戦相手に対するカジュアルな 2 プレイヤー バリアントです。共通の 5,000 ポイント ターゲット、15 カード ディール、2 枚のカード ドロー、およびスコアベースの開始しきい値を使用します。テーブルのルールは異なります。このバージョンでは、パートナーシップの外出許可、特別な隠しハンド ボーナス、赤 3 の置換の選択肢、またはカスタム ハウス ルールが実装されていません。ストックが 2 枚のカードを供給できない場合、ラウンドは得点されます。","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"無料でプレイできます。あなたのハンドとスコアは、このデバイス上のこのブラウザーに残ります。ゲームデータはアップロードされません。","Play Canasta":"カナスタをプレイ","Related tools":"関連ツール","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"無料 · ブラウザで実行可能","Language":"言語","UsefulVerse":"便利な詩","All tools":"すべてのツール","New round":"新しいラウンド","Play next round":"次のラウンドをプレイする","Resume saved round":"保存されたラウンドを再開","Delete saved round":"保存されたラウンドを削除","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"ラウンドを開始するか、保存したラウンドを再開します。","You":"あなた","Computer":"コンピューター","Your hand":"あなたの手","Computer cards":"コンピュータ カード","Stock":"在庫","Discard pile":"山を捨てる","Your melds":"あなたのメルド","Draw two cards":"カードを 2 枚引く","Take discard pile":"捨て札を取る","Discard selected card":"選択したカードを破棄する","Selected cards":"選択されたカード","Clear selection":"選択をクリア","Meld rank":"メルドランク","Lay down meld":"レイダウンメルド","Total score":"合計スコア","Round points":"ラウンドポイント","Opening meld needs":"オープニング メルド ニーズ","Turn":"ターン","Choose New round to begin.":"[新しいラウンド] を選択して開始します。","Round started. Draw two cards.":"ラウンドが開始されました。カードを2枚引きます。","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"あなたの番: ストックからカードを 2 枚引くか、捨て札の山を取ります。","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"必要に応じて合法的な融合を置き、カードを1枚捨てます。","Computer is taking its turn…":"コンピューターの番が来ています…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"2 枚のカードが引かれました。メルドを作るか破棄します。","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"取得した山を捨て札にします。メルドを作るか破棄します。","Meld placed.":"メルドが配置されました。","Card discarded.":"カードは破棄されました。","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"その行為は違法です。ルールと選択したカードを確認してください。","You went out and won the round.":"あなたはラウンドに出て勝利しました。","The computer went out. Round scored.":"コンピューターが故障しました。ラウンドが得点しました。","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"ストックでは 2 枚のカードを供給できません。ラウンドが得点しました。","You reached the target and won the game!":"あなたは目標を達成し、ゲームに勝ちました!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"コンピューターは目標に到達し、ゲームに勝ちました。","The match is tied.":"試合は引き分けです。","Clean canasta":"クリーンカナスタ","Mixed canasta":"ミックスカナスタ","You need a canasta before going out.":"出かける前にカナスタが必要です。","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"このブラウザではローカル保存を使用できません。このページを開いたままプレイを続けることができます。","Round saved on this device.":"ラウンドはこのデバイスに保存されました。","Saved round resumed.":"保存されたラウンドが再開されました。","Saved round deleted.":"保存されたラウンドが削除されました。","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"保存されたラウンドを読み取れませんでした。新しいラウンドを開始するか、破損したセーブデータを削除してください。","Card":"カード","Wild":"ワイルド","Frozen":"冷凍","Open":"開く","points":"ポイント","Twos":"2","Threes":"スリー","Fours":"4 つ","Fives":"ファイブ","Sixes":"シックス","Sevens":"セブンズ","Eights":"エイト","Nines":"ナインズ","Tens":"10","Jacks":"ジャック","Queens":"クイーンズ","Kings":"キングス","Aces":"エース","Hearts":"ハート","Diamonds":"ダイヤモンド","Clubs":"クラブ","Spades":"スペード","Joker":"ジョーカー","Rules overview":"ルールの概要","Canasta rules":"カナスタのルール"},"ko":{"Canasta":"카나스타","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta 온라인 — 컴퓨터 대 무료 Canasta 카드 게임","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"로컬 컴퓨터를 상대로 온라인으로 2인용 Canasta를 플레이하세요. 뽑고, 녹이고, 얼리고, 버려진 더미를 가져오고, 깨끗하거나 혼합된 카나스타를 만들고, 라운드 점수를 추적하세요. 무료; 카드는 이 기기에 보관됩니다.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"브라우저에서 완전한 2인용 Canasta 라운드를 플레이하세요. 일치하는 순위의 혼합을 형성하고, 2와 조커를 와일드 카드로 사용하고, 나가기 전에 7장의 카드로 카나스타를 만드세요.","A quick example":"빠른 예","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"세 명의 천연 왕이 융합을 열 수 있습니다. 이후 턴에 해당 등급의 카드를 추가합니다. 7개의 천연 카드는 500 포인트 보너스 가치가 있는 깨끗한 카나스타를 만드는 반면, 와일드 카드가 포함된 멜드는 300 보너스 포인트 가치가 있는 혼합 카나스타입니다.","How to play":"플레이 방법","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"이 버전은 2개의 표준 덱과 4개의 조커(108 카드), 플레이어당 15 카드 및 매 턴마다 재고에서 뽑는 2개의 카드를 사용합니다. 한 등급의 카드를 3장 이상 융합하세요. 2와 조커는 야생적이며 천연 카드만큼 거칠지는 않습니다. 첫 번째 융합은 현재 점수에 대한 포인트 임계값을 충족해야 합니다. 버려진 더미는 맨 위 카드와 일치하는 두 개의 자연 카드로만 가져올 수 있습니다. 와일드카드나 검은색 3개는 더미를 동결시킵니다. 외출하려면 세븐카드 카나스타가 최소 1개 이상 필요합니다.","Frequently asked questions":"자주 묻는 질문","What is a canasta?":"카나스타란 무엇입니까?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"카나스타는 같은 등급의 카드 7장 이상을 혼합한 것입니다. 7개의 내추럴 카드가 깨끗한 카나스타를 만듭니다(500 보너스 포인트). 와일드 카드가 포함된 멜드가 혼합되어 있습니다(300 보너스 포인트).","How do I take the discard pile?":"폐기물 더미를 어떻게 가져가나요?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"맨 위 버린 카드와 일치하는 두 개의 자연 카드를 잡으세요. 더미의 맨 위 카드가 와일드 카드나 검은색 3이면 해당 더미는 동결됩니다. 또한 오프닝 요구 사항에 따라 최상위 카드와 합법적인 융합을 만들 수 있어야 합니다.","When can I go out?":"언제 나갈 수 있나요?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"당신은 당신의 팀이 7장의 카나스타를 가지고 있는 후에만 손을 비울 수 있습니다. 마지막 카드는 버려집니다. 이 버전은 숨겨진 손 또는 파트너 권한 변형을 사용하지 않습니다.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"오프닝 멜드는 어떻게 계산됩니까?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"최소값은 1,500 누적 포인트 미만의 50 포인트, 1,500의 90, 3,000의 120 및 5,000의 150입니다. 기존 멜드 포인트는 새로운 오프닝에 포함되지 않습니다.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"내 게임이 업로드되었거나 저장되었습니까?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"업로드된 게임이 없습니다. 저장은 선택사항이며 이 기기의 브라우저에 있는 로컬 저장소를 사용합니다.","Rules and limitations":"규칙 및 제한 사항","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"이것은 온라인 멀티플레이어나 도박이 아닌 단순한 로컬 컴퓨터 상대를 상대로 하는 캐주얼 2인용 게임입니다. 이는 일반적인 5,000 포인트 목표, 15 카드 거래, 2장 카드 추첨 및 점수 기반 개시 임계값을 사용합니다. 테이블 규칙은 다릅니다. 이 버전은 외출에 대한 파트너십 허가, 특별한 숨겨진 손 보너스, 레드-쓰리 교체 선택 또는 사용자 정의 하우스 규칙을 구현하지 않습니다. 재고가 두 장의 카드를 제공할 수 없는 경우 라운드가 득점됩니다.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"무료로 플레이할 수 있습니다. 당신의 손과 점수는 이 장치의 브라우저에 그대로 유지됩니다. 게임 데이터가 업로드되지 않습니다.","Play Canasta":"카나스타 플레이","Related tools":"관련 도구","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"무료 · 브라우저에서 실행","Language":"언어","UsefulVerse":"유용한 구절","All tools":"모든 도구","New round":"새로운 라운드","Play next round":"다음 라운드 플레이","Resume saved round":"저장된 라운드 재개","Delete saved round":"저장된 라운드 삭제","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"라운드를 시작하거나 저장된 라운드를 재개하세요.","You":"당신","Computer":"컴퓨터","Your hand":"당신의 손","Computer cards":"컴퓨터 카드","Stock":"재고","Discard pile":"폐기 더미","Your melds":"당신의 멜드","Draw two cards":"카드 두 장 뽑기","Take discard pile":"폐기물 더미 가져오기","Discard selected card":"선택한 카드 폐기","Selected cards":"선택한 카드","Clear selection":"선택 지우기","Meld rank":"멜드 순위","Lay down meld":"레이다운 멜드","Total score":"총점","Round points":"라운드 포인트","Opening meld needs":"멜드 수요 개방","Turn":"턴","Choose New round to begin.":"시작하려면 새 라운드를 선택하세요.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"라운드가 시작되었습니다. 카드 두 장을 뽑습니다.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"당신의 차례: 재고에서 카드 두 장을 뽑거나 버려진 더미를 가져옵니다.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"원한다면 합법적인 멜드를 내려놓고 카드 한 장을 버리세요.","Computer is taking its turn…":"컴퓨터가 차례를 맞이하고 있습니다…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"두 장의 카드가 뽑혔습니다. 융합하거나 폐기하십시오.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"취득된 더미를 폐기합니다. 융합하거나 폐기하십시오.","Meld placed.":"멜드가 배치되었습니다.","Card discarded.":"카드가 폐기되었습니다.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"그 행동은 합법적이지 않습니다. 규칙과 선택한 카드를 확인하세요.","You went out and won the round.":"당신은 나가서 라운드에서 승리했습니다.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"컴퓨터가 나갔습니다. 라운드 득점.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"재고는 두 장의 카드를 공급할 수 없습니다. 라운드 득점.","You reached the target and won the game!":"목표에 도달했고 게임에서 승리했습니다!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"컴퓨터가 목표에 도달하여 게임에서 승리했습니다.","The match is tied.":"경기는 동점입니다.","Clean canasta":"클린 카나스타","Mixed canasta":"혼합 카나스타","You need a canasta before going out.":"외출하기 전에 카나스타가 필요합니다.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"이 브라우저에서는 로컬 저장을 사용할 수 없습니다. 이 페이지가 열려 있는 동안 계속 플레이할 수 있습니다.","Round saved on this device.":"라운드가 이 장치에 저장되었습니다.","Saved round resumed.":"저장된 라운드가 재개되었습니다.","Saved round deleted.":"저장된 라운드가 삭제되었습니다.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"저장된 라운드를 읽을 수 없습니다. 새 라운드를 시작하거나 손상된 저장 파일을 삭제하세요.","Card":"카드","Wild":"와일드","Frozen":"냉동","Open":"열기","points":"포인트","Twos":"두","Threes":"3","Fours":"4개","Fives":"파이브","Sixes":"식스","Sevens":"세븐스","Eights":"에잇","Nines":"나인즈","Tens":"수십","Jacks":"잭","Queens":"퀸즈","Kings":"킹스","Aces":"에이스","Hearts":"하트","Diamonds":"다이아몬드","Clubs":"클럽","Spades":"스페이드","Joker":"조커","Rules overview":"규칙 개요","Canasta rules":"카나스타 규칙"},"mr":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta ऑनलाइन — मोफत Canasta कार्ड गेम विरुद्ध संगणक","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"स्थानिक संगणकाविरुद्ध दोन-प्लेअर कॅनास्टा ऑनलाइन खेळा. काढा, मेल्ड करा, गोठवा आणि टाकून दिलेला ढीग घ्या, स्वच्छ किंवा मिश्रित कॅनास्टा तयार करा आणि गोल स्कोअरचा मागोवा घ्या. मुक्त; तुमची कार्डे या डिव्हाइसवर राहतील.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये पूर्ण दोन-प्लेअर कॅनस्टा राउंड खेळा. जुळणाऱ्या रँकचे मेल्ड तयार करा, वाइल्ड कार्ड म्हणून टू आणि जोकर वापरा आणि बाहेर जाण्यापूर्वी सात कार्ड्सचा कॅनस्टा बनवा.","A quick example":"एक द्रुत उदाहरण","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"तीन नैसर्गिक राजे एक मेल्ड उघडू शकतात. नंतरच्या वळणांवर त्या रँकची कार्डे जोडा; सात नैसर्गिक कार्डे 500-पॉइंट बोनस किमतीचा स्वच्छ कॅनास्टा बनवतात, तर वाइल्ड कार्डसह एक मिश्रित कॅनास्टा किमतीचा 300 बोनस पॉइंट आहे.","How to play":"कसे खेळायचे","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"या आवृत्तीमध्ये दोन मानक डेक अधिक चार जोकर (108 कार्ड), 15 कार्ड प्रत्येक खेळाडू आणि प्रत्येक वळणावर स्टॉकमधून काढलेली दोन कार्डे वापरतात. एका रँकची किमान तीन कार्डे एकत्र करा; Twos आणि jokers जंगली आहेत, नैसर्गिक कार्ड्स पेक्षा जास्त जंगली नाहीत. पहिल्या मेल्डने तुमच्या वर्तमान स्कोअरसाठी पॉइंट थ्रेशोल्ड पूर्ण करणे आवश्यक आहे. टाकून दिलेला ढीग फक्त त्याच्या वरच्या कार्डाशी जुळणाऱ्या दोन नैसर्गिक कार्डांसह घेतला जाऊ शकतो. वाइल्ड कार्ड किंवा ब्लॅक थ्री ढीग गोठवते. बाहेर जाण्यासाठी तुम्हाला किमान एक सात-कार्ड कॅनस्टा आवश्यक आहे.","Frequently asked questions":"वारंवार विचारले जाणारे प्रश्न","What is a canasta?":"कॅनस्टा म्हणजे काय?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"कनास्टा हे समान दर्जाच्या सात किंवा अधिक कार्डांचे मेल्ड आहे. सात नैसर्गिक कार्डे स्वच्छ कॅनास्टा बनवतात (500 बोनस गुण); वाइल्ड कार्ड असलेली मेल्ड मिसळली आहे (300 बोनस पॉइंट).","How do I take the discard pile?":"मी टाकून दिलेला ढीग कसा घेऊ?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"टॉप टाकून दिलेली दोन नैसर्गिक कार्डे धरा. जेव्हा त्याचे शीर्ष कार्ड वाइल्ड कार्ड किंवा काळे तीन असते तेव्हा ढीग गोठलेला असतो. तुम्ही तुमच्या उघडण्याच्या आवश्यकतेनुसार टॉप कार्डसह कायदेशीर मेल्ड बनविण्यात सक्षम असणे आवश्यक आहे.","When can I go out?":"मी बाहेर कधी जाऊ शकतो?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"तुमच्या बाजूला सात-कार्ड कॅनस्टा झाल्यानंतरच तुम्ही तुमचा हात रिकामा करू शकता. अंतिम कार्ड टाकून दिले आहे; ही आवृत्ती लपविलेले हात किंवा भागीदार-परवानगी भिन्नता वापरत नाही.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"ओपनिंग मेल्डची गणना कशी केली जाते?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"एकूण गुण 1,500 पेक्षा कमी असताना किमान 50 गुण आवश्यक; 1,500 पासून 90, 3,000 पासून 120 आणि 5,000 पासून 150 गुण आवश्यक आहेत. नव्या मेल्डसाठी उघडण्याच्या किमान गुणांमध्ये आधीच्या मेल्डचे गुण मोजले जात नाहीत.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"माझा गेम अपलोड किंवा सेव्ह आहे का?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"कोणताही गेम अपलोड केलेला नाही. बचत करणे पर्यायी आहे आणि या डिव्हाइसवर या ब्राउझरमध्ये स्थानिक संचयन वापरते.","Rules and limitations":"नियम आणि मर्यादा","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"हे एका साध्या स्थानिक संगणक प्रतिस्पर्ध्याविरुद्ध दोन-खेळाडूंचे एक प्रासंगिक प्रकार आहे, ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेअर किंवा जुगार नाही. हे सामान्य 5,000-पॉइंट लक्ष्य, 15-कार्ड डील, दोन-कार्ड ड्रॉ आणि स्कोअर-आधारित ओपनिंग थ्रेशोल्ड वापरते. सारणीचे नियम वेगळे आहेत: ही आवृत्ती बाहेर जाण्यासाठी भागीदारी परवानगी, विशेष गुप्त-हात बोनस, लाल-तीन बदली निवडी किंवा कस्टम हाउस नियम लागू करत नाही. जर स्टॉक दोन कार्ड देऊ शकत नसेल, तर फेरी काढली जाते.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"खेळण्यासाठी विनामूल्य. तुमचा हात आणि स्कोअर या डिव्हाइसवर या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतात; कोणताही गेम डेटा अपलोड केलेला नाही.","Play Canasta":"Canasta प्ले करा","Related tools":"संबंधित साधने","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"विनामूल्य · तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते","Language":"भाषा","UsefulVerse":"उपयोगी वचन","All tools":"सर्व साधने","New round":"नवीन फेरी","Play next round":"पुढील फेरी खेळा","Resume saved round":"सेव्ह केलेली फेरी पुन्हा सुरू करा","Delete saved round":"सेव्ह केलेला राउंड हटवा","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"एक फेरी सुरू करा किंवा जतन केलेली फेरी सुरू करा.","You":"तुम्ही","Computer":"संगणक","Your hand":"तुमचा हात","Computer cards":"संगणक कार्ड","Stock":"स्टॉक","Discard pile":"पाइल टाकून द्या","Your melds":"तुमचे मेल्ड्स","Draw two cards":"दोन कार्डे काढा","Take discard pile":"टाकून ढीग घ्या","Discard selected card":"निवडलेले कार्ड टाकून द्या","Selected cards":"निवडलेली कार्डे","Clear selection":"निवड साफ करा","Meld rank":"Meld रँक","Lay down meld":"ले डाउन मेल्ड","Total score":"एकूण स्कोअर","Round points":"राऊंड पॉइंट्स","Opening meld needs":"ओपनिंग मेल्ड गरजा","Turn":"वळण","Choose New round to begin.":"सुरु करण्यासाठी नवीन फेरी निवडा.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"फेरी सुरू झाली. दोन कार्डे काढा.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"तुमची पाळी: स्टॉकमधून दोन कार्ड काढा किंवा टाकून द्या.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"तुमची इच्छा असल्यास कायदेशीर मेल्ड खाली ठेवा, नंतर एक कार्ड टाकून द्या.","Computer is taking its turn…":"संगणक वळण घेत आहे…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"दोन कार्डे काढली. मेल्ड बनवा किंवा टाकून द्या.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"घेतलेला ढीग टाकून द्या. मेल्ड बनवा किंवा टाकून द्या.","Meld placed.":"Meld ठेवले.","Card discarded.":"कार्ड टाकून दिले.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"ती कृती कायदेशीर नाही. नियम आणि निवडलेली कार्डे तपासा.","You went out and won the round.":"तुम्ही बाहेर गेलात आणि फेरी जिंकली.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"संगणक बाहेर गेला. फेरी मारली.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"स्टॉक दोन कार्ड देऊ शकत नाही. फेरी मारली.","You reached the target and won the game!":"तुम्ही लक्ष्य गाठले आणि गेम जिंकला!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"संगणकाने लक्ष्य गाठले आणि गेम जिंकला.","The match is tied.":"सामना बरोबरीत सुटली.","Clean canasta":"क्लीन कॅनस्टा","Mixed canasta":"मिश्र कॅनस्टा","You need a canasta before going out.":"बाहेर जाण्यापूर्वी तुम्हाला कॅनस्टा आवश्यक आहे.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"स्थानिक बचत या ब्राउझरमध्ये अनुपलब्ध आहे. हे पृष्ठ उघडे असताना तुम्ही खेळत राहू शकता.","Round saved on this device.":"या डिव्हाइसवर राउंड सेव्ह केले.","Saved round resumed.":"जतन केलेली फेरी पुन्हा सुरू झाली.","Saved round deleted.":"जतन केलेली फेरी हटवली.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"जतन केलेली फेरी वाचता आली नाही. नवीन फेरी सुरू करा किंवा खराब झालेले सेव्ह हटवा.","Card":"कार्ड","Wild":"जंगली","Frozen":"फ्रोझन","Open":"उघडा","points":"गुण","Twos":"दोन","Threes":"तीन","Fours":"चौकार","Fives":"पाच","Sixes":"षटकार","Sevens":"सात","Eights":"आठ","Nines":"Nines","Tens":"दहा","Jacks":"जॅक्स","Queens":"क्वीन्स","Kings":"किंग्ज","Aces":"Aces","Hearts":"हृदय","Diamonds":"हिरे","Clubs":"क्लब","Spades":"Spades","Joker":"जोकर","Rules overview":"नियमांचे विहंगावलोकन","Canasta rules":"Canasta नियम"},"ms":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Percuma Permainan Kad Canasta vs Komputer","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Main dua pemain Canasta dalam talian melawan komputer tempatan. Lukis, canai, bekukan dan ambil longgokan buang, bina kanasta bersih atau bercampur dan jejaki markah pusingan. Percuma; kad anda kekal pada peranti ini.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Mainkan pusingan Canasta dua pemain lengkap dalam penyemak imbas anda. Bentuk gabungan kedudukan yang sepadan, gunakan dua dan pelawak sebagai kad liar, dan buat canasta tujuh kad sebelum keluar.","A quick example":"Contoh pantas","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Tiga Raja semula jadi boleh membuka gabungan. Tambahkan kad pangkat itu pada giliran kemudian; tujuh kad asli menjadikan canasta bersih bernilai bonus mata 500, manakala gabungan dengan kad liar ialah canasta campuran bernilai mata bonus 300.","How to play":"Cara bermain","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Versi ini menggunakan dua dek standard ditambah empat pelawak (kad 108), kad 15 setiap pemain dan dua kad yang diambil daripada stok setiap giliran. Campurkan sekurang-kurangnya tiga kad satu pangkat; twos dan jokers adalah liar, dengan tidak lebih liar daripada kad semula jadi. Campuran pertama mesti memenuhi ambang mata untuk skor semasa anda. Longgokan buang boleh diambil hanya dengan dua kad semula jadi yang sepadan dengan kad teratasnya. Kad liar atau tiga hitam membekukan longgokan. Anda memerlukan sekurang-kurangnya satu canasta tujuh kad untuk keluar.","Frequently asked questions":"Soalan lazim","What is a canasta?":"Apakah itu canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Canasta ialah gabungan tujuh atau lebih kad yang mempunyai kedudukan yang sama. Tujuh kad asli menghasilkan canasta yang bersih (mata bonus 500); campuran yang mengandungi kad liar bercampur (mata bonus 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Bagaimana cara saya mengambil longgokan buangan?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Pegang dua kad semula jadi yang sepadan dengan buangan atas. Longgokan itu dibekukan apabila kad teratasnya ialah kad liar atau tiga hitam. Anda juga mesti boleh membuat gabungan undang-undang dengan kad teratas di bawah keperluan pembukaan anda.","When can I go out?":"Bilakah saya boleh keluar?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Anda boleh mengosongkan tangan anda hanya selepas sebelah anda mempunyai canasta tujuh kad. Kad akhir dibuang; versi ini tidak menggunakan variasi yang disembunyikan atau kebenaran rakan kongsi.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Bagaimanakah gabungan pembukaan dikira?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Minimum ialah 50 mata di bawah mata kumulatif 1,500, 90 daripada 1,500, 120 daripada 3,000 dan 150 daripada 5,000. Titik gabungan sedia ada tidak dikira ke arah pembukaan baharu.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Adakah permainan saya dimuat naik atau disimpan?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Tiada permainan dimuat naik. Menyimpan adalah pilihan dan menggunakan storan setempat dalam penyemak imbas ini pada peranti ini.","Rules and limitations":"Peraturan dan batasan","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Ini ialah varian dua pemain kasual terhadap lawan komputer tempatan yang mudah, bukan berbilang pemain dalam talian atau perjudian. Ia menggunakan sasaran mata 5,000 biasa, perjanjian kad 15, cabutan dua kad dan ambang pembukaan berasaskan skor. Peraturan jadual berbeza: versi ini tidak melaksanakan kebenaran perkongsian untuk keluar, bonus tangan tersembunyi khas, pilihan penggantian merah-tiga atau peraturan rumah tersuai. Jika stok tidak dapat membekalkan dua kad, pusingan dijaringkan.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Percuma untuk bermain. Tangan dan skor anda kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini pada peranti ini; tiada data permainan dimuat naik.","Play Canasta":"Main Canasta","Related tools":"Alat berkaitan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"PERCUMA · DIJALANKAN DALAM PENYIARI SEMAK ANDA","Language":"Bahasa","UsefulVerse":"Ayat Berguna","All tools":"Semua alatan","New round":"Pusingan baharu","Play next round":"Main pusingan seterusnya","Resume saved round":"Sambung semula disimpan pusingan","Delete saved round":"Padamkan pusingan yang disimpan","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Mulakan pusingan atau sambung semula pusingan yang disimpan.","You":"Anda","Computer":"Komputer","Your hand":"Tangan anda","Computer cards":"Kad komputer","Stock":"Stok","Discard pile":"Buang longgokan","Your melds":"Campuran anda","Draw two cards":"Lukis dua kad","Take discard pile":"Ambil longgokan buangan","Discard selected card":"Buang kad yang dipilih","Selected cards":"Kad terpilih","Clear selection":"Kosongkan pilihan","Meld rank":"Pangkat gabungan","Lay down meld":"Lay down meld","Total score":"Jumlah markah","Round points":"Mata bulat","Opening meld needs":"Membuka keperluan gabungan","Turn":"Pusing","Choose New round to begin.":"Pilih pusingan baharu untuk bermula.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Pusingan dimulakan. Lukis dua kad.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Giliran anda: lukis dua kad daripada stok atau ambil longgokan buang.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Letakkan gabungan undang-undang jika anda mahu, kemudian buang satu kad.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Komputer mengambil giliran…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Dua kad ditarik. Buat campuran atau buang.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Buang longgokan yang diambil. Buat campuran atau buang.","Meld placed.":"Meld diletakkan.","Card discarded.":"Kad dibuang.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Tindakan itu tidak sah. Semak peraturan dan kad yang dipilih.","You went out and won the round.":"Anda keluar dan memenangi pusingan itu.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Komputer padam. Pusingan dijaringkan.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Stok tidak boleh membekalkan dua kad. Pusingan dijaringkan.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Anda mencapai sasaran dan memenangi permainan!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Komputer mencapai sasaran dan memenangi permainan.","The match is tied.":"Perlawanan seri.","Clean canasta":"Canasta bersih","Mixed canasta":"Canasta bercampur","You need a canasta before going out.":"Anda memerlukan canasta sebelum keluar.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Penyimpanan setempat tidak tersedia dalam penyemak imbas ini. Anda boleh terus bermain sementara halaman ini dibuka.","Round saved on this device.":"Pusingan disimpan pada peranti ini.","Saved round resumed.":"Pusingan yang disimpan disambung semula.","Saved round deleted.":"Pusingan yang disimpan dipadamkan.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Pusingan yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Mulakan pusingan baharu atau padamkan simpanan yang rosak.","Card":"Kad","Wild":"Liar","Frozen":"Beku","Open":"Buka","points":"mata","Twos":"Dua","Threes":"Tiga","Fours":"Empat","Fives":"Lima","Sixes":"Enam","Sevens":"Tujuh","Eights":"Lapan","Nines":"Sembilan","Tens":"Berpuluh-puluh","Jacks":"Bicu","Queens":"Permaisuri","Kings":"Raja-raja","Aces":"Aces","Hearts":"Hati","Diamonds":"Berlian","Clubs":"Kelab","Spades":"Penyodok","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Ikhtisar peraturan","Canasta rules":"Peraturan Canasta"},"nb":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Gratis Canasta-kortspill vs datamaskin","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Spill to-spiller Canasta online mot en lokal datamaskin. Tegn, smelt, frys og ta kasseringshaugen, bygg rene eller blandede canastas og følg den runde poengsummen. Gratis; kortene dine forblir på denne enheten.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Spill en komplett to-spiller Canasta-runde i nettleseren din. Lag sammenslåinger av matchende rekker, bruk toere og jokere som jokere, og lag en canasta av syv kort før du går ut.","A quick example":"Et raskt eksempel","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Tre naturlige konger kan åpne en blanding. Legg til kort med den rangeringen over senere runder; syv naturlige kort gir en ren canasta verdt en 500-poengbonus, mens en blanding med jokerkort er en blandet canasta verdt 300 bonuspoeng.","How to play":"Slik spiller du","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Denne versjonen bruker to standardkortstokker pluss fire jokere (108-kort), 15-kort per spiller og to kort trukket fra aksjen hver tur. Meld minst tre kort av én rangering; toere og jokere er ville, med ikke mer wild enn naturlige kort. Den første meldingen må oppfylle poengterskelen for din nåværende poengsum. En kastbunke kan bare tas med to naturlige kort som samsvarer med det øverste kortet. Et wild card eller svart tre fryser haugen. Du trenger minst én syv-korts canasta for å gå ut.","Frequently asked questions":"Ofte stilte spørsmål","What is a canasta?":"Hva er en canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"En canasta er en blanding av syv eller flere kort av samme rangering. Syv naturlige kort gjør en ren canasta (500 bonuspoeng); en blanding som inneholder et jokertegn er blandet (300 bonuspoeng).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Hvordan tar jeg kasseringshaugen?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Hold to naturlige kort som matcher det øverste forkastet. Bunken fryses når det øverste kortet er et wild card eller svart tre. Du må også kunne lage en lovlig sammensmelting med det øverste kortet under åpningskravet ditt.","When can I go out?":"Når kan jeg gå ut?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Du kan bare tømme hånden din etter at siden din har en syv-korts canasta. Det siste kortet kastes; denne versjonen bruker ikke variasjoner med skjult hånd eller partnertillatelse.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Hvordan beregnes åpningsmeldingen?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Minimum er 50 poeng under 1,500 kumulative poeng, 90 fra 1,500, 120 fra 3,000 og 150 fra 5,000. Eksisterende meldpunkter telles ikke med i en ny åpning.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Er spillet mitt lastet opp eller lagret?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Ingen spill er lastet opp. Lagring er valgfritt og bruker lokal lagring i denne nettleseren på denne enheten.","Rules and limitations":"Regler og begrensninger","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Dette er en tilfeldig tospillervariant mot en enkel lokal datamaskinmotstander, ikke online flerspiller eller gambling. Den bruker det vanlige 5,000-poengmålet, 15-kortutdelingen, to-korts trekning og poengbaserte åpningsterskler. Tabellreglene er forskjellige: denne versjonen implementerer ikke partnerskapstillatelse til å gå ut, spesielle skjulte hånd-bonuser, røde-tre-erstatningsvalg eller tilpassede husregler. Hvis aksjen ikke kan levere to kort, scores runden.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis å spille. Din hånd og poengsum forblir i denne nettleseren på denne enheten; ingen spilldata lastes opp.","Play Canasta":"Spill Canasta","Related tools":"Relaterte verktøy","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KJØRER I NETTLESEREN DIN","Language":"Språk","UsefulVerse":"NyttigVerse","All tools":"Alle verktøy","New round":"Ny runde","Play next round":"Spill neste runde","Resume saved round":"Fortsett lagret runde","Delete saved round":"Slett lagret runde","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Start en runde eller gjenoppta en lagret.","You":"Du","Computer":"Datamaskin","Your hand":"Din hånd","Computer cards":"Datakort","Stock":"Aksje","Discard pile":"Kast haug","Your melds":"Din smelter","Draw two cards":"Trekk to kort","Take discard pile":"Ta kasseringshaugen","Discard selected card":"Forkast valgt kort","Selected cards":"Valgte kort","Clear selection":"Tømt utvalg","Meld rank":"Meld rang","Lay down meld":"Legg ned meld","Total score":"Total poengsum","Round points":"Runde punkter","Opening meld needs":"Åpningsmelding behov","Turn":"Sving","Choose New round to begin.":"Velg Ny runde for å begynne.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Runde startet. Trekk to kort.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Din tur: trekk to kort fra lager eller ta kastbunken.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Legg ned lovlige melds hvis du ønsker det, og kast ett kort.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Datamaskinen tar sin tur...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"To kort trukket. Lag smelter eller kast.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Kast haug tatt. Lag smelter eller kast.","Meld placed.":"Meld plassert.","Card discarded.":"Kort forkastet.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Denne handlingen er ikke lovlig. Sjekk reglene og valgte kort.","You went out and won the round.":"Du gikk ut og vant runden.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Datamaskinen gikk ut. Runde scoret.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Akten kan ikke levere to kort. Runde scoret.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Du nådde målet og vant spillet!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Datamaskinen nådde målet og vant spillet.","The match is tied.":"Kampen er uavgjort.","Clean canasta":"Ren canasta","Mixed canasta":"Blandet canasta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Du trenger en canasta før du går ut.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Lokal lagring er utilgjengelig i denne nettleseren. Du kan fortsette å spille mens denne siden er åpen.","Round saved on this device.":"Runde lagret på denne enheten.","Saved round resumed.":"Lagret runde gjenopptatt.","Saved round deleted.":"Lagret runde slettet.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Lagret runde kunne ikke leses. Start en ny runde eller slett den skadede lagringen.","Card":"Kort","Wild":"Vill","Frozen":"Fryst","Open":"Åpen","points":"poeng","Twos":"Toer","Threes":"Tre","Fours":"Fire","Fives":"Fimmer","Sixes":"Seksere","Sevens":"Sjuere","Eights":"Åttere","Nines":"Niner","Tens":"Titaller","Jacks":"Jekker","Queens":"Dronninger","Kings":"Konger","Aces":"Ess","Hearts":"Hjerter","Diamonds":"Diamanter","Clubs":"Klubber","Spades":"Spader","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Regeloversikt","Canasta rules":"Canasta-regler"},"nl":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online - Gratis Canasta-kaartspel versus computer","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Speel Canasta voor twee spelers online tegen een lokale computer. Teken, versmelt, bevries en pak de aflegstapel, bouw schone of gemengde canastas en houd de rondescore bij. Vrij; uw kaarten blijven op dit apparaat.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Speel een volledige Canasta-ronde voor twee spelers in uw browser. Vorm groepjes van gelijke rijen, gebruik tweeën en jokers als jokers en maak een canasta van zeven kaarten voordat je uitgaat.","A quick example":"Een snel voorbeeld","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Drie natuurlijke koningen kunnen een versmelting openen. Voeg kaarten van die rang toe tijdens latere beurten; zeven natuurlijke kaarten zorgen ervoor dat een zuivere canasta een bonus van 500 waard is, terwijl een combinatie met wildcards een gemengde canasta is die 300 bonuspunten waard is.","How to play":"Hoe te spelen","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Deze versie gebruikt twee standaard kaartspellen plus vier jokers (108-kaarten), 15-kaarten per speler en twee kaarten die elke beurt uit de voorraad worden getrokken. Meld minstens drie kaarten van dezelfde waarde; tweeën en jokers zijn wild, met niet meer wild dan natuurlijke kaarten. Het eerste groepje moet voldoen aan de puntendrempel voor je huidige score. Een aflegstapel kan alleen worden genomen als er twee natuurlijke kaarten overeenkomen met de bovenste kaart. Een joker of een zwarte drie bevriest de stapel. Je hebt minimaal één canasta met zeven kaarten nodig om uit te gaan.","Frequently asked questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","What is a canasta?":"Wat is een canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Een canasta is een combinatie van zeven of meer kaarten van dezelfde waarde. Zeven natuurlijke kaarten vormen een schone canasta (500 bonuspunten); een groepje met een joker wordt gemengd (300 bonuspunten).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Hoe pak ik de aflegstapel?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Houd twee natuurlijke kaarten vast die overeenkomen met de bovenste aflegkaart. De stapel is bevroren als de bovenste kaart een joker of een zwarte drie is. Je moet ook in staat zijn om een ​​legale combinatie te maken met de bovenste kaart onder je openingsvereiste.","When can I go out?":"Wanneer kan ik uitgaan?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Je mag je hand pas leegmaken als jouw partij een canasta van zeven kaarten heeft. De laatste kaart wordt weggegooid; deze versie maakt geen gebruik van verborgen hand- of partnertoestemmingsvariaties.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Hoe wordt het openingsmeldpunt berekend?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Het minimum is 50 punten onder de cumulatieve punten van 1,500, 90 van 1,500, 120 van 3,000 en 150 van 5,000. Bestaande meldpunten tellen niet mee voor een nieuwe opening.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Is mijn game geüpload of opgeslagen?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Er is geen spel geüpload. Opslaan is optioneel en maakt gebruik van lokale opslag in deze browser op dit apparaat.","Rules and limitations":"Regels en beperkingen","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Dit is een informele variant voor twee spelers tegen een eenvoudige lokale computertegenstander, geen online multiplayer of gokken. Het maakt gebruik van het gemeenschappelijke 5,000-puntendoel, 15-kaartdeling, tweekaartentrekking en op scores gebaseerde openingsdrempels. De tabelregels verschillen: deze versie implementeert geen partnerschapstoestemming om uit te gaan, speciale verborgen handbonussen, rood-drie-vervangingskeuzes of aangepaste huisregels. Als de voorraad geen twee kaarten kan opleveren, wordt de ronde gescoord.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis te spelen. Je hand en score blijven in deze browser op dit apparaat; er worden geen spelgegevens geüpload.","Play Canasta":"Speel Canasta af","Related tools":"Gerelateerde hulpmiddelen","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · DRAAIT IN UW BROWSER","Language":"Taal","UsefulVerse":"Handig vers","All tools":"Alle gereedschappen","New round":"Nieuwe ronde","Play next round":"Speel de volgende ronde","Resume saved round":"Opgeslagen ronde hervatten","Delete saved round":"Opgeslagen ronde verwijderen","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Start een ronde of hervat een opgeslagen ronde.","You":"Jij","Computer":"Computer","Your hand":"Je hand","Computer cards":"Computerkaarten","Stock":"Voorraad","Discard pile":"Aflegstapel","Your melds":"Jouw meldingen","Draw two cards":"Trek twee kaarten","Take discard pile":"Pak de aflegstapel","Discard selected card":"Geselecteerde kaart weggooien","Selected cards":"Geselecteerde kaarten","Clear selection":"Selectie wissen","Meld rank":"Meld-rang","Lay down meld":"Leg versmelting neer","Total score":"Totale score","Round points":"Ronde punten","Opening meld needs":"Openingsmeldbehoeften","Turn":"Draai","Choose New round to begin.":"Kies Nieuwe ronde om te beginnen.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Ronde begonnen. Trek twee kaarten.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Jouw beurt: trek twee kaarten uit de stapel of neem de aflegstapel.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Leg legale combinaties neer als je dat wilt, en verwijder dan één kaart.","Computer is taking its turn…":"De computer is aan de beurt...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Twee kaarten getrokken. Maak melds of gooi weg.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Aflegstapel genomen. Maak melds of gooi weg.","Meld placed.":"Meld geplaatst.","Card discarded.":"Kaart weggegooid.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Deze actie is niet legaal. Controleer de regels en geselecteerde kaarten.","You went out and won the round.":"Je ging naar buiten en won de ronde.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"De computer is uitgevallen. Ronde gescoord.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"De voorraad kan niet twee kaarten leveren. Ronde gescoord.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Je hebt het doel bereikt en het spel gewonnen!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"De computer heeft het doel bereikt en het spel gewonnen.","The match is tied.":"De wedstrijd is gelijk.","Clean canasta":"Schone canasta","Mixed canasta":"Gemengde canasta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Voor het uitgaan heb je een canasta nodig.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Lokaal opslaan is niet beschikbaar in deze browser. Je kunt blijven spelen zolang deze pagina open blijft.","Round saved on this device.":"Ronde opgeslagen op dit apparaat.","Saved round resumed.":"Opgeslagen ronde hervat.","Saved round deleted.":"Opgeslagen ronde verwijderd.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Opgeslagen ronde kon niet worden gelezen. Start een nieuwe ronde of verwijder de beschadigde save.","Card":"Kaart","Wild":"Wild","Frozen":"Bevroren","Open":"Geopend","points":"punten","Twos":"Twee stuks","Threes":"Drie","Fours":"Vier","Fives":"Vijven","Sixes":"Zessen","Sevens":"Zevens","Eights":"Achten","Nines":"Negen","Tens":"Tientallen","Jacks":"Vijzels","Queens":"Koninginnen","Kings":"Koningen","Aces":"Azen","Hearts":"Harten","Diamonds":"Diamanten","Clubs":"Clubs","Spades":"Schoppen","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Regeloverzicht","Canasta rules":"Canasta-regels"},"pl":{"Canasta":"Kanasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — darmowa gra karciana Canasta kontra komputer","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Graj w Kanastę dla dwóch graczy online przeciwko komputerowi lokalnemu. Rysuj, łącz, zamrażaj i bierz stos kart odrzuconych, buduj czyste lub mieszane kanasty i śledź wynik rundy. Bezpłatny; Twoje karty pozostaną na tym urządzeniu.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Zagraj w pełną rundę Canasta dla dwóch graczy w przeglądarce. Twórz układy pasujących rang, używaj dwójek i jokerów jako dzikich kart i stwórz kanastę z siedmiu kart przed wyjściem.","A quick example":"Krótki przykład","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Trzej naturalne króle mogą otworzyć meldunek. Dodawaj karty tej rangi w późniejszych turach; siedem kart naturalnych tworzy czystą kanastę o wartości 500 punktów, podczas gdy połączenie z dzikimi kartami to kanasta mieszana o wartości 300 dodatkowych punktów.","How to play":"Jak grać","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Ta wersja wykorzystuje dwie standardowe talie plus cztery jokery (karty 108), karty 15 na gracza i dwie karty dobierane z magazynu w każdej turze. Połącz co najmniej trzy karty tej samej rangi; dwójki i jokery są dzikie i nie zawierają więcej dzikich niż naturalne karty. Pierwsze połączenie musi osiągnąć próg punktowy dla Twojego bieżącego wyniku. Stos kart odrzuconych może zostać wzięty tylko z dwiema naturalnymi kartami pasującymi do jego wierzchniej karty. Dzika karta lub czarna trójka zamrażają stos. Aby wyjść, potrzebujesz co najmniej jednej kanasty z siedmioma kartami.","Frequently asked questions":"Często zadawane pytania","What is a canasta?":"Co to jest kanasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Kanasta to połączenie siedmiu lub więcej kart tej samej rangi. Siedem kart naturalnych tworzy czystą kanastę (punkty dodatkowe 500); układ zawierający dziką kartę jest mieszany (punkty dodatkowe 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Jak wziąć stos kart odrzuconych?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Trzymaj dwie naturalne karty pasujące do górnej odrzuconej karty. Stos zostaje zamrożony, gdy jego wierzchnią kartą jest dzika karta lub czarna trójka. Musisz także być w stanie zawrzeć legalny układ z wierzchnią kartą zgodnie z wymaganiami otwarcia.","When can I go out?":"Kiedy mogę wyjść?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Możesz opróżnić rękę dopiero wtedy, gdy twoja strona będzie miała siedmikartową kanastę. Ostatnia karta zostaje odrzucona; ta wersja nie wykorzystuje odmian z ukrytą ręką ani za zgodą partnera.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Jak obliczany jest meldunek otwierający?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Minimem jest 50 punktów poniżej 1,500 punktów skumulowanych, 90 z 1,500, 120 z 3,000 i 150 z 5,000. Istniejące punkty łączenia nie są wliczane do nowego otwarcia.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Czy moja gra została przesłana czy zapisana?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Nie przesłano żadnej gry. Zapisywanie jest opcjonalne i wykorzystuje pamięć lokalną w tej przeglądarce na tym urządzeniu.","Rules and limitations":"Zasady i ograniczenia","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"To zwykła odmiana dla dwóch graczy przeciwko prostemu lokalnemu przeciwnikowi komputerowemu, a nie gra wieloosobowa online lub hazard. Wykorzystuje wspólny cel punktowy 5,000, rozdanie kart 15, losowanie dwóch kart i progi otwarcia oparte na wynikach. Zasady dotyczące stołów są różne: ta wersja nie uwzględnia partnerskiego pozwolenia na wyjście, specjalnych premii za ukryte ręce, możliwości wyboru czerwonej trójki ani niestandardowych zasad domu. Jeśli w magazynie nie mogą znaleźć się dwie karty, runda jest punktowana.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Za darmo. Twoje rozdanie i wynik pozostają w tej przeglądarce na tym urządzeniu; żadne dane gry nie są przesyłane.","Play Canasta":"Zagraj w Kanastę","Related tools":"Powiązane narzędzia","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BEZPŁATNY · DZIAŁA W TWOJEJ PRZEGLĄDARCE","Language":"Język","UsefulVerse":"Przydatny werset","All tools":"Wszystkie narzędzia","New round":"Nowa runda","Play next round":"Zagraj w następną rundę","Resume saved round":"Wznów zapisaną rundę","Delete saved round":"Usuń zapisaną rundę","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Rozpocznij rundę lub wznów zapisaną.","You":"Ty","Computer":"Komputer","Your hand":"Twoja dłoń","Computer cards":"Karty komputerowe","Stock":"Magazyn","Discard pile":"Stos odrzutów","Your melds":"Twoje połączenia","Draw two cards":"Dobierz dwie karty","Take discard pile":"Weź stos kart odrzuconych","Discard selected card":"Odrzuć wybraną kartę","Selected cards":"Wybrane karty","Clear selection":"Wyczyść wybór","Meld rank":"Stan połączenia","Lay down meld":"Połóż się","Total score":"Całkowity wynik","Round points":"Punkty okrągłe","Opening meld needs":"Wymagane połączenie otwierające","Turn":"Obrót","Choose New round to begin.":"Wybierz Nowa runda, aby rozpocząć.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Runda się rozpoczęła. Dobierz dwie karty.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Twoja kolej: dobierz dwie karty z magazynu lub weź stos kart odrzuconych.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Ułóż legalne układy, jeśli chcesz, a następnie odrzuć jedną kartę.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Komputer robi swoją kolej…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Wyciągnięto dwie karty. Twórz układy lub odrzucaj.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Zabrano stos odrzutów. Twórz układy lub odrzucaj.","Meld placed.":"Stop umieszczony.","Card discarded.":"Karta odrzucona.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"To działanie jest nielegalne. Sprawdź zasady i wybrane karty.","You went out and won the round.":"Wyszedłeś i wygrałeś rundę.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Komputer się wyłączył. Runda zdobyta.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"W magazynie nie ma możliwości dostarczenia dwóch kart. Runda zdobyta.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Osiągnąłeś cel i wygrałeś grę!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Komputer osiągnął cel i wygrał grę.","The match is tied.":"Remis.","Clean canasta":"Wyczyść kanastę","Mixed canasta":"Kanasta mieszana","You need a canasta before going out.":"Przed wyjściem potrzebujesz kanasty.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Zapisywanie lokalne jest niedostępne w tej przeglądarce. Możesz grać dalej, dopóki ta strona będzie otwarta.","Round saved on this device.":"Runda zapisana na tym urządzeniu.","Saved round resumed.":"Zapisana runda została wznowiona.","Saved round deleted.":"Zapisana runda została usunięta.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Nie można odczytać zapisanej rundy. Rozpocznij nową rundę lub usuń uszkodzony zapis.","Card":"Karta","Wild":"Dziki","Frozen":"Zamrożone","Open":"Otwarte","points":"punkty","Twos":"Dwójki","Threes":"Trójki","Fours":"Czwórki","Fives":"Piątki","Sixes":"Szóstki","Sevens":"Siódemki","Eights":"Ósemki","Nines":"Dziewiątki","Tens":"Dziesiątki","Jacks":"Gniazda","Queens":"Królowe","Kings":"Królowie","Aces":"Asy","Hearts":"Serca","Diamonds":"Diamenty","Clubs":"Kluby","Spades":"Piki","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Przegląd zasad","Canasta rules":"Reguły Kanady"},"pt":{"Canasta":"Canastra","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Jogo de Cartas Canasta Grátis vs Computador","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Jogue Canasta para dois jogadores online contra um computador local. Desenhe, mescle, congele e pegue a pilha de descarte, construa canastas limpas ou mistas e acompanhe a pontuação da rodada. Livre; seus cartões permanecem neste dispositivo.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Jogue uma rodada completa de Canastra para dois jogadores em seu navegador. Forme combinações de classificações correspondentes, use dois e curingas como curingas e faça uma canastra de sete cartas antes de sair.","A quick example":"Um exemplo rápido","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Três Reis naturais podem abrir uma combinação. Adicione cartas desse valor nos turnos posteriores; sete cartas naturais formam uma canastra limpa que vale um bônus de pontos 500, enquanto uma combinação com curingas é uma canastra mista que vale pontos de bônus 300.","How to play":"Como jogar","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Esta versão usa dois baralhos padrão mais quatro curingas (cartas 108), cartas 15 por jogador e duas cartas retiradas do estoque a cada turno. Combine pelo menos três cartas do mesmo valor; dois e curingas são selvagens, sem mais cartas selvagens do que cartas naturais. A primeira combinação deve atingir o limite de pontos da sua pontuação atual. Uma pilha de descarte só pode ser retirada com duas cartas naturais que correspondam à carta do topo. Um curinga ou três preto congela a pilha. Você precisa de pelo menos uma canastra de sete cartas para sair.","Frequently asked questions":"Perguntas frequentes","What is a canasta?":"O que é uma canastra?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Uma canastra é uma combinação de sete ou mais cartas do mesmo valor. Sete cartas naturais formam uma canastra limpa (pontos bônus 500); uma combinação contendo um curinga é misturada (pontos de bônus 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Como faço para retirar a pilha de descarte?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Segure duas cartas naturais que correspondam ao descarte superior. A pilha é congelada quando a carta do topo é um curinga ou um três preto. Você também deve ser capaz de fazer uma combinação legal com a carta do topo de acordo com seu requisito de abertura.","When can I go out?":"Quando posso sair?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Você só poderá esvaziar sua mão depois que seu lado tiver uma canastra de sete cartas. A última carta é descartada; esta versão não usa variações de mão oculta ou permissão do parceiro.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Como é calculada a combinação de abertura?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"O mínimo é 50 pontos abaixo dos pontos cumulativos 1,500, 90 de 1,500, 120 de 3,000 e 150 de 5,000. Os pontos de fusão existentes não contam para uma nova abertura.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Meu jogo foi carregado ou salvo?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Nenhum jogo foi carregado. Salvar é opcional e usa armazenamento local neste navegador neste dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Regras e limitações","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Esta é uma variante casual para dois jogadores contra um simples oponente de computador local, não multijogador online ou jogos de azar. Ele usa o alvo comum de pontos 5,000, distribuição de cartas 15, sorteio de duas cartas e limites de abertura baseados em pontuação. As regras da mesa são diferentes: esta versão não implementa permissão de parceria para sair, bônus especiais de mão oculta, opções de substituição de três vermelhos ou regras personalizadas. Se o estoque não puder fornecer duas cartas, a rodada será pontuada.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Grátis para jogar. Sua mão e pontuação permanecem neste navegador neste dispositivo; nenhum dado do jogo é carregado.","Play Canasta":"Jogar Canastra","Related tools":"Ferramentas relacionadas","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRÁTIS · FUNCIONA NO SEU NAVEGADOR","Language":"Idioma","UsefulVerse":"VersoÚtil","All tools":"Todas as ferramentas","New round":"Nova rodada","Play next round":"Jogar próxima rodada","Resume saved round":"Retomar rodada salva","Delete saved round":"Excluir rodada salva","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Inicie uma rodada ou retome uma rodada salva.","You":"Você","Computer":"Computador","Your hand":"Sua mão","Computer cards":"Placas de computador","Stock":"Estoque","Discard pile":"Pilha de descarte","Your melds":"Suas combinações","Draw two cards":"Compre duas cartas","Take discard pile":"Pegue a pilha de descarte","Discard selected card":"Descarte o cartão selecionado","Selected cards":"Cartões selecionados","Clear selection":"Limpar seleção","Meld rank":"Classificação de fusão","Lay down meld":"Estabelecer fusão","Total score":"Pontuação total","Round points":"Pontos redondos","Opening meld needs":"Necessidades de abertura de fusão","Turn":"Turno","Choose New round to begin.":"Escolha Nova rodada para começar.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Rodada iniciada. Compre duas cartas.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Sua vez: compre duas cartas do estoque ou pegue a pilha de descarte.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Estabeleça combinações legais se desejar e depois descarte uma carta.","Computer is taking its turn…":"O computador está dando a sua vez…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Duas cartas sorteadas. Faça combinações ou descarte.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Pilha de descarte retirada. Faça combinações ou descarte.","Meld placed.":"Função colocada.","Card discarded.":"Cartão descartado.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Essa ação não é legal. Confira as regras e os cards selecionados.","You went out and won the round.":"Você saiu e venceu a rodada.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"O computador apagou. Rodada marcada.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"O estoque não pode fornecer dois cartões. Rodada marcada.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Você atingiu a meta e ganhou o jogo!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"O computador atingiu o alvo e ganhou o jogo.","The match is tied.":"A partida está empatada.","Clean canasta":"Canastra limpa","Mixed canasta":"Canastra mista","You need a canasta before going out.":"Você precisa de uma canastra antes de sair.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"O salvamento local não está disponível neste navegador. Você pode continuar jogando enquanto esta página permanece aberta.","Round saved on this device.":"Rodada salva neste dispositivo.","Saved round resumed.":"Rodada salva retomada.","Saved round deleted.":"Rodada salva excluída.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"A rodada salva não pôde ser lida. Comece uma nova rodada ou exclua o salvamento danificado.","Card":"Cartão","Wild":"Selvagem","Frozen":"Congelado","Open":"Abrir","points":"pontos","Twos":"Dois","Threes":"Três","Fours":"Quatro","Fives":"Cincos","Sixes":"Seis","Sevens":"Sete","Eights":"Oitos","Nines":"Noves","Tens":"Dezenas","Jacks":"Macacos","Queens":"Rainhas","Kings":"Reis","Aces":"Ases","Hearts":"Corações","Diamonds":"Diamantes","Clubs":"Clubes","Spades":"Espadas","Joker":"Coringa","Rules overview":"Visão geral das regras","Canasta rules":"Regras da Canastra"},"ru":{"Canasta":"Канаста","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Бесплатная карточная игра «Канаста» для компьютера","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Играйте в Канасту для двух игроков онлайн против локального компьютера. Рисуйте, объединяйте, замораживайте и забирайте стопку сброса, создавайте чистые или смешанные канасты и отслеживайте счет раундов. Бесплатно; ваши карты останутся на этом устройстве.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Сыграйте полный раунд Канасты для двух игроков в браузере. Формируйте комбинации совпадающих рангов, используйте двойки и джокеры в качестве подстановочных карт и перед выходом составьте канасту из семи карт.","A quick example":"Краткий пример","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Три естественных короля могут создать объединение. Добавляйте карты этого ранга в последующие ходы; семь натуральных карт составляют чистую канасту, приносящую бонус 500 очков, а комбинация с подстановочными картами представляет собой смешанную канасту, приносящую 300 бонусных очков.","How to play":"Как играть","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"В этой версии используются две стандартные колоды плюс четыре джокера (карты 108), карты 15 на каждого игрока и две карты, вытягиваемые из запаса каждый ход. Объедините как минимум три карты одного ранга; двойки и джокеры являются дикими, и в них не больше диких карт, чем в натуральных картах. Первая комбинация должна соответствовать пороговому значению вашего текущего счета. Стопку сброса можно взять только с двумя натуральными картами, совпадающими с верхней картой. Дикая карта или черная тройка замораживает стопку. Для выхода вам понадобится хотя бы одна семикарточная канаста.","Frequently asked questions":"Часто задаваемые вопросы","What is a canasta?":"Что такое канаста?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Канаста — это комбинация из семи и более карт одного ранга. Семь натуральных карт составляют чистую канасту (бонусные баллы 500); комбинация, содержащая подстановочный знак, является смешанной (бонусные баллы 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Как взять стопку сброса?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Держите две натуральные карты, соответствующие верхнему сбросу. Стопка замораживается, когда ее верхняя карта — подстановочная карта или черная тройка. Вы также должны быть в состоянии составить легальную комбинацию с верхней картой в соответствии с вашими вступительными требованиями.","When can I go out?":"Когда я смогу выйти?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Вы можете опустошить руку только после того, как на вашей стороне появится канаста из семи карт. Последняя карта сбрасывается; в этой версии не используются варианты скрытой руки или разрешения партнера.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Как рассчитывается начальная комбинация?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Минимум составляет 50 баллов ниже 1,500 совокупных баллов, 90 от 1,500, 120 от 3,000 и 150 от 5,000. Существующие точки объединения не учитываются при создании нового открытия.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Моя игра загружена или сохранена?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Игра не загружена. Сохранение не является обязательным и использует локальное хранилище в этом браузере на этом устройстве.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Это казуальный вариант для двух игроков против простого локального компьютерного противника, а не многопользовательская онлайн-игра или азартные игры. Он использует общую цель в очках 5,000, раздачу карт 15, розыгрыш двух карт и пороги открытия на основе очков. Правила стола различаются: в этой версии не реализовано разрешение партнерства на выход, специальные бонусы за скрытую руку, выбор замены «красное-три» или индивидуальные правила. Если в колоде не может быть две карты, раунд засчитывается.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Играть можно бесплатно. Ваша рука и счет остаются в этом браузере на этом устройстве; никакие игровые данные не загружаются.","Play Canasta":"Играть в Канасту","Related tools":"Сопутствующие инструменты","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕСПЛАТНО · ЗАПУСКАЕТСЯ В ВАШЕМ БРАУЗЕРЕ","Language":"Язык","UsefulVerse":"Полезный стих","All tools":"Все инструменты","New round":"Новый раунд","Play next round":"Играть в следующем раунде","Resume saved round":"Возобновить сохраненный раунд","Delete saved round":"Удалить сохраненный раунд","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Начать раунд или возобновить сохраненный.","You":"Вы","Computer":"Компьютер","Your hand":"Ваша рука","Computer cards":"Компьютерные карты","Stock":"Склад","Discard pile":"Куча сброса","Your melds":"Ваши комбинации","Draw two cards":"Вытяните две карты","Take discard pile":"Возьмите стопку сброса","Discard selected card":"Отменить выбранную карту","Selected cards":"Выбранные карты","Clear selection":"Очистить выбор","Meld rank":"Объединить ранг","Lay down meld":"Сложите смесь","Total score":"Общий балл","Round points":"Круглые наконечники","Opening meld needs":"Необходимо открыть объединение","Turn":"Поворот","Choose New round to begin.":"Чтобы начать, выберите «Новый раунд».","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Раунд начался. Возьмите две карты.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Ваш ход: возьмите две карты из запаса или возьмите стопку сброса.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Если хотите, выложите допустимые комбинации, а затем сбросьте одну карту.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Компьютер начинает свою очередь…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Вытянуты две карты. Создавайте комбинации или отбрасывайте.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Куча сброса взята. Создавайте комбинации или отбрасывайте.","Meld placed.":"Объединение размещено.","Card discarded.":"Карта выброшена.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Это действие незаконно. Ознакомьтесь с правилами и выбранными картами.","You went out and won the round.":"Вы вышли и выиграли раунд.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Компьютер отключился. Раунд засчитан.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"На складе невозможно поставить две карты. Раунд засчитан.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Вы достигли цели и выиграли игру!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Компьютер достиг цели и выиграл игру.","The match is tied.":"Матч ничейный.","Clean canasta":"Очистка канасты","Mixed canasta":"Смешанная канаста","You need a canasta before going out.":"Перед выходом на улицу вам понадобится канаста.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Локальное сохранение недоступно в этом браузере. Вы можете продолжать играть, пока эта страница остается открытой.","Round saved on this device.":"Раунд сохранен на этом устройстве.","Saved round resumed.":"Сохраненный раунд возобновлен.","Saved round deleted.":"Сохраненный раунд удален.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Сохраненный раунд не может быть прочитан. Начните новый раунд или удалите поврежденное сохранение.","Card":"Карта","Wild":"Дикий","Frozen":"Замороженный","Open":"Открыть","points":"баллы","Twos":"Двойки","Threes":"Тройки","Fours":"Четверки","Fives":"Пятерки","Sixes":"Шестёрки","Sevens":"Семерки","Eights":"Восьмерки","Nines":"Девятки","Tens":"Десятки","Jacks":"Домкраты","Queens":"Королевы","Kings":"Короли","Aces":"Тузы","Hearts":"Сердца","Diamonds":"Бриллианты","Clubs":"Клубы","Spades":"Пики","Joker":"Джокер","Rules overview":"Обзор правил","Canasta rules":"Правила Канасты"},"sv":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Gratis Canasta Card Game vs Computer","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Spela Canasta för två spelare online mot en lokal dator. Rita, smält, frys och ta bortkastningshögen, bygg rena eller blandade canastas och spåra den runda poängen. Gratis; dina kort stannar på den här enheten.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Spela en komplett Canasta-runda för två spelare i din webbläsare. Skapa sammanslagningar av matchande rangord, använd tvåor och jokrar som jokrar och gör en kanasta av sju kort innan du går ut.","A quick example":"Ett snabbt exempel","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Tre naturliga kungar kan öppna en sammansmältning. Lägg till kort med den rangen över senare omgångar; sju naturliga kort gör en ren canasta värd en 500-poängbonus, medan en blandning med jokerkort är en blandad canasta värd 300 bonuspoäng.","How to play":"Hur man spelar","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Denna version använder två standardlekar plus fyra jokrar (108-kort), 15-kort per spelare och två kort som dras från lagret varje tur. Meld minst tre kort av en rang; tvåor och jokrar är vilda, med inte mer vilda än naturliga kort. Den första blandningen måste uppfylla poängtröskeln för din nuvarande poäng. En kasthög kan endast tas med två naturliga kort som matchar dess översta kort. Ett wild card eller svart tre fryser högen. Du behöver minst en sjukorts canasta för att gå ut.","Frequently asked questions":"Vanliga frågor","What is a canasta?":"Vad är en canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"En canasta är en sammanslagning av sju eller fler kort av samma rang. Sju naturliga kort gör en ren canasta (500 bonuspoäng); en blandning som innehåller ett jokertecken blandas (300 bonuspoäng).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Hur tar jag kasseringshögen?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Håll två naturliga kort som matchar den översta slängningen. Högen fryses när dess översta kort är ett wild card eller svart trea. Du måste också kunna göra en laglig blandning med det översta kortet under ditt öppningskrav.","When can I go out?":"När kan jag gå ut?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Du får tömma din hand först efter att din sida har en sjukorts canasta. Det sista kortet kasseras; den här versionen använder inte varianter av dolda hand eller partnertillstånd.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Hur beräknas öppningsblandningen?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Det minsta är 50 poäng under 1,500 kumulativa poäng, 90 från 1,500, 120 från 3,000 och 150 från 5,000. Befintliga smältpunkter räknas inte mot en ny öppning.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Är mitt spel uppladdat eller sparat?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Inget spel laddas upp. Att spara är valfritt och använder lokal lagring i den här webbläsaren på den här enheten.","Rules and limitations":"Regler och begränsningar","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Detta är en avslappnad variant med två spelare mot en enkel lokal datormotståndare, inte online multiplayer eller hasardspel. Den använder det vanliga 5,000-poängmålet, 15-kortutdelningen, tvåkortsdragning och poängbaserade öppningströsklar. Tabellreglerna skiljer sig åt: den här versionen implementerar inte partnerskapstillstånd att gå ut, speciella bonusar för dolda händer, röda-tre-ersättningsval eller anpassade husregler. Om lagret inte kan leverera två kort, poängsätts omgången.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Gratis att spela. Din hand och poäng stannar i den här webbläsaren på den här enheten; ingen speldata laddas upp.","Play Canasta":"Spela Canasta","Related tools":"Relaterade verktyg","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KÖR I DIN WEBBläsare","Language":"Språk","UsefulVerse":"Användbar vers","All tools":"Alla verktyg","New round":"Ny omgång","Play next round":"Spela nästa omgång","Resume saved round":"Återuppta sparad omgång","Delete saved round":"Ta bort sparad omgång","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Starta en runda eller återuppta en sparad.","You":"Du","Computer":"Dator","Your hand":"Din hand","Computer cards":"Datorkort","Stock":"Lager","Discard pile":"Kassera högen","Your melds":"Dina smälter","Draw two cards":"Dra två kort","Take discard pile":"Ta bort högen","Discard selected card":"Kassera valt kort","Selected cards":"Utvalda kort","Clear selection":"Rensa valet","Meld rank":"Meld rank","Lay down meld":"Lägg ner meld","Total score":"Totalpoäng","Round points":"Runda punkter","Opening meld needs":"Öppningssmältningsbehov","Turn":"Vrid","Choose New round to begin.":"Välj Ny omgång för att börja.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Runda startade. Dra två kort.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Din tur: dra två kort från lager eller ta bortkastningshögen.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Lägg ner lagliga sammanslagningar om du vill, släng sedan ett kort.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Datorn tar sin tur...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Två kort dragna. Gör smältningar eller kassera.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Kassera högen tagen. Gör smältningar eller kassera.","Meld placed.":"Meld placerad.","Card discarded.":"Kort kasserat.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Den åtgärden är inte laglig. Kontrollera reglerna och valda kort.","You went out and won the round.":"Du gick ut och vann omgången.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Datorn slocknade. Gjord omgång.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Beståndet kan inte leverera två kort. Gjord omgång.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Du nådde målet och vann spelet!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Datorn nådde målet och vann spelet.","The match is tied.":"Matchen är oavgjord.","Clean canasta":"Ren canasta","Mixed canasta":"Blandad canasta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Du behöver en canasta innan du går ut.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Lokal lagring är inte tillgänglig i den här webbläsaren. Du kan fortsätta spela medan den här sidan är öppen.","Round saved on this device.":"Runda sparad på den här enheten.","Saved round resumed.":"Sparad omgång återupptas.","Saved round deleted.":"Sparad omgång raderad.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Sparad omgång kunde inte läsas. Starta en ny omgång eller ta bort den skadade räddningen.","Card":"Kort","Wild":"Vild","Frozen":"Fryst","Open":"Öppen","points":"poäng","Twos":"Tvåor","Threes":"Treor","Fours":"Fyror","Fives":"Fimmor","Sixes":"Sexor","Sevens":"Sjuor","Eights":"Åtta","Nines":"Nio","Tens":"Tiotals","Jacks":"Stockar","Queens":"Drottningar","Kings":"Kungar","Aces":"Äss","Hearts":"Hjärtan","Diamonds":"Diamanter","Clubs":"Klubbar","Spades":"Spader","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Regleröversikt","Canasta rules":"Canasta-regler"},"sw":{"Canasta":"Kanasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Mchezo Bila Malipo wa Kadi ya Canasta dhidi ya Kompyuta","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Cheza Canasta ya wachezaji wawili mtandaoni dhidi ya kompyuta ya ndani. Chora, changanya, fungia na uchukue rundo la kutupa, jenga canasta safi au mchanganyiko na ufuatilie alama za pande zote. Bure; kadi zako hukaa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Cheza duru kamili ya wachezaji wawili ya Canasta kwenye kivinjari chako. Unda safu zinazolingana, tumia wawili-wawili na wacheshi kama kadi potofu, na tengeneza canasta ya kadi saba kabla ya kutoka.","A quick example":"Mfano wa haraka","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Wafalme watatu wa asili wanaweza kufungua meld. Ongeza kadi za cheo hicho juu ya zamu za baadaye; kadi saba za asili hufanya canasta safi yenye thamani ya bonasi ya pointi 500, wakati meld yenye kadi pori ni canasta iliyochanganywa yenye thamani ya pointi za bonasi za 300.","How to play":"Jinsi ya kucheza","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Toleo hili linatumia sitaha mbili za kawaida pamoja na vicheshi vinne (kadi 108), kadi 15 kwa kila mchezaji na kadi mbili zinazotolewa kutoka kwa hisa kila zamu. Unganisha angalau kadi tatu za cheo kimoja; wawili na wacheshi ni wakali, hawana zaidi ya kadi za asili. Mchanganyiko wa kwanza lazima ufikie kizingiti cha pointi kwa alama yako ya sasa. Rundo la kutupa linaweza kuchukuliwa tu na kadi mbili za asili zinazofanana na kadi yake ya juu. Kadi ya mwitu au nyeusi tatu hufungia rundo. Unahitaji angalau canasta moja ya kadi saba ili kwenda nje.","Frequently asked questions":"Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara","What is a canasta?":"Kanasta ni nini?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"A canasta ni mchanganyiko wa kadi saba au zaidi za cheo sawa. Kadi saba za asili hufanya canasta safi (pointi za bonus 500); meld iliyo na kadi ya mwitu imechanganywa (pointi za bonasi 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Je, ninawezaje kuchukua rundo la kutupa?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Shikilia kadi mbili asili zinazolingana na kile kilichotupa cha juu. Rundo limegandishwa wakati kadi yake ya juu ni kadi ya mwitu au nyeusi tatu. Ni lazima pia uweze kutengeneza mchanganyiko wa kisheria na kadi ya juu chini ya hitaji lako la ufunguzi.","When can I go out?":"Je, ninaweza kutoka lini?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Unaweza kumwaga mkono wako baada tu ya upande wako kuwa na canasta ya kadi saba. Kadi ya mwisho inatupwa; toleo hili halitumii tofauti zilizofichwa za mkono au za mshirika.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Je, meld ya ufunguzi imehesabiwaje?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Kima cha chini zaidi ni 50 pointi chini ya 1,500 pointi limbikizi, 90 kutoka 1,500, 120 kutoka 3,000 na 150 kutoka 5,000. Pointi zilizopo za meld hazihesabiwi kuelekea ufunguzi mpya.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Je, mchezo wangu umepakiwa au umehifadhiwa?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Hakuna mchezo unaopakiwa. Kuhifadhi ni hiari na hutumia hifadhi ya ndani katika kivinjari hiki kwenye kifaa hiki.","Rules and limitations":"Sheria na mapungufu","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Hiki ni kibadala cha kawaida cha wachezaji wawili dhidi ya mpinzani rahisi wa kompyuta ya ndani, si wachezaji wengi mtandaoni au kamari. Inatumia lengo la kawaida la 5,000, mpango wa kadi 15, sare ya kadi mbili na vizingiti vya ufunguzi kulingana na alama. Sheria za jedwali hutofautiana: toleo hili halitekelezi ruhusa ya ubia ya kutoka, bonasi maalum zilizofichwa, chaguzi za uingizwaji nyekundu-tatu, au sheria maalum za nyumba. Ikiwa hisa haiwezi kutoa kadi mbili, mzunguko unapigwa.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Huru kucheza. Mkono wako na alama hukaa kwenye kivinjari hiki kwenye kifaa hiki; hakuna data ya mchezo iliyopakiwa.","Play Canasta":"Cheza Canasta","Related tools":"Zana zinazohusiana","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BILA MALIPO · INAENDELEA KATIKA KIvinjari CHAKO","Language":"Lugha","UsefulVerse":"MuhimuVerse","All tools":"Vyombo vyote","New round":"Mzunguko mpya","Play next round":"Cheza raundi inayofuata","Resume saved round":"Rejea mzunguko uliohifadhiwa","Delete saved round":"Futa mzunguko uliohifadhiwa","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Anzisha duru au uendelee na iliyohifadhiwa.","You":"Wewe","Computer":"Kompyuta","Your hand":"Mkono wako","Computer cards":"Kadi za kompyuta","Stock":"Hifadhi","Discard pile":"Tupa rundo","Your melds":"Melds yako","Draw two cards":"Chora kadi mbili","Take discard pile":"Chukua rundo la kutupa","Discard selected card":"Tupa kadi iliyochaguliwa","Selected cards":"Kadi zilizochaguliwa","Clear selection":"Futa uteuzi","Meld rank":"kiwango cha Meld","Lay down meld":"Weka chini meld","Total score":"Jumla ya alama","Round points":"Alama za pande zote","Opening meld needs":"Kufungua mahitaji ya meld","Turn":"Washa","Choose New round to begin.":"Chagua duru Mpya ili kuanza.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Mzunguko umeanza. Chora kadi mbili.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Zamu yako: chora kadi mbili kutoka kwa hisa au chukua rundo la kutupa.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Weka medali za kisheria ukipenda, kisha utupe kadi moja.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Kompyuta inachukua zamu yake...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Kadi mbili zimechorwa. Tengeneza melds au uondoe.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Tupa rundo lililochukuliwa. Tengeneza melds au uondoe.","Meld placed.":"Meld imewekwa.","Card discarded.":"Kadi imetupwa.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Hatua hiyo si halali. Angalia sheria na kadi zilizochaguliwa.","You went out and won the round.":"Ulitoka na kushinda raundi.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Kompyuta ilizimika. Mzunguko ulifunga.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Hifadhi haiwezi kutoa kadi mbili. Mzunguko ulifunga.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Umefikia lengo na kushinda mchezo!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Kompyuta ilifikia lengo na kushinda mchezo.","The match is tied.":"Mechi imefungwa.","Clean canasta":"Safi canasta","Mixed canasta":"Mchanganyiko wa canasta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Unahitaji canasta kabla ya kwenda nje.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Uhifadhi wa ndani haupatikani katika kivinjari hiki. Unaweza kuendelea kucheza ukurasa huu ukiwa wazi.","Round saved on this device.":"Round imehifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Saved round resumed.":"Raundi iliyohifadhiwa imeanza tena.","Saved round deleted.":"Duru iliyohifadhiwa imefutwa.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Raundi iliyohifadhiwa haikuweza kusomeka. Anzisha mzunguko mpya au ufute hifadhi iliyoharibiwa.","Card":"Kadi","Wild":"Pori","Frozen":"Iliyogandishwa","Open":"Fungua","points":"pointi","Twos":"Mbili","Threes":"Tatu","Fours":"Nne","Fives":"Tano","Sixes":"Sita","Sevens":"Saba","Eights":"Nane","Nines":"Tisa","Tens":"Makumi","Jacks":"Jacks","Queens":"Malkia","Kings":"Wafalme","Aces":"Aces","Hearts":"Mioyo","Diamonds":"Almasi","Clubs":"Vilabu","Spades":"Spades","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Muhtasari wa Sheria","Canasta rules":"Sheria za Kanasta"},"ta":{"Canasta":"கனஸ்டா","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"கனஸ்டா ஆன்லைன் — இலவச Canasta Card Game vs Computer","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"உள்ளூர் கணினிக்கு எதிராக இரண்டு-பிளேயர் கனாஸ்டாவை ஆன்லைனில் விளையாடுங்கள். வரையவும், ஒன்றிணைக்கவும், உறைய வைக்கவும் மற்றும் நிராகரிக்கப்பட்ட பைலை எடுத்து, சுத்தமான அல்லது கலவையான கானாஸ்டாக்களை உருவாக்கி, சுற்று மதிப்பெண்ணைக் கண்காணிக்கவும். இலவசம்; உங்கள் கார்டுகள் இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இருக்கும்.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"உங்கள் உலாவியில் முழுமையான இரண்டு-பிளேயர் கேனஸ்டா ரவுண்டை விளையாடுங்கள். பொருந்தக்கூடிய ரேங்க்களின் கலவையை உருவாக்கவும், இருவர் மற்றும் ஜோக்கர்களை வைல்ட் கார்டுகளாகப் பயன்படுத்தவும், மேலும் வெளியே செல்வதற்கு முன் ஏழு அட்டைகளைக் கொண்ட கனஸ்டாவை உருவாக்கவும்.","A quick example":"விரைவான உதாரணம்","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"மூன்று இயற்கை மன்னர்கள் ஒரு கலவையை திறக்க முடியும். பிந்தைய திருப்பங்களில் அந்த தரவரிசையின் அட்டைகளைச் சேர்க்கவும்; ஏழு இயற்கை அட்டைகள் 500-புள்ளி போனஸ் மதிப்புள்ள சுத்தமான கனஸ்டாவை உருவாக்குகின்றன, அதே சமயம் வைல்டு கார்டுகளுடன் ஒரு கலவையானது 300 போனஸ் புள்ளிகள் மதிப்புள்ள கலப்பு கனாஸ்டா ஆகும்.","How to play":"எப்படி விளையாடுவது","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"இந்தப் பதிப்பில் இரண்டு நிலையான அடுக்குகள் மற்றும் நான்கு ஜோக்கர்ஸ் (108 கார்டுகள்), ஒரு வீரருக்கு 15 கார்டுகள் மற்றும் ஒவ்வொரு முறையும் ஸ்டாக்கிலிருந்து எடுக்கப்பட்ட இரண்டு கார்டுகள் பயன்படுத்தப்படுகின்றன. ஒரு தரத்தின் குறைந்தது மூன்று அட்டைகளை இணைக்கவும்; டூஸ் மற்றும் ஜோக்கர்ஸ் காட்டுத்தனமானவை, இயற்கை அட்டைகளை விட காட்டுத்தனம் இல்லை. முதல் கலவையானது உங்கள் தற்போதைய மதிப்பெண்ணுக்கான புள்ளி வரம்பை சந்திக்க வேண்டும். ஒரு நிராகரிப்பு பைலை அதன் மேல் அட்டையுடன் பொருந்தக்கூடிய இரண்டு இயற்கை அட்டைகள் மூலம் மட்டுமே எடுக்க முடியும். ஒரு காட்டு அட்டை அல்லது கருப்பு மூன்று குவியலை உறைய வைக்கிறது. வெளியே செல்ல குறைந்தபட்சம் ஒரு ஏழு-அட்டைகள் கொண்ட கனஸ்டா வேண்டும்.","Frequently asked questions":"அடிக்கடி கேட்கப்படும் கேள்விகள்","What is a canasta?":"கனாஸ்டா என்றால் என்ன?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"ஒரு கனஸ்டா என்பது ஒரே தரத்தில் உள்ள ஏழு அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்ட அட்டைகளின் கலவையாகும். ஏழு இயற்கை அட்டைகள் சுத்தமான கனஸ்டாவை உருவாக்குகின்றன (500 போனஸ் புள்ளிகள்); வைல்டு கார்டைக் கொண்ட ஒரு கலவை கலக்கப்படுகிறது (300 போனஸ் புள்ளிகள்).","How do I take the discard pile?":"நிராகரிப்பு பைலை எப்படி எடுப்பது?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"மேல் நிராகரிப்புடன் பொருந்தக்கூடிய இரண்டு இயற்கை அட்டைகளைப் பிடிக்கவும். அதன் மேல் அட்டை வைல்ட் கார்டாகவோ அல்லது கருப்பு மூன்றாகவோ இருக்கும் போது பைல் உறைந்திருக்கும். உங்கள் தொடக்கத் தேவையின் கீழ், மேல் அட்டையுடன் சட்டப்பூர்வ கலவையை நீங்கள் செய்ய வேண்டும்.","When can I go out?":"நான் எப்போது வெளியே செல்லலாம்?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"உங்கள் பக்கத்தில் ஏழு-அட்டைகள் கொண்ட கானாஸ்டா இருந்த பிறகுதான் உங்கள் கையை காலி செய்ய முடியும். இறுதி அட்டை நிராகரிக்கப்பட்டது; இந்த பதிப்பு மறைந்த கை அல்லது கூட்டாளர் அனுமதி மாறுபாடுகளைப் பயன்படுத்தாது.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"திறப்பு கலவை எவ்வாறு கணக்கிடப்படுகிறது?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"குறைந்தபட்சம் 1,500 ஒட்டுமொத்த புள்ளிகளுக்குக் கீழே 50 புள்ளிகள், 1,500 இலிருந்து 90, 3,000 இலிருந்து 120 மற்றும் 5,000 இலிருந்து 150. தற்போதுள்ள கலவை புள்ளிகள் புதிய திறப்புக்கு கணக்கிடப்படாது.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"எனது கேம் பதிவேற்றப்பட்டதா அல்லது சேமிக்கப்பட்டதா?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"எந்த விளையாட்டும் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை. சேமிப்பது விருப்பமானது மற்றும் இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் உள்ள இந்த உலாவியில் உள்ளூர் சேமிப்பகத்தைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது.","Rules and limitations":"விதிகள் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"இது ஒரு எளிய உள்ளூர் கணினி எதிர்ப்பாளருக்கு எதிரான சாதாரண இரண்டு-பிளேயர் மாறுபாடு, ஆன்லைன் மல்டிபிளேயர் அல்லது சூதாட்டம் அல்ல. இது பொதுவான 5,000-புள்ளி இலக்கு, 15-அட்டை ஒப்பந்தம், இரண்டு-அட்டை டிரா மற்றும் மதிப்பெண் அடிப்படையிலான தொடக்க வரம்புகளைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது. அட்டவணை விதிகள் வேறுபடுகின்றன: இந்த பதிப்பு வெளியே செல்வதற்கான கூட்டாண்மை அனுமதி, சிறப்பு மறைந்த கை போனஸ், சிவப்பு-மூன்று மாற்றுத் தேர்வுகள் அல்லது தனிப்பயன் வீட்டு விதிகளை செயல்படுத்தாது. பங்கு இரண்டு அட்டைகளை வழங்க முடியாவிட்டால், சுற்று மதிப்பெண் பெறப்படுகிறது.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"விளையாட இலவசம். இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இந்த உலாவியில் உங்கள் கை மற்றும் ஸ்கோர் இருக்கும்; விளையாட்டு தரவு பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Play Canasta":"கானாஸ்டாவை விளையாடு","Related tools":"தொடர்புடைய கருவிகள்","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"இலவசம் · உங்கள் உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது","Language":"மொழி","UsefulVerse":"பயனுள்ள வசனம்","All tools":"அனைத்து கருவிகளும்","New round":"புதிய சுற்று","Play next round":"அடுத்த சுற்றில் விளையாடு","Resume saved round":"மீண்டும் சேமிக்கப்பட்ட சுற்று","Delete saved round":"சேமித்த சுற்றை நீக்கு","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"ஒரு சுற்றைத் தொடங்கவும் அல்லது சேமித்ததை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்.","You":"நீங்கள்","Computer":"கணினி","Your hand":"உங்கள் கை","Computer cards":"கணினி அட்டைகள்","Stock":"பங்கு","Discard pile":"பைலை நிராகரிக்கவும்","Your melds":"உங்கள் மெல்ட்ஸ்","Draw two cards":"இரண்டு அட்டைகளை வரையவும்","Take discard pile":"குவியல்களை நிராகரிக்கவும்","Discard selected card":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட கார்டை நிராகரிக்கவும்","Selected cards":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட அட்டைகள்","Clear selection":"தேர்வை அழிக்கவும்","Meld rank":"மெல்ட் ரேங்க்","Lay down meld":"லே டவுன் மெல்ட்","Total score":"மொத்த மதிப்பெண்","Round points":"சுற்றுப் புள்ளிகள்","Opening meld needs":"திறந்த கலவை தேவைகள்","Turn":"திருப்பு","Choose New round to begin.":"தொடங்க புதிய சுற்றைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"சுற்று தொடங்கியது. இரண்டு அட்டைகளை வரையவும்.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"உங்கள் முறை: கையிருப்பில் இருந்து இரண்டு அட்டைகளை வரையவும் அல்லது நிராகரிக்கப்பட்ட பைலை எடுக்கவும்.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"நீங்கள் விரும்பினால் சட்டப்பூர்வ கலவைகளை இடுங்கள், பின்னர் ஒரு அட்டையை நிராகரிக்கவும்.","Computer is taking its turn…":"கணினி அதன் திருப்பத்தை எடுக்கிறது…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"இரண்டு அட்டைகள் வரையப்பட்டது. கலவையை உருவாக்கவும் அல்லது நிராகரிக்கவும்.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"எடுக்கப்பட்ட பைலை நிராகரிக்கவும். கலவையை உருவாக்கவும் அல்லது நிராகரிக்கவும்.","Meld placed.":"மெல்ட் வைக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது.","Card discarded.":"கார்டு நிராகரிக்கப்பட்டது.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"அந்த நடவடிக்கை சட்டப்பூர்வமானது அல்ல. விதிகள் மற்றும் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட அட்டைகளை சரிபார்க்கவும்.","You went out and won the round.":"நீங்கள் வெளியே சென்று சுற்றில் வெற்றி பெற்றீர்கள்.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"கணினி வெளியேறியது. சுற்று அடித்தது.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"பங்கு இரண்டு அட்டைகளை வழங்க முடியாது. சுற்று அடித்தது.","You reached the target and won the game!":"நீங்கள் இலக்கை அடைந்து கேமை வென்றீர்கள்!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"கணினி இலக்கை அடைந்து விளையாட்டை வென்றது.","The match is tied.":"போட்டி டை ஆனது.","Clean canasta":"சுத்தமான கனஸ்டா","Mixed canasta":"கலப்பு கனஸ்டா","You need a canasta before going out.":"வெளியே செல்வதற்கு முன் உங்களுக்கு ஒரு கனஸ்டா தேவை.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"உள்ளூர் சேமிப்பு இந்த உலாவியில் இல்லை. இந்தப் பக்கம் திறந்திருக்கும் போது நீங்கள் தொடர்ந்து விளையாடலாம்.","Round saved on this device.":"சுற்று இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் சேமிக்கப்பட்டது.","Saved round resumed.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட சுற்று மீண்டும் தொடங்கியது.","Saved round deleted.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட சுற்று நீக்கப்பட்டது.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட சுற்றைப் படிக்க முடியவில்லை. புதிய சுற்றைத் தொடங்கவும் அல்லது சேதமடைந்த சேமிப்பை நீக்கவும்.","Card":"அட்டை","Wild":"வைல்ட்","Frozen":"உறைந்தது","Open":"திறந்துள்ளது","points":"புள்ளிகள்","Twos":"இரண்டுகள்","Threes":"மூன்று","Fours":"நான்குகள்","Fives":"ஃபைவ்ஸ்","Sixes":"சிக்ஸர்கள்","Sevens":"செவன்ஸ்","Eights":"எட்டுகள்","Nines":"ஒன்பதுகள்","Tens":"பத்து","Jacks":"ஜாக்ஸ்","Queens":"குயின்ஸ்","Kings":"கிங்ஸ்","Aces":"ஏசஸ்","Hearts":"இதயங்கள்","Diamonds":"வைரங்கள்","Clubs":"கிளப்புகள்","Spades":"ஸ்பேட்ஸ்","Joker":"ஜோக்கர்","Rules overview":"விதிகளின் மேலோட்டம்","Canasta rules":"கனஸ்டா விதிகள்"},"te":{"Canasta":"కెనస్టా","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"కానస్టా ఆన్‌లైన్ — ఉచిత కెనస్టా కార్డ్ గేమ్ vs కంప్యూటర్","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"లోకల్ కంప్యూటర్‌కి వ్యతిరేకంగా ఆన్‌లైన్‌లో టూ-ప్లేయర్ కెనాస్టాను ప్లే చేయండి. గీయండి, కలపండి, స్తంభింపజేయండి మరియు విస్మరించిన పైల్‌ను తీసుకోండి, శుభ్రమైన లేదా మిశ్రమ కనాస్టాలను రూపొందించండి మరియు రౌండ్ స్కోర్‌ను ట్రాక్ చేయండి. ఉచిత; మీ కార్డ్‌లు ఈ పరికరంలో ఉంటాయి.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో పూర్తి టూ-ప్లేయర్ కెనాస్టా రౌండ్‌ను ప్లే చేయండి. మ్యాచింగ్ ర్యాంక్‌ల మెల్డ్‌లను రూపొందించండి, టూస్ మరియు జోకర్‌లను వైల్డ్ కార్డ్‌లుగా ఉపయోగించండి మరియు బయటికి వెళ్లే ముందు ఏడు కార్డ్‌ల కానస్టాను తయారు చేయండి.","A quick example":"సత్వర ఉదాహరణ","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"ముగ్గురు సహజ రాజులు సమ్మేళనాన్ని తెరవగలరు. ఆ ర్యాంక్ యొక్క కార్డ్‌లను తర్వాత మలుపుల్లో జోడించండి; ఏడు సహజ కార్డులు 500-పాయింట్ బోనస్ విలువైన క్లీన్ కెనాస్టాను తయారు చేస్తాయి, అయితే వైల్డ్ కార్డ్‌లతో కలపడం అనేది 300 బోనస్ పాయింట్‌ల విలువైన మిశ్రమ కెనాస్టా.","How to play":"ఎలా ఆడాలి","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"ఈ వెర్షన్‌లో రెండు స్టాండర్డ్ డెక్‌లతో పాటు నాలుగు జోకర్లు (108 కార్డ్‌లు), ఒక్కో ప్లేయర్‌కి 15 కార్డ్‌లు మరియు స్టాక్ నుండి తీసిన ప్రతి మలుపులో రెండు కార్డ్‌లు ఉపయోగించబడతాయి. ఒక ర్యాంక్ యొక్క కనీసం మూడు కార్డులను కలపండి; ఇద్దరు మరియు జోకర్‌లు సహజమైన కార్డ్‌ల కంటే ఎక్కువ వైల్డ్‌గా ఉండవు. మీ ప్రస్తుత స్కోర్ కోసం మొదటి మెల్డ్ తప్పనిసరిగా పాయింట్ థ్రెషోల్డ్‌ను చేరుకోవాలి. ఒక డిస్కార్డ్ పైల్ దాని టాప్ కార్డ్‌కు సరిపోలే రెండు సహజ కార్డ్‌లతో మాత్రమే తీసుకోబడుతుంది. వైల్డ్ కార్డ్ లేదా బ్లాక్ మూడు పైల్‌ను స్తంభింపజేస్తుంది. బయటకు వెళ్లడానికి మీకు కనీసం ఒక ఏడు కార్డ్ కెనాస్టా అవసరం.","Frequently asked questions":"తరచుగా అడిగే ప్రశ్నలు","What is a canasta?":"కనాస్టా అంటే ఏమిటి?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"ఒక కెనాస్టా అనేది అదే ర్యాంక్‌లో ఉన్న ఏడు లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ కార్డ్‌ల మిశ్రమం. ఏడు సహజ కార్డులు ఒక క్లీన్ కెనాస్టా (500 బోనస్ పాయింట్లు) చేస్తాయి; వైల్డ్ కార్డ్‌ను కలిగి ఉన్న మెల్డ్ మిశ్రమంగా ఉంటుంది (300 బోనస్ పాయింట్లు).","How do I take the discard pile?":"నేను డిస్కార్డ్ పైల్‌ని ఎలా తీసుకోవాలి?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"టాప్ డిస్కార్డ్‌కు సరిపోయే రెండు సహజ కార్డ్‌లను పట్టుకోండి. పైల్ దాని టాప్ కార్డ్ వైల్డ్ కార్డ్ లేదా బ్లాక్ త్రీ అయినప్పుడు స్తంభింపజేయబడుతుంది. మీరు తప్పనిసరిగా మీ ప్రారంభ ఆవశ్యకత కింద టాప్ కార్డ్‌తో చట్టబద్ధమైన మెల్డ్‌ను కూడా చేయగలగాలి.","When can I go out?":"నేను ఎప్పుడు బయటకు వెళ్లగలను?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"మీ వైపు ఏడు కార్డ్ కెనాస్టా ఉన్న తర్వాత మాత్రమే మీరు మీ చేతిని ఖాళీ చేయవచ్చు. చివరి కార్డు విస్మరించబడింది; ఈ సంస్కరణ దాచిన చేతి లేదా భాగస్వామి-అనుమతి వైవిధ్యాలను ఉపయోగించదు.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"ఓపెనింగ్ మెల్డ్ ఎలా లెక్కించబడుతుంది?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"కనిష్టం 1,500 సంచిత పాయింట్ల క్రింద 50 పాయింట్లు, 1,500 నుండి 90, 3,000 నుండి 120 మరియు 5,000 నుండి 150. ఇప్పటికే ఉన్న మెల్డ్ పాయింట్లు కొత్త ఓపెనింగ్‌లో లెక్కించబడవు.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"నా గేమ్ అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడిందా లేదా సేవ్ చేయబడిందా?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"ఏ గేమ్ అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు. సేవ్ చేయడం ఐచ్ఛికం మరియు ఈ పరికరంలోని ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో స్థానిక నిల్వను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది.","Rules and limitations":"నియమాలు మరియు పరిమితులు","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"ఇది సాధారణ స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ ప్రత్యర్థికి వ్యతిరేకంగా సాధారణ టూ-ప్లేయర్ వేరియంట్, ఆన్‌లైన్ మల్టీప్లేయర్ లేదా జూదం కాదు. ఇది సాధారణ 5,000-పాయింట్ లక్ష్యం, 15-కార్డ్ డీల్, రెండు-కార్డ్ డ్రా మరియు స్కోర్-ఆధారిత ఓపెనింగ్ థ్రెషోల్డ్‌లను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది. పట్టిక నియమాలు విభిన్నంగా ఉంటాయి: ఈ వెర్షన్ బయటకు వెళ్లడానికి భాగస్వామ్య అనుమతి, ప్రత్యేక కన్సీల్డ్-హ్యాండ్ బోనస్‌లు, రెడ్-త్రీ రీప్లేస్‌మెంట్ ఎంపికలు లేదా అనుకూల గృహ నియమాలను అమలు చేయదు. స్టాక్ రెండు కార్డులను సరఫరా చేయలేకపోతే, రౌండ్ స్కోర్ చేయబడుతుంది.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"ఆడటానికి ఉచితం. మీ చేతి మరియు స్కోర్ ఈ పరికరంలో ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ఉంటాయి; గేమ్ డేటా అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు.","Play Canasta":"కెనాస్టా ప్లే చేయండి","Related tools":"సంబంధిత సాధనాలు","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ఉచితం · మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో నడుస్తుంది","Language":"భాష","UsefulVerse":"ఉపయోగకరమైన పద్యం","All tools":"అన్ని సాధనాలు","New round":"కొత్త రౌండ్","Play next round":"తదుపరి రౌండ్ ఆడండి","Resume saved round":"సేవ్ చేసిన రౌండ్‌ను పునఃప్రారంభించండి","Delete saved round":"సేవ్ చేసిన రౌండ్‌ను తొలగించండి","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"ఒక రౌండ్‌ను ప్రారంభించండి లేదా సేవ్ చేసిన దాన్ని పునఃప్రారంభించండి.","You":"మీరు","Computer":"కంప్యూటర్","Your hand":"మీ చేతి","Computer cards":"కంప్యూటర్ కార్డ్‌లు","Stock":"స్టాక్","Discard pile":"పైల్‌ని విస్మరించండి","Your melds":"మీ మెల్డ్స్","Draw two cards":"రెండు కార్డులను గీయండి","Take discard pile":"విస్మరించిన పైల్ తీసుకోండి","Discard selected card":"ఎంచుకున్న కార్డ్‌ని విస్మరించండి","Selected cards":"ఎంచుకున్న కార్డ్‌లు","Clear selection":"ఎంపికను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Meld rank":"మెల్డ్ ర్యాంక్","Lay down meld":"లే డౌన్ మెల్డ్","Total score":"మొత్తం స్కోర్","Round points":"రౌండ్ పాయింట్లు","Opening meld needs":"మెల్డ్ అవసరాలను తెరవడం","Turn":"మలుపు","Choose New round to begin.":"ప్రారంభించడానికి కొత్త రౌండ్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"రౌండ్ ప్రారంభమైంది. రెండు కార్డులు గీయండి.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"మీ వంతు: స్టాక్ నుండి రెండు కార్డ్‌లను గీయండి లేదా డిస్కార్డ్ పైల్‌ని తీసుకోండి.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"మీకు కావాలంటే చట్టపరమైన మెల్డ్‌లను వేయండి, ఆపై ఒక కార్డ్‌ని విస్మరించండి.","Computer is taking its turn…":"కంప్యూటర్ దాని మలుపు తీసుకుంటోంది…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"రెండు కార్డ్‌లు డ్రా చేయబడ్డాయి. కలపండి లేదా విస్మరించండి.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"తీసిన పైల్‌ని విస్మరించండి. కలపండి లేదా విస్మరించండి.","Meld placed.":"మెల్డ్ ఉంచబడింది.","Card discarded.":"కార్డ్ విస్మరించబడింది.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"ఆ చర్య చట్టపరమైనది కాదు. నియమాలు మరియు ఎంచుకున్న కార్డులను తనిఖీ చేయండి.","You went out and won the round.":"మీరు బయటకు వెళ్లి రౌండ్‌లో గెలిచారు.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"కంప్యూటర్ బయటకు వెళ్లింది. రౌండ్ చేశాడు.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"స్టాక్ రెండు కార్డ్‌లను సరఫరా చేయలేదు. రౌండ్ చేశాడు.","You reached the target and won the game!":"మీరు లక్ష్యాన్ని చేరుకున్నారు మరియు గేమ్‌లో గెలిచారు!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"కంప్యూటర్ లక్ష్యాన్ని చేరుకుంది మరియు గేమ్‌ను గెలుచుకుంది.","The match is tied.":"మ్యాచ్ టై అయింది.","Clean canasta":"క్లీన్ కెనాస్టా","Mixed canasta":"మిశ్రమ కెనాస్టా","You need a canasta before going out.":"బయటకు వెళ్లే ముందు మీకు కానస్టా అవసరం.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో స్థానిక సేవింగ్ అందుబాటులో లేదు. ఈ పేజీ తెరిచి ఉన్నప్పుడు మీరు ప్లే చేయడం కొనసాగించవచ్చు.","Round saved on this device.":"ఈ పరికరంలో రౌండ్ సేవ్ చేయబడింది.","Saved round resumed.":"సేవ్ చేసిన రౌండ్ మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించబడింది.","Saved round deleted.":"సేవ్ చేసిన రౌండ్ తొలగించబడింది.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"సేవ్ చేసిన రౌండ్ చదవడం సాధ్యం కాలేదు. కొత్త రౌండ్‌ను ప్రారంభించండి లేదా దెబ్బతిన్న సేవ్‌ను తొలగించండి.","Card":"కార్డ్","Wild":"వైల్డ్","Frozen":"ఘనీభవించిన","Open":"తెరువు","points":"పాయింట్లు","Twos":"రెండు","Threes":"మూడు","Fours":"ఫోర్స్","Fives":"ఫైవ్స్","Sixes":"సిక్స్‌లు","Sevens":"సెవెన్స్","Eights":"ఎయిట్స్","Nines":"నైన్స్","Tens":"పదుల","Jacks":"జాక్స్","Queens":"క్వీన్స్","Kings":"కింగ్స్","Aces":"ఏసెస్","Hearts":"హార్ట్స్","Diamonds":"డైమండ్స్","Clubs":"క్లబ్‌లు","Spades":"స్పేడ్స్","Joker":"జోకర్","Rules overview":"నియమాల అవలోకనం","Canasta rules":"కెనస్టా నియమాలు"},"th":{"Canasta":"คานาสตา","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — เกมไพ่ Canasta ฟรีเทียบกับคอมพิวเตอร์","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"เล่น Canasta แบบผู้เล่นสองคนออนไลน์กับคอมพิวเตอร์ในระบบ วาด ผสม แช่แข็ง และนำกองทิ้ง สร้างคานาสตาที่สะอาดหรือผสม และติดตามคะแนนรอบ ฟรี; การ์ดของคุณยังคงอยู่ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"เล่น Canasta แบบผู้เล่นสองคนในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ สร้างการรวมอันดับที่ตรงกัน ใช้ไพ่สองใบและโจ๊กเกอร์เป็นไพ่เสริม และทำไพ่เจ็ดใบก่อนออกไปข้างนอก","A quick example":"ตัวอย่างสั้นๆ","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"สามราชาแห่งธรรมชาติสามารถเปิดการรวมตัวได้ เพิ่มการ์ดที่มีอันดับนั้นในเทิร์นต่อมา ไพ่ธรรมชาติเจ็ดใบสร้างคานาสต้าที่สะอาดซึ่งคุ้มค่ากับโบนัสคะแนน 500 ในขณะที่ไพ่ผสมที่มีไวด์การ์ดเป็นคานาสต้าแบบผสมที่มีค่าคะแนนโบนัส 300","How to play":"วิธีการเล่น","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"เวอร์ชันนี้ใช้สำรับมาตรฐานสองสำรับและโจ๊กเกอร์สี่ใบ (การ์ด 108) การ์ด 15 ต่อผู้เล่นหนึ่งคน และไพ่สองใบที่จั่วมาจากสต็อกในแต่ละเทิร์น รวมไพ่อย่างน้อยสามใบในหนึ่งระดับ twos และ jokers เป็นแบบ wild โดยไม่มีไพ่แบบ wild มากไปกว่าไพ่ธรรมดา การรวมครั้งแรกจะต้องเป็นไปตามเกณฑ์คะแนนสำหรับคะแนนปัจจุบันของคุณ กองทิ้งสามารถรับได้เฉพาะกับไพ่ธรรมชาติสองใบที่ตรงกับไพ่บนสุดเท่านั้น ไวด์การ์ดหรือแบล็คทรีหยุดกอง คุณต้องมีไพ่เจ็ดใบอย่างน้อยหนึ่งใบจึงจะออกไปได้","Frequently asked questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","What is a canasta?":"คานาสต้าคืออะไร?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"คานาสต้าคือการรวมไพ่เจ็ดใบขึ้นไปที่มีอันดับเดียวกัน ไพ่ธรรมชาติเจ็ดใบสร้างคานาสต้าที่สะอาด (คะแนนโบนัส 500); การผสมผสานที่มีไวด์การ์ดผสมกัน (คะแนนโบนัส 300)","How do I take the discard pile?":"จะแยกกองทิ้งได้อย่างไร?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"ถือไพ่ธรรมชาติสองใบที่ตรงกับไพ่ใบบนสุด กองจะถูกแช่แข็งเมื่อไพ่บนสุดเป็นไพ่เสริมหรือสามสีดำ คุณต้องสามารถรวมไพ่ตามกฎหมายกับไพ่ใบบนสุดภายใต้ข้อกำหนดการเปิดของคุณ","When can I go out?":"จะออกไปข้างนอกได้เมื่อไหร่?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"คุณสามารถทำให้มือว่างได้หลังจากที่ฝั่งของคุณมีไพ่คานาสตาเจ็ดใบแล้วเท่านั้น ไพ่ใบสุดท้ายถูกทิ้ง; เวอร์ชันนี้ไม่ได้ใช้รูปแบบการปกปิดด้วยมือหรือการอนุญาตจากพันธมิตร","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Open Meld คำนวณอย่างไร","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"ค่าต่ำสุดคือ 50 จุดต่ำกว่าคะแนนสะสม 1,500, 90 จาก 1,500, 120 จาก 3,000 และ 150 จาก 5,000 จุดหลอมรวมที่มีอยู่จะไม่นับรวมกับการเปิดใหม่","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"เกมของฉันถูกอัพโหลดหรือบันทึกหรือไม่?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"ไม่มีการอัพโหลดเกม การบันทึกเป็นทางเลือกและใช้ที่เก็บข้อมูลในเครื่องในเบราว์เซอร์นี้บนอุปกรณ์นี้","Rules and limitations":"กฎและข้อจำกัด","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"นี่คือรูปแบบการเล่นแบบเล่นสองคนแบบไม่เป็นทางการกับคู่ต่อสู้ที่ใช้คอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่ธรรมดา ไม่ใช่ผู้เล่นหลายคนแบบออนไลน์หรือการพนัน ใช้เป้าหมายจุด 5,000 ทั่วไป, การแจกไพ่ 15, การจั่วไพ่สองใบ และเกณฑ์การเปิดตามคะแนน กฎของตารางแตกต่างออกไป: เวอร์ชันนี้ไม่มีการอนุญาตให้หุ้นส่วนออกไปข้างนอก โบนัสมือพิเศษที่ซ่อนอยู่ ตัวเลือกการแทนที่สามสีแดง หรือกฎบ้านที่กำหนดเอง ถ้าหุ้นไม่สามารถจ่ายไพ่ได้สองใบ รอบนั้นจะถูกนับ","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"เล่นฟรี มือและคะแนนของคุณอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้บนอุปกรณ์นี้ ไม่มีการอัพโหลดข้อมูลเกม","Play Canasta":"เล่น Canasta","Related tools":"เครื่องมือที่เกี่ยวข้อง","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ฟรี · รันในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Language":"ภาษา","UsefulVerse":"UsefulVerse","All tools":"เครื่องมือทั้งหมด","New round":"รอบใหม่","Play next round":"เล่นรอบต่อไป","Resume saved round":"บันทึกรอบต่อ","Delete saved round":"ลบรอบที่บันทึกไว้","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"เริ่มรอบหรือเล่นรอบที่บันทึกไว้ต่อ","You":"คุณ","Computer":"คอมพิวเตอร์","Your hand":"มือของคุณ","Computer cards":"การ์ดคอมพิวเตอร์","Stock":"สต๊อก","Discard pile":"ทิ้งกอง","Your melds":"การรวมตัวของคุณ","Draw two cards":"จั่วไพ่สองใบ","Take discard pile":"นำกองทิ้ง","Discard selected card":"ทิ้งการ์ดที่เลือก","Selected cards":"การ์ดที่เลือก","Clear selection":"ล้างการเลือก","Meld rank":"อันดับผสม","Lay down meld":"นอนรวมๆ","Total score":"คะแนนรวม","Round points":"จุดกลม","Opening meld needs":"เปิดความต้องการแบบผสมผสาน","Turn":"เทิร์น","Choose New round to begin.":"เลือกรอบใหม่เพื่อเริ่มต้น","Round started. Draw two cards.":"เริ่มรอบแล้ว จั่วไพ่สองใบ","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"ตาของคุณ: จั่วไพ่สองใบจากสต็อกหรือนำกองทิ้ง","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"วางการรวมกฎหมายหากต้องการ จากนั้นทิ้งการ์ดหนึ่งใบ","Computer is taking its turn…":"คอมพิวเตอร์กำลังถึงคราว...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"จั่วไพ่สองใบ ผสมหรือทิ้ง","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"ทิ้งกองที่ถ่ายไว้ ผสมหรือทิ้ง","Meld placed.":"วางแบบผสมแล้ว","Card discarded.":"การ์ดถูกทิ้ง","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"การกระทำนั้นไม่ถูกกฎหมาย ตรวจสอบกฎและไพ่ที่เลือก","You went out and won the round.":"คุณออกไปและชนะรอบนี้","The computer went out. Round scored.":"คอมพิวเตอร์ดับ คะแนนรอบ","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"สต็อกไม่สามารถจัดหาการ์ดสองใบได้ คะแนนรอบ","You reached the target and won the game!":"คุณบรรลุเป้าหมายและชนะเกมแล้ว!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"คอมพิวเตอร์บรรลุเป้าหมายและชนะเกม","The match is tied.":"เสมอกัน","Clean canasta":"ทำความสะอาดคานาสต้า","Mixed canasta":"คานาสต้าผสม","You need a canasta before going out.":"คุณต้องมีคานาสต้าก่อนออกไปข้างนอก","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"การบันทึกในเครื่องไม่พร้อมใช้งานในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ คุณสามารถเล่นต่อได้ในขณะที่หน้านี้ยังเปิดอยู่","Round saved on this device.":"บันทึกรอบบนอุปกรณ์นี้แล้ว","Saved round resumed.":"รอบที่บันทึกไว้กลับมาทำงานต่อ","Saved round deleted.":"ลบรอบที่บันทึกไว้แล้ว","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"ไม่สามารถอ่านรอบที่บันทึกไว้ได้ เริ่มรอบใหม่หรือลบการบันทึกที่เสียหาย","Card":"การ์ด","Wild":"ป่า","Frozen":"แช่แข็ง","Open":"เปิด","points":"คะแนน","Twos":"สอง","Threes":"สาม","Fours":"โฟร์ส","Fives":"ห้า","Sixes":"ซิกส์","Sevens":"เซเวนส์","Eights":"แปด","Nines":"เก้า","Tens":"สิบ","Jacks":"แจ็ค","Queens":"ควีนส์","Kings":"คิงส์","Aces":"เอซ","Hearts":"หัวใจ","Diamonds":"เพชร","Clubs":"ไม้กอล์ฟ","Spades":"โพดำ","Joker":"โจ๊กเกอร์","Rules overview":"ภาพรวมกฎ","Canasta rules":"กฎ Canasta"},"tl":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Libreng Canasta Card Game vs Computer","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Maglaro ng dalawang manlalarong Canasta online laban sa isang lokal na computer. Gumuhit, ihalo, i-freeze at kunin ang discard pile, bumuo ng malinis o halo-halong canastas at subaybayan ang round score. Libre; mananatili ang iyong mga card sa device na ito.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Maglaro ng kumpletong two-player na Canasta round sa iyong browser. Bumuo ng melds ng magkatugmang mga ranggo, gumamit ng dalawa at joker bilang wild card, at gumawa ng canasta ng pitong card bago lumabas.","A quick example":"Isang mabilis na halimbawa","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Maaaring magbukas ang tatlong natural na Hari ng isang meld. Magdagdag ng mga card ng ganoong ranggo sa mga susunod na pagliko; pitong natural na card ang gumagawa ng malinis na canasta na nagkakahalaga ng 500-point bonus, habang ang meld na may wild card ay isang mixed canasta na nagkakahalaga ng 300 na mga bonus na puntos.","How to play":"Paano laruin","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Gumagamit ang bersyong ito ng dalawang karaniwang deck at apat na joker (108 card), 15 card bawat manlalaro at dalawang card na kinukuha mula sa stock bawat pagliko. Maghalo ng hindi bababa sa tatlong card ng isang ranggo; Ang dalawa at mga joker ay ligaw, na walang mas wild kaysa sa mga natural na card. Dapat matugunan ng unang paghahalo ang limitasyon ng punto para sa iyong kasalukuyang marka. Ang isang discard pile ay maaari lamang kunin gamit ang dalawang natural na card na tumutugma sa nangungunang card nito. Ang isang wild card o black three ay nag-freeze sa pile. Kailangan mo ng kahit isang seven-card canasta para lumabas.","Frequently asked questions":"Mga madalas itanong","What is a canasta?":"Ano ang canasta?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Ang canasta ay isang kumbinasyon ng pito o higit pang mga card na may parehong ranggo. Ang pitong natural na card ay gumagawa ng malinis na canasta (500 na mga puntos ng bonus); pinaghalo ang isang meld na naglalaman ng wild card (300 na mga puntos ng bonus).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Paano ko kukunin ang discard pile?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Hawakan ang dalawang natural na card na tumutugma sa itaas na itapon. Ang pile ay nagyelo kapag ang nangungunang card nito ay wild card o black three. Dapat ka ring gumawa ng legal na paghahalo sa tuktok na card sa ilalim ng iyong kinakailangan sa pagbubukas.","When can I go out?":"Kailan ako maaaring lumabas?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Maaari mo lamang alisin ang iyong kamay pagkatapos magkaroon ng pitong card na canasta ang iyong tagiliran. Ang huling card ay itatapon; ang bersyon na ito ay hindi gumagamit ng mga pagkakaiba-iba ng lihim na kamay o pahintulot ng kasosyo.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Paano kinakalkula ang opening meld?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Ang minimum ay 50 na puntos sa ibaba ng 1,500 na pinagsama-samang puntos, 90 mula sa 1,500, 120 mula sa 3,000 at 150 mula sa 5,000. Ang mga kasalukuyang meld point ay hindi binibilang sa isang bagong pagbubukas.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Na-upload o nai-save ba ang aking laro?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Walang na-upload na laro. Opsyonal ang pag-save at gumagamit ng lokal na storage sa browser na ito sa device na ito.","Rules and limitations":"Mga tuntunin at limitasyon","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Isa itong kaswal na two-player na variant laban sa isang simpleng lokal na kalaban sa computer, hindi online multiplayer o pagsusugal. Ginagamit nito ang karaniwang 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw at score-based na opening threshold. Naiiba ang mga panuntunan sa talahanayan: ang bersyong ito ay hindi nagpapatupad ng pahintulot sa pakikipagsosyo na lumabas, mga espesyal na nakatagong kamay na mga bonus, pula-tatlong mga pagpipilian sa pagpapalit, o mga custom na panuntunan sa bahay. Kung ang stock ay hindi makapagbigay ng dalawang card, ang pag-ikot ay nai-score.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Libreng maglaro. Ang iyong kamay at puntos ay mananatili sa browser na ito sa device na ito; walang na-upload na data ng laro.","Play Canasta":"Maglaro ng Canasta","Related tools":"Mga kaugnay na tool","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"LIBRE · TATAKBO SA IYONG BROWSER","Language":"Wika","UsefulVerse":"Kapaki-pakinabang na Verse","All tools":"Lahat ng tool","New round":"Bagong round","Play next round":"Laro sa susunod na round","Resume saved round":"Ipagpatuloy ang naka-save na round","Delete saved round":"Tanggalin ang naka-save na round","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Magsimula ng round o ipagpatuloy ang na-save na.","You":"Ikaw","Computer":"Computer","Your hand":"Ang iyong kamay","Computer cards":"Mga computer card","Stock":"Stock","Discard pile":"Itapon ang tumpok","Your melds":"Ang iyong mga melds","Draw two cards":"Gumuhit ng dalawang card","Take discard pile":"Kunin ang discard pile","Discard selected card":"Itapon ang napiling card","Selected cards":"Mga napiling card","Clear selection":"I-clear ang pagpili","Meld rank":"Meld na ranggo","Lay down meld":"Lay down meld","Total score":"Kabuuang marka","Round points":"Mga round point","Opening meld needs":"Mga pangangailangan sa pagbubukas ng meld","Turn":"Liko","Choose New round to begin.":"Pumili ng Bagong round para magsimula.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Nagsimula ang round. Gumuhit ng dalawang card.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Your turn: gumuhit ng dalawang card mula sa stock o kunin ang discard pile.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Lay down legal melds kung gusto mo, pagkatapos ay itapon ang isang card.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Kumukuha na ang computer...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Dalawang card ang iginuhit. Gumawa ng melds o itapon.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Itapon ang pile na kinuha. Gumawa ng melds o itapon.","Meld placed.":"Meld na inilagay.","Card discarded.":"Itinapon ang card.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Hindi legal ang pagkilos na iyon. Suriin ang mga panuntunan at mga napiling card.","You went out and won the round.":"Lumabas ka at nanalo sa round.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Namatay ang computer. Round scored.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Hindi makakapagbigay ng dalawang card ang stock. Round scored.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Naabot mo ang target at nanalo sa laro!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Naabot ng computer ang target at nanalo sa laro.","The match is tied.":"Tabla ang laban.","Clean canasta":"Malinis na canasta","Mixed canasta":"Halong canasta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Kailangan mo ng canasta bago lumabas.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Hindi available ang lokal na pag-save sa browser na ito. Maaari kang magpatuloy sa paglalaro habang nananatiling bukas ang page na ito.","Round saved on this device.":"Na-save ang bilog sa device na ito.","Saved round resumed.":"Ipinagpatuloy ang naka-save na round.","Saved round deleted.":"Na-delete na ang naka-save na round.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Hindi mabasa ang naka-save na round. Magsimula ng bagong round o tanggalin ang nasirang save.","Card":"Card","Wild":"Maligaw","Frozen":"Na-freeze","Open":"Buksan","points":"puntos","Twos":"Dalawa","Threes":"Tatlo","Fours":"Apat","Fives":"Lima","Sixes":"Anim","Sevens":"Pito","Eights":"Eights","Nines":"Nines","Tens":"Sampu","Jacks":"Mga Jack","Queens":"Mga Reyna","Kings":"Mga Hari","Aces":"Aces","Hearts":"Mga Puso","Diamonds":"Mga Brilyante","Clubs":"Mga Club","Spades":"Mga Spade","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Pangkalahatang-ideya ng mga panuntunan","Canasta rules":"Mga panuntunan sa Canada"},"tr":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Bilgisayara Karşı Ücretsiz Canasta Kart Oyunu","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Yerel bir bilgisayara karşı iki oyunculu Canasta'yı çevrimiçi oynayın. Atılan yığını çizin, eritin, dondurun ve alın, temiz veya karışık kanastalar oluşturun ve tur puanını takip edin. Özgür; kartlarınız bu cihazda kalır.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Tarayıcınızda iki oyunculu Canasta turunun tamamını oynayın. Eşleşen sıralardan oluşan perler oluşturun, ikilileri ve jokerleri joker kart olarak kullanın ve dışarı çıkmadan önce yedi karttan oluşan bir kanasta yapın.","A quick example":"Hızlı bir örnek","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Üç doğal Kral bir açmayı açabilir. Daha sonraki turlarda bu değerdeki kartları ekleyin; yedi doğal kart, 500 puanlık bonus değerinde temiz bir kanasta oluştururken joker kartlı bir açma, 300 bonus puanı değerinde karışık bir kanastadır.","How to play":"Nasıl oynanır","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Bu sürümde iki standart deste artı dört joker (108 kartlar), oyuncu başına 15 kartlar ve her turda stoktan çekilen iki kart kullanılır. Aynı seviyedeki en az üç kartı birleştirin; ikililer ve jokerler vahşidir ve doğal kartlardan daha fazla vahşi değildir. İlk açma, mevcut puanınızın puan eşiğini karşılamalıdır. Atılan bir deste yalnızca üst kartıyla eşleşen iki doğal kartla alınabilir. Bir joker kart veya siyah üçlü yığını dondurur. Dışarı çıkmak için en az bir yedi kartlı kanastaya ihtiyacınız var.","Frequently asked questions":"Sıkça sorulan sorular","What is a canasta?":"Canasta nedir?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Canasta aynı değerde yedi veya daha fazla kartın birleşimidir. Yedi doğal kart temiz bir kanasta yapar (500 bonus puanı); joker kart içeren bir açma karıştırılır (300 bonus puanı).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Atılan yığını nasıl alabilirim?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Üstteki atılan kartla eşleşen iki doğal kartı tutun. Üstteki kart joker veya siyah üçlü olduğunda deste donar. Ayrıca açılış şartınıza göre en üstteki kartla yasal bir açma işlemi yapabilmeniz gerekir.","When can I go out?":"Ne zaman dışarı çıkabilirim?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Elinizi ancak tarafınızda yedi kartlı kanasta olduktan sonra boşaltabilirsiniz. Son kart atılır; bu sürüm gizli el veya ortak izni varyasyonlarını kullanmaz.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Açılış açması nasıl hesaplanır?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Minimum, 1,500 kümülatif puanın altında 50 puan, 1,500'ten 90, 3,000'ten 120 ve 5,000'ten 150'tir. Mevcut birleşme noktaları yeni bir açılış için sayılmaz.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Oyunum yüklendi mi yoksa kaydedildi mi?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Hiçbir oyun yüklenmedi. Kaydetme isteğe bağlıdır ve bu cihazdaki bu tarayıcıdaki yerel depolamayı kullanır.","Rules and limitations":"Kurallar ve sınırlamalar","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Bu, çevrimiçi çok oyunculu oyun veya kumar oyunu değil, basit bir yerel bilgisayar rakibine karşı oynanan sıradan iki oyunculu bir oyundur. Ortak 5,000 puan hedefi, 15 kart dağıtma, iki kart çekme ve puana dayalı açılış eşiklerini kullanır. Tablo kuralları farklıdır: Bu sürüm ortaklıktan çıkma iznini, özel gizli el ikramiyelerini, kırmızı üç değiştirme seçeneğini veya özel ev kurallarını uygulamaz. Eğer deste iki kart sağlayamıyorsa tur puanlanır.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Oynaması ücretsiz. Eliniz ve puanınız bu cihazdaki bu tarayıcıda kalır; hiçbir oyun verisi yüklenmedi.","Play Canasta":"Canasta'yı Oynat","Related tools":"İlgili araçlar","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ÜCRETSİZ · TARAYICINIZDA ÇALIŞIR","Language":"Dil","UsefulVerse":"Kullanışlı Ayet","All tools":"Tüm araçlar","New round":"Yeni tur","Play next round":"Sonraki turda oyna","Resume saved round":"Kaydedilen turu devam ettir","Delete saved round":"Kaydedilen turu sil","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Bir tur başlatın veya kayıtlı bir turu sürdürün.","You":"Siz","Computer":"Bilgisayar","Your hand":"Eliniz","Computer cards":"Bilgisayar kartları","Stock":"Stok","Discard pile":"Yığınları atın","Your melds":"Melleriniz","Draw two cards":"İki kart çizin","Take discard pile":"Atık yığınını al","Discard selected card":"Seçili kartı atın","Selected cards":"Seçili kartlar","Clear selection":"Seçimi temizle","Meld rank":"Birleştirme sıralaması","Lay down meld":"Uzun birleştirme","Total score":"Toplam puan","Round points":"Yuvarlak noktalar","Opening meld needs":"Açılış birleştirme ihtiyaçları","Turn":"Dönüş","Choose New round to begin.":"Başlamak için Yeni tur'u seçin.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Tur başladı. İki kart çizin.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Sıranız: stoktan iki kart çekin veya atılan desteyi alın.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"İsterseniz yasal açmalar yapın, ardından bir kartı atın.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Bilgisayar sırasını alıyor…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"İki kart çekildi. Birleştirin veya atın.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Alınan yığını atın. Birleştirin veya atın.","Meld placed.":"Birleştirme yerleştirildi.","Card discarded.":"Kart atıldı.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Bu eylem yasal değil. Kuralları ve seçilen kartları kontrol edin.","You went out and won the round.":"Dışarı çıktınız ve raundu kazandınız.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Bilgisayar kapandı. Tur gol attı.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Stok iki kart sağlayamaz. Tur gol attı.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Hedefe ulaştınız ve oyunu kazandınız!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Bilgisayar hedefe ulaştı ve oyunu kazandı.","The match is tied.":"Maç berabere kaldı.","Clean canasta":"Temiz kanasta","Mixed canasta":"Karışık kanasta","You need a canasta before going out.":"Dışarı çıkmadan önce bir kanastaya ihtiyacınız var.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Yerel kaydetme bu tarayıcıda mevcut değil. Bu sayfa açık kaldığı sürece oynamaya devam edebilirsiniz.","Round saved on this device.":"Yuvarlak bu cihaza kaydedildi.","Saved round resumed.":"Kaydedilen tur devam ettirildi.","Saved round deleted.":"Kaydedilen tur silindi.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Kaydedilen tur okunamadı. Yeni bir tur başlatın veya hasarlı kaydı silin.","Card":"Kart","Wild":"Vahşi","Frozen":"Dondurulmuş","Open":"Açık","points":"puan","Twos":"İkili","Threes":"Üçler","Fours":"Dörtlü","Fives":"Beşli","Sixes":"Altılar","Sevens":"Yediler","Eights":"Sekizler","Nines":"Dokuzlu","Tens":"Onlarca","Jacks":"Jaklar","Queens":"Kraliçeler","Kings":"Krallar","Aces":"Aslar","Hearts":"Kalpler","Diamonds":"Elmaslar","Clubs":"Kulüpler","Spades":"Maça","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Kurallara genel bakış","Canasta rules":"Canasta kuralları"},"uk":{"Canasta":"Канаста","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — безкоштовна карткова гра Canasta проти комп’ютера","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Грайте в Canasta для двох гравців онлайн проти локального комп’ютера. Малюйте, об’єднуйте, заморожуйте та знімайте купу скидання, створюйте чисті або змішані канасти та відстежуйте раундовий рахунок. безкоштовно; ваші картки залишаються на цьому пристрої.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Зіграйте повний раунд Canasta для двох гравців у своєму браузері. Утворюйте об’єднання відповідних рангів, використовуйте двійки та джокери як дикі карти та складайте канасту із семи карт перед тим, як вийти.","A quick example":"Швидкий приклад","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Три природних короля можуть відкрити об’єднання. Додавайте карти такого рангу протягом наступних ходів; сім природних карт дають чисту канасту вартістю 500 бонусних очок, тоді як об’єднання з дикими картами є змішаною канастою вартістю 300 бонусних очок.","How to play":"Як грати","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"У цій версії використовуються дві стандартні колоди плюс чотири джокери (карти 108), карти 15 на гравця та дві карти, що беруться із запасу кожного ходу. Злийте принаймні три карти одного рангу; двійки та джокери є дикими, з не більше дикими, ніж природними картами. Перше об’єднання має відповідати порогу балів для вашого поточного результату. Стос скидання можна взяти лише з двох природних карт, які збігаються з його верхньою картою. Дика карта або чорна трійка заморожує стопку. Вам потрібна принаймні одна семикарткова канаста, щоб вийти.","Frequently asked questions":"Часті запитання","What is a canasta?":"Що таке канаста?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Канаста — це об’єднання семи або більше карт одного рангу. Сім природних карт складають чисту канасту (500 бонусних балів); об’єднання, що містить джокер, є змішаним (300 бонусних очок).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Як взяти купу скидання?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Тримайте дві натуральні карти, що відповідають верхньому скинутому. Стос заморожено, якщо його верхньою картою є джоклер або чорна трійка. Ви також повинні бути в змозі створити юридичне об’єднання з верхньою карткою відповідно до ваших початкових вимог.","When can I go out?":"Коли я можу вийти?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Ви можете спустошити руку лише після того, як ваша сторона має канасту із семи карт. Остання карта скидається; у цій версії не використовуються варіанти прихованої руки чи дозволу партнера.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Як розраховується початкове з’єднання?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Мінімум становить 50 балів нижче 1,500 сукупних балів, 90 від 1,500, 120 від 3,000 і 150 від 5,000. Існуючі точки злиття не зараховуються для нового відкриття.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Моя гра завантажена чи збережена?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Жодна гра не завантажена. Зберігання є необов’язковим і використовує локальну пам’ять у цьому браузері на цьому пристрої.","Rules and limitations":"Правила та обмеження","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Це звичайний варіант для двох гравців проти простого суперника на локальному комп’ютері, а не онлайн-гра для кількох гравців чи азартні ігри. Він використовує загальну цільову суму очок 5,000, роздачу карток 15, розіграш двох карт і початкові пороги на основі результатів. Правила столу відрізняються: у цій версії не передбачено дозвіл партнера на вихід, спеціальні бонуси за приховану руку, варіанти заміни червоного на три чи власні правила будинку. Якщо запас не може забезпечити дві карти, раунд зараховується.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Безкоштовна гра. Ваша рука та рахунок залишаються в цьому браузері на цьому пристрої; дані гри не завантажуються.","Play Canasta":"Грати в Канасту","Related tools":"Пов’язані інструменти","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗКОШТОВНО · ЗАПУСКАЄТЬСЯ У ВАШОМУ БРАУЗЕРІ","Language":"Мова","UsefulVerse":"Корисний вірш","All tools":"Всі інструменти","New round":"Новий тур","Play next round":"Зіграти в наступному раунді","Resume saved round":"Відновити збережений раунд","Delete saved round":"Видалити збережений раунд","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Почати раунд або відновити збережений.","You":"Ви","Computer":"Комп'ютер","Your hand":"Твоя рука","Computer cards":"Комп'ютерні карти","Stock":"Запас","Discard pile":"Відкинути купу","Your melds":"Ваші об'єднання","Draw two cards":"Візьміть дві карти","Take discard pile":"Візьміть купу скидання","Discard selected card":"Відкинути вибрану картку","Selected cards":"Вибрані картки","Clear selection":"Очистити вибір","Meld rank":"Мед ранг","Lay down meld":"Лягти мелд","Total score":"Загальний бал","Round points":"Окуляри круглі","Opening meld needs":"Потреби відкриття об’єднання","Turn":"Поворот","Choose New round to begin.":"Оберіть Новий раунд, щоб почати.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Раунд розпочато. Витягніть дві карти.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Ваша черга: візьміть дві карти з запасу або візьміть стопку скидання.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"За бажанням створіть легальні об’єднання, а потім скиньте одну картку.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Комп’ютер набирає черги…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Витягнуто дві карти. Зробіть об’єднання або викиньте.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Знято купу скидання. Зробіть об’єднання або викиньте.","Meld placed.":"Мед розміщено.","Card discarded.":"Картку вилучено.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Ця дія не є законною. Перевірте правила та вибрані картки.","You went out and won the round.":"Ви вийшли і виграли раунд.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Комп'ютер вийшов з ладу. Раунд забив.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Запас не може забезпечити дві карти. Раунд забив.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Ви досягли мети та виграли гру!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Комп’ютер досяг мети та виграв гру.","The match is tied.":"Матч нічийний.","Clean canasta":"Чиста канаста","Mixed canasta":"Змішана канаста","You need a canasta before going out.":"Перед виходом вам потрібна канаста.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Локальне збереження недоступне в цьому браузері. Ви можете продовжувати грати, поки ця сторінка залишається відкритою.","Round saved on this device.":"Раунд збережено на цьому пристрої.","Saved round resumed.":"Збережений раунд відновлено.","Saved round deleted.":"Збережений раунд видалено.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Не вдалося прочитати збережений раунд. Почніть новий раунд або видаліть пошкоджене збереження.","Card":"Картка","Wild":"Дикий","Frozen":"Заморожений","Open":"Відкритий","points":"бал","Twos":"Двійки","Threes":"Трійки","Fours":"Четвірки","Fives":"П'ятірки","Sixes":"Шістки","Sevens":"Сімки","Eights":"Вісімки","Nines":"Дев'ятки","Tens":"Десятки","Jacks":"Джек","Queens":"Королеви","Kings":"Королі","Aces":"Тузи","Hearts":"Серця","Diamonds":"Діаманти","Clubs":"Булави","Spades":"Піки","Joker":"Джокер","Rules overview":"Огляд правил","Canasta rules":"Правила Канасти"},"ur":{"Canasta":"کناستا","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"کیناسٹا آن لائن — مفت کیناسٹا کارڈ گیم بمقابلہ کمپیوٹر","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"مقامی کمپیوٹر کے خلاف دو پلیئر کناسٹا آن لائن کھیلیں۔ ڈرا، ملڈ، فریز اور ڈسکارڈ پائل لیں، صاف یا مخلوط کینسٹاس بنائیں اور راؤنڈ اسکور کو ٹریک کریں۔ مفت؛ آپ کے کارڈ اس ڈیوائس پر رہتے ہیں۔","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"اپنے براؤزر میں مکمل دو پلیئر کناسٹا راؤنڈ کھیلیں۔ مماثل صفوں کے میلڈز بنائیں، دو اور جوکر کو وائلڈ کارڈ کے طور پر استعمال کریں، اور باہر جانے سے پہلے سات کارڈوں کا ایک کناسٹا بنائیں۔","A quick example":"ایک تیز مثال","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"تین قدرتی بادشاہ ایک میلڈ کھول سکتے ہیں۔ بعد کے موڑ پر اس رینک کے کارڈز شامل کریں۔ سات قدرتی کارڈز 500 پوائنٹ بونس کے قابل ایک صاف کناسٹا بناتے ہیں، جب کہ وائلڈ کارڈز کے ساتھ مل کر 300 بونس پوائنٹس کا ملا ہوا کیناسٹا ہے۔","How to play":"کیسے کھیلنا ہے۔","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"اس ورژن میں دو معیاری ڈیکوں کے علاوہ چار جوکرز (108 کارڈز)، فی کھلاڑی 15 کارڈز اور ہر موڑ پر اسٹاک سے نکالے گئے دو کارڈز کا استعمال کیا گیا ہے۔ ایک رینک کے کم از کم تین کارڈ ملائیں؛ twos اور jokers جنگلی ہیں، قدرتی کارڈز سے زیادہ جنگلی نہیں ہیں۔ پہلے میلڈ کو آپ کے موجودہ سکور کے لیے پوائنٹ کی حد کو پورا کرنا چاہیے۔ ڈسکارڈ پائل صرف دو قدرتی کارڈوں کے ساتھ لیا جا سکتا ہے جو اس کے اوپر والے کارڈ سے مماثل ہوں۔ وائلڈ کارڈ یا بلیک تھری ڈھیر کو جما دیتا ہے۔ باہر جانے کے لیے آپ کو کم از کم ایک سات کارڈ کیناسٹا کی ضرورت ہے۔","Frequently asked questions":"اکثر پوچھے گئے سوالات","What is a canasta?":"کناسٹا کیا ہے؟","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"سات قدرتی کارڈز ایک صاف کناسٹا بناتے ہیں (500 بونس پوائنٹس)؛ وائلڈ کارڈ پر مشتمل ایک میل ملایا جاتا ہے (300 بونس پوائنٹس)۔","How do I take the discard pile?":"میں ڈسکارڈ پائل کو کیسے لوں؟","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"ڈھیر جم جاتا ہے جب اس کا ٹاپ کارڈ وائلڈ کارڈ یا بلیک تھری ہوتا ہے۔ آپ کو اپنی ابتدائی ضرورت کے تحت ٹاپ کارڈ کے ساتھ قانونی ملاوٹ کرنے کے قابل بھی ہونا چاہیے۔","When can I go out?":"میں کب باہر جا سکتا ہوں؟","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"آپ کے پاس سات کارڈ کا کینسٹا ہونے کے بعد ہی آپ اپنا ہاتھ خالی کر سکتے ہیں۔ حتمی کارڈ ضائع کر دیا گیا ہے۔ یہ ورژن چھپے ہاتھ یا پارٹنر کی اجازت کی مختلف حالتوں کا استعمال نہیں کرتا ہے۔","How is the opening meld calculated?":"اوپننگ میلڈ کا حساب کیسے لگایا جاتا ہے؟","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"کم از کم ہے50نیچے پوائنٹس1,500مجموعی پوائنٹس،90سے1,500،120سے3,000اور150سے5,000. موجودہ میلڈ پوائنٹس کو نئے آغاز میں شمار نہیں کیا جاتا ہے۔","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"کیا میرا گیم اپ لوڈ یا محفوظ ہے؟","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"کوئی گیم اپ لوڈ نہیں ہے۔ محفوظ کرنا اختیاری ہے اور اس ڈیوائس پر اس براؤزر میں مقامی اسٹوریج کا استعمال کرتا ہے۔","Rules and limitations":"قوانین اور حدود","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"یہ ایک سادہ مقامی کمپیوٹر مخالف کے خلاف دو کھلاڑیوں کا ایک آرام دہ ورژن ہے، آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر یا جوا نہیں۔ یہ عام 5,000-پوائنٹ ٹارگٹ، 15-کارڈ ڈیل، دو کارڈ ڈرا اور سکور پر مبنی افتتاحی حدوں کا استعمال کرتا ہے۔ ٹیبل کے قوانین مختلف ہیں: یہ ورژن باہر جانے کے لیے شراکت کی اجازت، خصوصی چھپے ہوئے بونس، ریڈ تھری متبادل انتخاب، یا حسب ضرورت ہاؤس رولز کو نافذ نہیں کرتا ہے۔ اگر اسٹاک دو کارڈ فراہم نہیں کرسکتا ہے، تو راؤنڈ اسکور کیا جاتا ہے۔","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"کھیلنے کے لیے مفت۔ آپ کا ہاتھ اور اسکور اس ڈیوائس پر اس براؤزر میں رہتا ہے۔ کوئی گیم ڈیٹا اپ لوڈ نہیں کیا گیا ہے۔","Play Canasta":"کیناسٹا کھیلیں","Related tools":"متعلقہ اوزار","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مفت · آپ کے براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔","Language":"زبان","UsefulVerse":"مفید آیت","All tools":"تمام ٹولز","New round":"نیا دور","Play next round":"اگلا راؤنڈ کھیلیں","Resume saved round":"محفوظ شدہ راؤنڈ دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Delete saved round":"محفوظ کردہ راؤنڈ کو حذف کریں۔","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"ایک راؤنڈ شروع کریں یا محفوظ کردہ کو دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","You":"آپ","Computer":"کمپیوٹر","Your hand":"آپ کا ہاتھ","Computer cards":"کمپیوٹر کارڈز","Stock":"اسٹاک","Discard pile":"پائل کو ضائع کریں۔","Your melds":"آپ کے میلڈز","Draw two cards":"دو کارڈز بنائیں","Take discard pile":"ڈاسکارڈ پائل لیں۔","Discard selected card":"منتخب کارڈ کو مسترد کریں۔","Selected cards":"منتخب کارڈز","Clear selection":"کلیئر سلیکشن","Meld rank":"میلڈ رینک","Lay down meld":"لیٹ ڈاون میلڈ","Total score":"کل سکور","Round points":"گول پوائنٹس","Opening meld needs":"افتتاحی میلڈ ضروریات","Turn":"موڑ","Choose New round to begin.":"شروع کرنے کے لیے نیا دور منتخب کریں۔","Round started. Draw two cards.":"راؤنڈ شروع ہوا۔ دو کارڈ بنائیں۔","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"آپ کی باری: اسٹاک سے دو کارڈ کھینچیں یا ڈسکارڈ پائل لیں۔","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"اگر آپ چاہیں تو قانونی میلڈ لگائیں، پھر ایک کارڈ کو ضائع کر دیں۔","Computer is taking its turn…":"کمپیوٹر اپنی باری لے رہا ہے…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"دو کارڈز بنائے گئے۔ میلڈز بنائیں یا ضائع کریں۔","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"لی گئی ڈھیر کو ضائع کریں۔ میلڈز بنائیں یا ضائع کریں۔","Meld placed.":"Meld رکھا گیا۔","Card discarded.":"کارڈ ضائع کر دیا گیا۔","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"وہ کارروائی قانونی نہیں ہے۔ قواعد اور منتخب کارڈ چیک کریں۔","You went out and won the round.":"آپ باہر گئے اور راؤنڈ جیت لیا۔","The computer went out. Round scored.":"کمپیوٹر باہر چلا گیا۔ راؤنڈ سکور کیا۔","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"اسٹاک دو کارڈ فراہم نہیں کر سکتا۔ راؤنڈ سکور کیا۔","You reached the target and won the game!":"آپ ہدف تک پہنچ گئے اور گیم جیت گئے!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"کمپیوٹر ہدف تک پہنچ گیا اور گیم جیت گیا۔","The match is tied.":"میچ ٹائی ہوگیا۔","Clean canasta":"کلین کناسٹا","Mixed canasta":"مکسڈ کناسٹا","You need a canasta before going out.":"باہر جانے سے پہلے آپ کو کناسٹا کی ضرورت ہے۔","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"مقامی بچت اس براؤزر میں دستیاب نہیں ہے۔ یہ صفحہ کھلا رہنے تک آپ کھیل جاری رکھ سکتے ہیں۔","Round saved on this device.":"راؤنڈ اس ڈیوائس پر محفوظ ہو گیا۔","Saved round resumed.":"محفوظ شدہ راؤنڈ دوبارہ شروع ہوا۔","Saved round deleted.":"محفوظ شدہ راؤنڈ حذف کر دیا گیا۔","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"محفوظ شدہ راؤنڈ پڑھا نہیں جا سکا۔ ایک نیا دور شروع کریں یا تباہ شدہ بچت کو حذف کریں۔","Card":"کارڈ","Wild":"وائلڈ","Frozen":"منجمد","Open":"کھلا","points":"پوائنٹس","Twos":"Twos","Threes":"تین","Fours":"فورس","Fives":"پانچ","Sixes":"چھکے","Sevens":"سات","Eights":"Eights","Nines":"نائنز","Tens":"دسیوں","Jacks":"جیکس","Queens":"کوئینز","Kings":"کنگز","Aces":"Aces","Hearts":"دل","Diamonds":"ہیرے","Clubs":"کلب","Spades":"Spades","Joker":"جوکر","Rules overview":"قواعد کا جائزہ","Canasta rules":"Canasta کے قواعد"},"vi":{"Canasta":"Canasta","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — Trò chơi bài Canasta miễn phí với máy tính","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"Chơi Canasta hai người chơi trực tuyến với máy tính cục bộ. Vẽ, ghép, đóng băng và lấy đống bỏ đi, xây dựng các canastas sạch hoặc hỗn hợp và theo dõi điểm số của vòng đấu. Miễn phí; thẻ của bạn vẫn ở trên thiết bị này.","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"Chơi một vòng Canasta hoàn chỉnh dành cho hai người chơi trên trình duyệt của bạn. Tạo thành các cấp bậc phù hợp, sử dụng quân đôi và quân pha trò làm quân bài hoang dã và tạo một canasta gồm bảy quân bài trước khi ra ngoài.","A quick example":"Ví dụ nhanh","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"Ba vị vua tự nhiên có thể mở ra một trận đấu. Thêm các thẻ có thứ hạng đó vào các lượt sau; bảy lá bài tự nhiên tạo nên một canasta sạch trị giá 500 điểm thưởng, trong khi kết hợp với các lá bài hoang dã là một canasta hỗn hợp trị giá 300 điểm thưởng.","How to play":"Cách chơi","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"Phiên bản này sử dụng hai bộ bài tiêu chuẩn cộng với bốn lá bài pha trò (thẻ 108), thẻ 15 cho mỗi người chơi và hai lá bài được rút từ kho mỗi lượt. Kết hợp ít nhất ba thẻ cùng hạng; twos và jokers rất hoang dã, không có gì hoang dã hơn những lá bài tự nhiên. Kết hợp đầu tiên phải đáp ứng ngưỡng điểm cho số điểm hiện tại của bạn. Một đống bỏ đi chỉ có thể được lấy khi có hai lá bài tự nhiên khớp với lá bài trên cùng của nó. Một lá bài hoang dã hoặc ba màu đen sẽ đóng băng cọc. Bạn cần ít nhất một canasta bảy lá để đi chơi.","Frequently asked questions":"Câu hỏi thường gặp","What is a canasta?":"Canasta là gì?","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"Một canasta là sự kết hợp của bảy lá bài trở lên cùng hạng. Bảy lá bài tự nhiên tạo nên một canasta sạch sẽ (điểm thưởng 500); một hỗn hợp chứa một thẻ hoang dã được trộn lẫn (điểm thưởng 300).","How do I take the discard pile?":"Làm cách nào để lấy đống rác bỏ đi?","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"Giữ hai lá bài tự nhiên phù hợp với loại bỏ trên cùng. Cọc bị đóng băng khi quân bài trên cùng của nó là quân bài hoang dã hoặc ba quân đen. Bạn cũng phải có khả năng ghép hợp pháp với lá bài trên cùng theo yêu cầu mở đầu của bạn.","When can I go out?":"Khi nào tôi có thể ra ngoài?","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"Bạn chỉ có thể trắng tay sau khi bên bạn có canasta bảy lá. Lá bài cuối cùng bị loại bỏ; phiên bản này không sử dụng các biến thể được che giấu hoặc được đối tác cho phép.","How is the opening meld calculated?":"Mold mở được tính như thế nào?","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"Tối thiểu là 50 điểm dưới điểm tích lũy 1,500, 90 từ 1,500, 120 từ 3,000 và 150 từ 5,000. Điểm kết hợp hiện tại không được tính vào lần mở mới.","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"Trò chơi của tôi đã được tải lên hay lưu chưa?","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"Không có trò chơi nào được tải lên. Việc lưu là tùy chọn và sử dụng bộ nhớ cục bộ trong trình duyệt này trên thiết bị này.","Rules and limitations":"Quy tắc và giới hạn","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"Đây là biến thể hai người chơi thông thường chống lại một đối thủ máy tính cục bộ đơn giản, không phải nhiều người chơi trực tuyến hoặc cờ bạc. Nó sử dụng mục tiêu điểm 5,000 chung, chia bài 15, rút ​​hai lá bài và ngưỡng mở dựa trên điểm số. Các quy tắc của bảng khác nhau: phiên bản này không thực hiện quyền hợp tác để ra ngoài, phần thưởng ẩn đặc biệt, lựa chọn thay thế ba màu đỏ hoặc quy tắc nhà cái tùy chỉnh. Nếu kho không thể cung cấp hai lá bài, vòng chơi sẽ được tính điểm.","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"Chơi miễn phí. Bàn tay và điểm số của bạn vẫn ở trong trình duyệt này trên thiết bị này; không có dữ liệu trò chơi được tải lên.","Play Canasta":"Chơi Canasta","Related tools":"Các công cụ liên quan","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"MIỄN PHÍ · CHẠY TRÊN TRÌNH DUYỆT CỦA BẠN","Language":"Ngôn ngữ","UsefulVerse":"Verse hữu ích","All tools":"Tất cả công cụ","New round":"Vòng mới","Play next round":"Chơi vòng tiếp theo","Resume saved round":"Tiếp tục vòng đã lưu","Delete saved round":"Xóa vòng đã lưu","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"Bắt đầu một vòng hoặc tiếp tục vòng đã lưu.","You":"Bạn","Computer":"Máy tính","Your hand":"Bàn tay của bạn","Computer cards":"Thẻ máy tính","Stock":"Cổ phiếu","Discard pile":"Bỏ cọc","Your melds":"Kết hợp của bạn","Draw two cards":"Rút hai lá bài","Take discard pile":"Lấy đống đổ thải","Discard selected card":"Hủy thẻ đã chọn","Selected cards":"Thẻ được chọn","Clear selection":"Xóa lựa chọn","Meld rank":"Xếp hạng hỗn hợp","Lay down meld":"Đặt hỗn hợp xuống","Total score":"Tổng số điểm","Round points":"Điểm tròn","Opening meld needs":"Mở rộng nhu cầu kết hợp","Turn":"Quay","Choose New round to begin.":"Chọn vòng mới để bắt đầu.","Round started. Draw two cards.":"Vòng bắt đầu. Rút hai thẻ.","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"Lượt của bạn: rút hai lá bài từ kho hoặc lấy chồng bài bỏ.","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"Đặt các quân hợp pháp nếu bạn muốn, sau đó loại bỏ một thẻ.","Computer is taking its turn…":"Máy tính đang đến lượt…","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"Rút hai lá bài. Tạo hỗn hợp hoặc loại bỏ.","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"Hủy bỏ đống đã lấy. Tạo hỗn hợp hoặc loại bỏ.","Meld placed.":"Meld được đặt.","Card discarded.":"Thẻ bị loại bỏ.","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"Hành động đó là không hợp pháp. Kiểm tra các quy tắc và thẻ đã chọn.","You went out and won the round.":"Bạn đã ra quân và giành chiến thắng trong vòng đấu.","The computer went out. Round scored.":"Máy tính bị hỏng. Vòng đã ghi điểm.","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"Hàng không thể cung cấp hai thẻ. Vòng đã ghi điểm.","You reached the target and won the game!":"Bạn đã đạt được mục tiêu và giành chiến thắng trong trò chơi!","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"Máy tính đã đạt được mục tiêu và giành chiến thắng trong trò chơi.","The match is tied.":"Trận đấu hòa.","Clean canasta":"Canasta sạch","Mixed canasta":"Bánh canasta hỗn hợp","You need a canasta before going out.":"Bạn cần một canasta trước khi ra ngoài.","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"Tính năng lưu cục bộ không khả dụng trong trình duyệt này. Bạn có thể tiếp tục chơi trong khi trang này vẫn mở.","Round saved on this device.":"Vòng được lưu trên thiết bị này.","Saved round resumed.":"Vòng đã lưu được tiếp tục.","Saved round deleted.":"Đã xóa vòng đã lưu.","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"Không thể đọc được vòng đã lưu. Bắt đầu một vòng mới hoặc xóa bản lưu bị hỏng.","Card":"Thẻ","Wild":"Hoang dã","Frozen":"Đông lạnh","Open":"Mở","points":"điểm","Twos":"Đôi","Threes":"Ba","Fours":"Bốn","Fives":"Năm","Sixes":"Sáu","Sevens":"Bảy","Eights":"Tám","Nines":"Số Chín","Tens":"Hàng chục","Jacks":"Jack cắm","Queens":"Nữ hoàng","Kings":"Vua","Aces":"Át","Hearts":"Trái tim","Diamonds":"Kim cương","Clubs":"Câu lạc bộ","Spades":"Xích","Joker":"Joker","Rules overview":"Tổng quan về quy tắc","Canasta rules":"Quy tắc Canasta"},"zh":{"Canasta":"凯纳斯塔","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — 免费 Canasta 纸牌游戏 vs 电脑","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"在本地计算机上在线玩两人 Canasta 游戏。抽取、融合、冻结和拿走弃牌堆，构建干净或混合的卡纳斯塔并跟踪回合得分。自由的;您的卡保留在此设备上。","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"在浏览器中玩完整的两人 Canasta 回合。形成匹配等级的组合，使用二号牌和百搭牌作为百搭牌，并在出去之前制作一张由七张牌组成的凯纳斯塔。","A quick example":"一个简单示例","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"三个自然之王可以开启融合。在以后的回合中添加该等级的牌；七张自然卡使干净的卡纳斯塔价值 500 点奖励，而与外卡混合则获得价值 300 奖励点的混合卡纳斯塔。","How to play":"怎么玩","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"此版本使用两副标准牌，加上四张百搭牌（108 卡），每位玩家 15 卡，每回合从库存中抽取两张卡。融合至少三张同等级的牌；双牌和王牌都是百搭牌，没有比自然牌更百搭的牌。第一个组合必须满足您当前分数的分数阈值。弃牌堆只能由两张与其顶牌相匹配的自然牌取走。外卡或黑三将冻结牌堆。你至少需要一张七张卡纳斯塔才能出去。","Frequently asked questions":"常见问题解答","What is a canasta?":"什么是canasta？","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"canasta 是七张或更多相同等级的牌的组合。七张天然牌组成干净的凯纳斯塔（500 奖励积分）；包含通配符的组合被混合（300 奖励积分）。","How do I take the discard pile?":"如何拿走弃牌堆？","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"持有两张与顶部弃牌相匹配的自然牌。当顶牌是外卡或黑三时，该牌堆被冻结。您还必须能够根据您的开局要求与顶牌进行合法合并。","When can I go out?":"我什么时候可以出去？","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"只有在你方拥有七张卡纳斯塔后，你才可以清空你的手牌。最后一张牌被丢弃；此版本不使用隐藏手或合作伙伴许可的变体。","How is the opening meld calculated?":"开局组合是如何计算的？","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"最小值为50点低于1,500累积点，90来自1,500，120来自3,000，150来自5,000。现有的融合点不计入新的开放点。","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"我的游戏是否已上传或保存？","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"没有上传游戏。保存是可选的，并使用此设备上浏览器中的本地存储。","Rules and limitations":"规则和限制","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"这是一个休闲的两人游戏变体，对抗简单的本地计算机对手，而不是在线多人游戏或赌博。它使用常见的 5,000 点目标、15 牌发牌、两张牌抽牌和基于分数的开局阈值。牌桌规则有所不同：此版本不实施合伙人允许外出、特殊隐藏手牌奖金、红三替换选择或自定义房屋规则。如果牌库无法提供两张牌，则该轮计分。","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"免费玩。您的手牌和分数保留在此设备上的浏览器中；没有上传游戏数据。","Play Canasta":"玩 Canasta","Related tools":"相关工具","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免费 · 在您的浏览器中运行","Language":"语言","UsefulVerse":"有用的诗句","All tools":"所有工具","New round":"新一轮","Play next round":"进行下一轮比赛","Resume saved round":"恢复保存的回合","Delete saved round":"删除已保存的回合","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"开始一轮或恢复已保存的一轮。","You":"你","Computer":"电脑","Your hand":"你的手","Computer cards":"电脑卡","Stock":"库存","Discard pile":"废弃堆","Your melds":"您的融合","Draw two cards":"抽两张牌","Take discard pile":"取弃牌堆","Discard selected card":"丢弃选定的卡","Selected cards":"精选卡","Clear selection":"清除选择","Meld rank":"融合等级","Lay down meld":"放下熔体","Total score":"总分","Round points":"圆点","Opening meld needs":"打开融合需求","Turn":"转","Choose New round to begin.":"选择新一轮开始。","Round started. Draw two cards.":"回合开始。抽两张牌。","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"你的回合：从库存中抽两张牌或拿走弃牌堆。","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"如果你愿意，可以放下合法的组合，然后弃掉一张牌。","Computer is taking its turn…":"计算机正在轮流...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"抽到两张牌。进行融合或丢弃。","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"丢弃取走的一堆。进行融合或丢弃。","Meld placed.":"已放置融合。","Card discarded.":"卡已丢弃。","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"该行为不合法。检查规则和所选卡片。","You went out and won the round.":"您出局并赢得了这一轮。","The computer went out. Round scored.":"电脑坏了。本轮得分。","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"库存不能提供两张卡。本轮得分。","You reached the target and won the game!":"您达到了目标并赢得了比赛！","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"电脑达到目标并赢得了比赛。","The match is tied.":"比赛打平。","Clean canasta":"清洁canasta","Mixed canasta":"混合凯纳斯塔","You need a canasta before going out.":"出门前需要一瓶凯纳斯塔。","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"此浏览器中无法进行本地保存。当此页面保持打开状态时，您可以继续玩游戏。","Round saved on this device.":"回合保存在此设备上。","Saved round resumed.":"保存的回合已恢复。","Saved round deleted.":"已保存的回合已删除。","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"无法读取保存的回合。开始新一轮或删除损坏的保存。","Card":"卡","Wild":"野生","Frozen":"冷冻","Open":"打开","points":"点","Twos":"双","Threes":"三","Fours":"四人制","Fives":"五人组","Sixes":"六","Sevens":"七人制","Eights":"八位","Nines":"九","Tens":"十","Jacks":"插孔","Queens":"皇后区","Kings":"国王","Aces":"王牌","Hearts":"心","Diamonds":"钻石","Clubs":"球杆","Spades":"黑桃","Joker":"小丑","Rules overview":"规则概述","Canasta rules":"凯纳斯塔规则"},"zh_tw":{"Canasta":"凱納斯塔","Canasta Online — Free Canasta Card Game vs Computer":"Canasta Online — 免費 Canasta 紙牌遊戲 vs 電腦","Play two-player Canasta online against a local computer. Draw, meld, freeze and take the discard pile, build clean or mixed canastas and track the round score. Free; your cards stay on this device.":"在本地電腦上線上玩兩人 Canasta 遊戲。抽取、融合、凍結和拿走棄牌堆，構建乾淨或混合的卡納斯塔並跟踪回合得分。自由的;您的卡保留在此設備上。","Play a complete two-player Canasta round in your browser. Form melds of matching ranks, use twos and jokers as wild cards, and make a canasta of seven cards before going out.":"在瀏覽器中玩完整的兩人 Canasta 回合。形成匹配等級的組合，使用二號牌和百搭牌作為百搭牌，並在出去之前製作一張由七張牌組成的凱納斯塔。","A quick example":"一個簡單範例","Three natural Kings can open a meld. Add cards of that rank over later turns; seven natural cards make a clean canasta worth a 500-point bonus, while a meld with wild cards is a mixed canasta worth 300 bonus points.":"三個自然之王可以開啟融合。在以後的回合中添加該等級的牌；七張自然卡使乾淨的卡納斯塔價值 500 點獎勵，而與外卡混合則獲得價值 300 獎勵點的混合卡納斯塔。","How to play":"怎麼玩","This version uses two standard decks plus four jokers (108 cards), 15 cards per player and two cards drawn from the stock each turn. Meld at least three cards of one rank; twos and jokers are wild, with no more wild than natural cards. The first meld must meet the point threshold for your current score. A discard pile can be taken only with two natural cards matching its top card. A wild card or black three freezes the pile. You need at least one seven-card canasta to go out.":"此版本使用兩副標準牌，加上四張百搭牌（108 卡），每位玩家 15 卡，每回合從庫存中抽取兩張卡。融合至少三張同等級的牌；雙牌和王牌都是百搭牌，沒有比自然牌更百搭的牌。第一個組合必須滿足您目前分數的分數閾值。棄牌堆只能由兩張與其頂牌相符的自然牌取走。外卡或黑三將凍結牌堆。你至少需要一張七張卡納斯塔才能出去。","Frequently asked questions":"常見問題解答","What is a canasta?":"什麼是canasta？","A canasta is a meld of seven or more cards of the same rank. Seven natural cards make a clean canasta (500 bonus points); a meld containing a wild card is mixed (300 bonus points).":"canasta 是七張或更多相同等級的牌的組合。七張天然牌組成乾淨的凱納斯塔（500 獎勵積分）；包含通配符的組合被混合（300 獎勵積分）。","How do I take the discard pile?":"如何拿走棄牌堆？","Hold two natural cards matching the top discard. The pile is frozen when its top card is a wild card or black three. You must also be able to make a legal meld with the top card under your opening requirement.":"持有兩張與頂部棄牌相符的自然牌。當頂牌是外卡或黑三時，該牌堆被凍結。您還必須能夠根據您的開局要求與頂牌進行合法合併。","When can I go out?":"我什麼時候可以出去？","You may empty your hand only after your side has a seven-card canasta. The final card is discarded; this version does not use concealed-hand or partner-permission variations.":"只有在你方擁有七張卡納斯塔後，你才可以清空你的手牌。最後一張牌被丟棄；此版本不使用隱藏手或合作夥伴許可的變體。","How is the opening meld calculated?":"開局組合是如何計算的？","The minimum is 50 points below 1,500 cumulative points, 90 from 1,500, 120 from 3,000 and 150 from 5,000. Existing meld points are not counted toward a new opening.":"累積分數未滿 1,500 分時，起手最低須達 50 分；累積達 1,500、3,000、5,000 分時，起手最低分別為 90、120、150 分。既有牌組的分數不計入新開局的最低分。","Is my game uploaded or saved?":"我的遊戲是否已上傳或儲存？","No game is uploaded. Saving is optional and uses local storage in this browser on this device.":"沒有上傳任何遊戲。儲存是可選的，並使用此裝置上瀏覽器中的本機儲存。","Rules and limitations":"規則和限制","This is a casual two-player variant against a simple local computer opponent, not online multiplayer or gambling. It uses the common 5,000-point target, 15-card deal, two-card draw and score-based opening thresholds. Table rules differ: this version does not implement partnership permission to go out, special concealed-hand bonuses, red-three replacement choices, or custom house rules. If the stock cannot supply two cards, the round is scored.":"這是一種休閒的兩人遊戲變體，對抗簡單的本地電腦對手，而不是在線多人遊戲或賭博。它使用常見的 5,000 點目標、15 牌發牌、兩張牌抽牌和基於分數的開局閾值。牌桌規則有所不同：此版本不實施合夥人允許外出、特殊隱藏手牌獎金、紅三替換選擇或自訂房屋規則。如果牌庫無法提供兩張牌，則該輪計分。","Free to play. Your hand and score stay in this browser on this device; no game data is uploaded.":"免費玩。您的手牌和分數保留在此裝置上的瀏覽器中；沒有上傳遊戲資料。","Play Canasta":"玩卡納斯塔","Related tools":"相關工具","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免費 · 在您的瀏覽器中執行","Language":"語言","UsefulVerse":"有用的詩句","All tools":"所有工具","New round":"新一輪","Play next round":"進行下一輪比賽","Resume saved round":"恢復已儲存的回合","Delete saved round":"刪除已儲存的回合","Start a round or resume a saved one.":"開始一輪或恢復已儲存的一輪。","You":"你","Computer":"電腦","Your hand":"你的手","Computer cards":"電腦卡","Stock":"庫存","Discard pile":"廢棄堆","Your melds":"您的融合","Draw two cards":"抽兩張牌","Take discard pile":"取棄牌堆","Discard selected card":"丟棄選定的卡","Selected cards":"精選卡","Clear selection":"清除選擇","Meld rank":"融合等級","Lay down meld":"放下熔體","Total score":"總分","Round points":"圓點","Opening meld needs":"開啟融合需求","Turn":"轉","Choose New round to begin.":"選擇新一輪開始。","Round started. Draw two cards.":"回合開始。抽兩張牌。","Your turn: draw two cards from stock or take the discard pile.":"你的回合：從庫存中抽兩張牌或拿走棄牌堆。","Lay down legal melds if you wish, then discard one card.":"如果你願意，可以放下合法的組合，然後棄掉一張牌。","Computer is taking its turn…":"電腦正在輪流...","Two cards drawn. Make melds or discard.":"抽到兩張牌。進行融合或丟棄。","Discard pile taken. Make melds or discard.":"丟棄已拿走的一堆。進行融合或丟棄。","Meld placed.":"已放置融合。","Card discarded.":"卡片已丟棄。","That action is not legal. Check the rules and selected cards.":"該行為不合法。檢查規則和所選卡片。","You went out and won the round.":"您出局並贏得了這一輪。","The computer went out. Round scored.":"電腦壞了。本輪得分。","The stock cannot supply two cards. Round scored.":"庫存不能提供兩張卡。本輪得分。","You reached the target and won the game!":"您達到了目標並贏得了比賽！","The computer reached the target and won the game.":"電腦達到目標並贏得了比賽。","The match is tied.":"比賽平手。","Clean canasta":"清潔canasta","Mixed canasta":"混合凱納斯塔","You need a canasta before going out.":"出門前需要一瓶凱納斯塔。","Local saving is unavailable in this browser. You can keep playing while this page stays open.":"此瀏覽器中無法進行本機儲存。當此頁面保持開啟時，您可以繼續玩遊戲。","Round saved on this device.":"回合保存在此設備上。","Saved round resumed.":"已儲存的回合已恢復。","Saved round deleted.":"已儲存的回合已刪除。","Saved round could not be read. Start a new round or delete the damaged save.":"無法讀取已儲存的回合。開始新一輪或刪除損壞的保存。","Card":"卡","Wild":"野生","Frozen":"冷凍","Open":"開啟","points":"點","Twos":"雙","Threes":"三","Fours":"四人制","Fives":"五人組","Sixes":"六","Sevens":"七人制","Eights":"八位","Nines":"九","Tens":"十","Jacks":"插孔","Queens":"皇后區","Kings":"國王","Aces":"王牌","Hearts":"心","Diamonds":"鑽石","Clubs":"球桿","Spades":"黑桃","Joker":"小丑","Rules overview":"規則概述","Canasta rules":"凱納斯塔規則"}});
